—   |","table":"table-3"},"712":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-51","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比","content":"| 参数                   | 含义          | 单位    | 默认值或范围             | 要求  |\n| -------------------- | ----------- | ----- | ------------------ | --- |\n| 温度收敛容差、最大迭代次数、反馈松弛系数 | 求解内部的温度迭代控制 | K、—、— | 0–0.01 K；2–500；0–1 | —   |","table":"table-3"},"713":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-52","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比","content":"| 参数            | 含义           | 单位  | 默认值或范围     | 要求  |\n| ------------- | ------------ | --- | ---------- | --- |\n| 电流搜索上界、电流迭代容差 | 反求允许电流时的搜索设置 | A   | 迭代容差 0–1 A | —   |","table":"table-3"},"714":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-53","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比","content":"| 参数       | 含义                      | 单位  | 默认值或范围 | 要求                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------- | --- | ------ | ------------------- |\n| IEC 基线参数 | 集肤、邻近效应构造系数等，与 IEC 研究相同 | —   | —      | 须采用 IEC 2023 允许电流口径 |","table":"table-3"},"715":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-54","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比","content":"| 参数      | 含义                      | 单位  | 默认值或范围 | 要求         |\n| ------- | ----------------------- | --- | ------ | ---------- |\n| 确认均匀土对照 | 截面有分层土壤时，IEC 列只是均匀土壤的对照 | —   | 未勾选    | 有分层土壤时必须勾选 |","table":"table-3"},"716":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-55","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比","content":"| 参数   | 含义        | 单位  | 默认值或范围 | 要求  |\n| ---- | --------- | --- | ------ | --- |\n| 参数来源 | 本组参数的出处说明 | —   | —      | 必填  |","table":"table-3"},"717":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-56","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#有限元热场暂态护套损耗与电热耦合","content":"**打开哪里**：对应模块的 **方法参数** 页签，“本次计算参数”。先核对网格、计算域、材料来源和热边界，数值求解选项在“高级参数”中。"},"718":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-57","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#有限元热场暂态护套损耗与电热耦合","content":"| 研究      | 主要参数                                                     |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 电缆有限元热场 | 网格设置、温度收敛容差（K，0–0.001 K）、最大反馈次数（2–200）、反馈松弛系数（0–1）、侧边与底边 |","table":"table-4"},"719":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-58","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#有限元热场暂态护套损耗与电热耦合","content":"| 研究   | 主要参数                                          |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 暂态温升 | 暂态时间设置、网格设置、电阻计算温度（°C）；每个材料域的体积热容须有正文页码、表号与摘要 |","table":"table-4"},"720":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-59","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#有限元热场暂态护套损耗与电热耦合","content":"| 研究   | 主要参数                       |\n| ---- | -------------------------- |\n| 护套损耗 | 电磁领域绑定（相序与接地来源）、网格设置、损耗温度表 |","table":"table-4"},"721":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-60","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#有限元热场暂态护套损耗与电热耦合","content":"| 研究   | 主要参数                                                                   |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 电热耦合 | 热边界条件、材料有效温区、初始温度（°C）、温度迭代容差（K，0–0.01 K）、功率相对容差（0–0.001）、最大反馈次数、反馈松弛系数 |","table":"table-4"},"722":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-61","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#4-检查输入与预检","content":"**点什么**：温度场、暂态、护套损耗和电热耦合模块有 **检查输入**（超算未配置时也可以先做）和提交按钮；IEC 与有限元对比在命令栏点 **预检并运行**。"},"723":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-62","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#4-检查输入与预检","content":"**看到什么**：“预检步骤”区域分两行："},"724":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-63","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#4-检查输入与预检","content":"**输入完整性与范围**：“已通过输入检查”，或“请修正下列缺项”并逐条列出；"},"725":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-64","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#4-检查输入与预检","content":"**原生环境**：“已通过超算原生预检”，或“未通过，请核对下列说明”。"},"726":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-65","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#4-检查输入与预检","content":"“超算核时预算”区域显示“提交 <分区> · 本次核时预算上限 X 核时”和每个工况的节点（自由度）与单元数。实际核时以 Slurm 记账为准。全部通过后，勾选确认并点 **确认并运行**。"},"727":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-66","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#5-提交与进度","content":"**看到什么**：“超算运行记录”显示状态（准备、已提交、后处理、连接中断、正在取消）、作业号（尚未分配时为“等待 Slurm 回执”）、已用核时与预算以及排队位置。"},"728":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-67","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#5-提交与进度","content":"**可以做什么**：**停止** 当前作业；连接中断后 **恢复原作业** 继续读取原作业，不重新提交；**重新读取进度**。读取失败不会改变已保存的运行。"},"729":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-68","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#6-收敛研究","content":"有限元结果必须有合格的收敛证据，才显示为正式值并允许正式导出。两类研究的判据不同。"},"730":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-69","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#iec-与有限元对比-1","content":"收敛检查在一次运行内完成：按“多档网格比例”逐档求解，再把计算域放大后求解一次。最后两档网格之间、以及最细网格与放大计算域之间，最高温度变化都不超过“温度迭代容差”（默认 0.1 K）、允许电流变化都不超过“载流量校核容差”（默认 0.5 A），才算通过；两项都通过后才输出与 IEC 的偏差结论。"},"731":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-70","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"**打开哪里**：温度场模块的 **收敛** 页签，“自动加密与扩域”。"},"732":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-71","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"**点什么**：**设置收敛预算**，在“确认收敛研究预算”中填写累计核时预算（大于 0，不超过 2000），点 **确认预算并开始**。"},"733":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-72","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"**看到什么**："},"734":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-73","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"逐级提交：每级网格减半或计算域加倍，最多 12 级；完整计算网格上限 400 万节点；达到门槛即停，资源不足或预算耗尽时保留已有结果。"},"735":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-74","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"收敛判据：“网格与扩域各连续两级变化均小于 X K”（默认 0.1 K）。达到后显示“保存核验已达到门槛 · 门槛 0.1 K”，并在最终网格上反求允许电流。"},"736":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-75","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"“自动收敛保存记录”表逐级列出级别、网格（m）、域深（m）、自由度、热点温度（°C）、变化（K）、核时、墙钟时间（s）和保存运行；图中给出逐级网格与扩域的热点温差。"},"737":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-76","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"边界说明：“Kennelly 镜像远场”或“环境定温截断”，以及“地表等温”。"},"738":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-77","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"**可以做什么**：**停止后续级别**、**恢复原作业**、**回收原作业结果**、**完成载流量封存**、**用当前版本继续**、**重试**。"},"739":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-78","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"| 提示                  | 处理                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 尚未收敛：网格与扩域未达到连续两级门槛 | 增加预算继续，或检查网格与计算域设置 |","table":"table-5"},"740":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-79","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"| 提示                   | 处理             |\n| -------------------- | -------------- |\n| 温度收敛已达标；最终允许电流运行失败：… | 按失败原因处理后重试最终一级 |","table":"table-5"},"741":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-80","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#电缆有限元热场自动加密与扩域","content":"| 提示                     | 处理   |\n| ---------------------- | ---- |\n| 累计核时预算须大于 0 且不超过 2000。 | 修正预算 |","table":"table-5"},"742":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-81","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签            | 内容                    | 怎么判读                                                 |\n| ------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 结果、结果与 IEC 对照 | 导体温度、允许电流及与 IEC 结果的对照 | 两者模型假设不同（有限计算域与半无限土壤、集总温度与层内梯度等），差异本身不是误差证明；报告写明差异来源 |","table":"table-6"},"743":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-82","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签  | 内容                   | 怎么判读                   |\n| --- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 场图  | 温度分布、等温线和最热点，按物理尺度绘制 | 没有有效结果时显示“无数据”，不绘制替代的场 |","table":"table-6"},"744":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-83","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签  | 内容      | 怎么判读 |\n| --- | ------- | ---- |\n| 取样  | 指定位置的温度 | —    |","table":"table-6"},"745":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-84","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签   | 内容              | 怎么判读               |\n| ---- | --------------- | ------------------ |\n| 时间序列 | 暂态研究中导体温度随时间的变化 | 温限时刻由实际时间步线性插值，不外推 |","table":"table-6"},"746":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-85","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签   | 内容            | 怎么判读                |\n| ---- | ------------- | ------------------- |\n| 损耗系数 | 护套损耗研究得到的损耗系数 | 用作 IEC 外部系数时须在声明范围内 |","table":"table-6"},"747":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-86","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"| 页签    | 内容                 | 怎么判读            |\n| ----- | ------------------ | --------------- |\n| 诊断、收敛 | 求解器、网格、能量平衡和逐级收敛记录 | 没有达到门槛的结果不能正式导出 |","table":"table-6"},"748":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-87","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#7-读结果","content":"对照类结果标为“仅供参考，未经工程批准”，不自动批准，也不代替 IEC 载流量。"},"749":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-88","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"**打开哪里**：侧栏 **记录 → 运行与作业**。"},"750":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-89","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"**看到什么**：“所有研究超算作业”表列出研究与运行、Slurm 作业号、状态、已用核时（未结算时显示“未结算”）、开始与结束时间，每页 20 项。**作业详情** 显示所属工程、所属研究、记录、作业号、状态和已用 / 预算核时；**核对状态** 向超算重新查询。"},"751":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-90","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态            | 含义          |\n| ------------- | ----------- |\n| 排队、已提交、准备中、运行 | 作业在超算上排队或运行 |","table":"table-7"},"752":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-91","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态       | 含义             |\n| -------- | -------------- |\n| 后处理、回收结果 | 求解完成，正在核验和取回结果 |","table":"table-7"},"753":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-92","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态  | 含义       |\n| --- | -------- |\n| 已封存 | 结果已核验并保存 |","table":"table-7"},"754":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-93","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态   | 含义     |\n| ---- | ------ |\n| 部分完成 | 部分工况成功 |","table":"table-7"},"755":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-94","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态  | 含义           |\n| --- | ------------ |\n| 失败  | 作业失败，原因见作业详情 |","table":"table-7"},"756":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-95","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态       | 含义                  |\n| -------- | ------------------- |\n| 连接中断、待恢复 | 与超算的连接中断，原作业保留，可以恢复 |","table":"table-7"},"757":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-96","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态        | 含义        |\n| --------- | --------- |\n| 取消待确认、已取消 | 已请求取消或已取消 |","table":"table-7"},"758":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-97","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#8-超算作业列表","content":"| 状态          | 含义               |\n| ----------- | ---------------- |\n| 资源不足、达到预算上限 | 资源或核时预算不足，已有结果保留 |","table":"table-7"},"759":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-98","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#9-没有配置超算时","content":"“求解位置”显示超算方法“未配置”，预检提示“超算未配置，请前往设置 → 计算位置。输入已保存。”，**确认并运行** 不可用。"},"760":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-99","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#9-没有配置超算时","content":"**检查输入** 仍可在本机完成；IEC 60287 等解析计算、参数扫描、标准核对、正式交付和备份恢复照常可用；已保存并通过校验的仿真结果仍可查看。"},"761":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-100","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示          | 原因             | 处理               |\n| ----------- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| 本方法不能在本机求解。 | 方法只在超算运行，超算未配置 | 先“检查输入”；配置超算后再提交 |","table":"table-8"},"762":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-101","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                                          | 原因             | 处理       |\n| ------------------------------------------- | -------------- | -------- |\n| 配置与能力声明冲突；超算路由与能力声明冲突，请由管理员修正配置后重新预检。输入已保存。 | 计算位置配置与插件声明不一致 | 由管理员修正配置 |","table":"table-8"},"763":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-102","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示               | 原因          | 处理    |\n| ---------------- | ----------- | ----- |\n| 已有超算配置无效，请修正后保存。 | 保存的配置不完整或无效 | 修正后保存 |","table":"table-8"},"764":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-103","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示           | 原因          | 处理  |\n| ------------ | ----------- | --- |\n| 先保存修改，再检查连接。 | 超算设置有未保存的修改 | 先保存 |","table":"table-8"},"765":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-104","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示       | 原因       | 处理   |\n| -------- | -------- | ---- |\n| 计算位置暂不可读 | 读取能力声明失败 | 重新读取 |","table":"table-8"},"766":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-105","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示             | 原因       | 处理     |\n| -------------- | -------- | ------ |\n| 输入有未保存修改，请先保存。 | 有尚未保存的修改 | 保存后再预检 |","table":"table-8"},"767":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-106","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                     | 原因                             | 处理                          |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 比较须采用 IEC 2023 允许电流口径。 | IEC 与有限元对比选择了只求温度或 TB 880 参考口径 | 把 IEC 基线参数改为 IEC 2023、求允许电流 |","table":"table-8"},"768":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-107","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                              | 原因                    | 处理   |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---- |\n| 分层土壤的 IEC 列仅为均匀土壤对照；请明确确认此对照口径。 | 截面有分层土壤，没有勾选“确认均匀土对照” | 勾选确认 |","table":"table-8"},"769":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-108","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                 | 原因             | 处理          |\n| ------------------ | -------------- | ----------- |\n| 所选截面需包含被比较回路的全部电缆。 | 敷设截面与被比较的回路不一致 | 选择包含全部电缆的截面 |","table":"table-8"},"770":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-109","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                            | 原因       | 处理                     |\n| ----------------------------- | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| 超算进度读取失败，保存运行未改变；进度连接中断，原作业保留 | 与超算的连接中断 | **重新读取进度** 或 **恢复原作业** |","table":"table-8"},"771":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-110","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示            | 原因          | 处理   |\n| ------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| 运行操作失败，原运行已保留 | 停止或恢复操作没有成功 | 稍后重试 |","table":"table-8"},"772":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-111","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示       | 原因                   | 处理            |\n| -------- | -------------------- | ------------- |\n| 运行完整性未通过 | 保存的运行与工件核对不一致，拒绝显示数值 | 保留现场，交给维护人员核对 |","table":"table-8"},"773":{"id":"/docs/guide/simulation-112","page_id":"/docs/guide/simulation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/simulation#10-状态与报错","content":"| 提示                                   | 原因      | 处理    |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------- | ----- |\n| 插件校验失败，请联系管理员重新安装或校验插件。保存的输入和运行记录不变。 | 插件封签不一致 | 见常见问题 |","table":"table-8"},"774":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"page","content":"型号设计","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","用户指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design"},"775":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-0","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design","content":"分步说明型号设计：新建型号、编辑结构、声明执行标准、标准核对、电气参数与短路容量、载流量表、方案对比、规格书、审核与发布、批量操作，以及各状态与报错的处理。"},"776":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-1","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"打开与新建"},"777":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-2","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#工作区","content":"工作区"},"778":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-3","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"1. 结构设计"},"779":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-4","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#2-要求与标准","content":"2. 要求与标准"},"780":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-5","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"3. 标准核对"},"781":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-6","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"4. 电气参数与短路容量"},"782":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-7","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"5. 载流量表"},"783":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-8","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#6-方案对比","content":"6. 方案对比"},"784":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-9","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"7. 规格书"},"785":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-10","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"8. 审核与发布"},"786":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-11","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"9. 批量操作"},"787":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-12","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"状态与报错"},"788":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-13","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design","content":"型号设计是一个电缆型号的工作区：结构、执行标准、标准核对、电气参数、短路容量、载流量表、方案和规格书都在这里完成。上游修改后，依赖它的结果标为过期，需要重新计算；已发布的版本只读，修改须建立新方案。"},"789":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-14","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"**打开哪里**：侧栏 **型号设计**。列表可以按名称查找、按发布状态筛选和分组，点型号名进入它的结构页。"},"790":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-15","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"**新建**：点 **新建型号**，在“新建型号设计”对话框中选择起点："},"791":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-16","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 起点     | 填什么         | 点什么      |\n| ------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| 从型号库复制 | 查找型号，选择型号版本 | **建立草稿** |","table":"table-0"},"792":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-17","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 起点    | 填什么                                                                                                     | 点什么                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 按标准生成 | 生成范围、结构类型、额定电压、导体材料、导体截面（mm²）、导体几何、导体外径（mm）；多芯时还有芯间最小净距、中性线截面与外径、填充外包厚度、包带等效厚度；完整护层另有半导电屏蔽、护层构造及屏蔽与铜带参数 | **生成结构提案**，核对“结构提案”表，勾选“已核对标准值、推导条件与缺项”，再点 **确认并建立草稿** |","table":"table-0"},"793":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-18","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 起点    | 填什么                 | 点什么        |\n| ----- | ------------------- | ---------- |\n| 从资料导入 | 打开资料导入，选择已批准的厂家资料结果 | 见型号库与结构表导入 |","table":"table-0"},"794":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-19","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 起点  | 填什么              | 点什么      |\n| --- | ---------------- | -------- |\n| 空白  | 结构类型：单芯、三芯或四芯等截面 | **建立草稿** |","table":"table-0"},"795":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-20","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"型号名称最多 80 字。按标准生成只给出标准规定的数值，标准未规定的尺寸（如导体外径）须由工程师提供并注明依据；缺少的物性和制造数据保持缺项。"},"796":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-21","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示             | 处理     |\n| -------------- | ------ |\n| 请填写型号名称，再建立草稿。 | 填写型号名称 |","table":"table-1"},"797":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-22","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示                   | 处理     |\n| -------------------- | ------ |\n| 请选择一个可复制的型号版本，再建立草稿。 | 选择型号版本 |","table":"table-1"},"798":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-23","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示               | 处理     |\n| ---------------- | ------ |\n| 请选择额定电压，再生成结构提案。 | 选择额定电压 |","table":"table-1"},"799":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-24","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示                     | 处理            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 请选择导体几何，明确推导条件或提供导体外径。 | 选择导体几何或填写导体外径 |","table":"table-1"},"800":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-25","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示                           | 处理    |\n| ---------------------------- | ----- |\n| 请先核对结构提案中的标准值、推导条件与缺项，并勾选确认。 | 核对后勾选 |","table":"table-1"},"801":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-26","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#打开与新建","content":"| 提示                        | 处理          |\n| ------------------------- | ----------- |\n| 当前版本没有可用的结构提案方法，暂不能按标准生成。 | 检查标准核对插件的安装 |","table":"table-1"},"802":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-27","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#工作区","content":"**左侧“型号浏览器”**分四组：结构（每个结构一项，如“结构 · 3 芯 · 9 层”）；要求（要求与标准、标准核对）；分析（电气参数、短路容量、载流量表、方案对比）；交付（规格书）。各项右侧标明状态。"},"803":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-28","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#工作区","content":"**命令栏**：保存、撤销、重做、**用于载流量研究**、规格书，以及当前模块的主操作。"},"804":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-29","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#工作区","content":"**型号名称**旁的编辑按钮打开“修改型号名称”（最多 200 字），修改写入草稿，需另行保存。"},"805":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-30","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#工作区","content":"页头状态：已保存、未保存、读取中、保存失败、读取失败；只读状态为“保存运行 · 只读”“历史 · 只读”“已发布 · 只读”。型号含演示来源时另加“· 演示”，提示核对各字段的工程依据。"},"806":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-31","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**打开哪里**：型号浏览器“结构”组。页签为截面、三维剥切、分层表、材料核对、外径与用料。"},"807":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-32","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**添加结构层**：在截面或分层表中选中一层，点 **添加结构层**，新层插入所选层之前（未选层时插入外护套之前），点 **添加到草稿**。"},"808":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-33","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 字段   | 含义      | 单位  | 示例  | 要求  |\n| ---- | ------- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 所属位置 | 共同层或某一芯 | —   | 共同层 | —   |","table":"table-2"},"809":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-34","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 字段  | 含义   | 单位  | 示例  | 要求       |\n| --- | ---- | --- | --- | -------- |\n| 结构层 | 层的类型 | —   | 隔离层 | 同一位置不能重复 |","table":"table-2"},"810":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-35","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 字段   | 含义           | 单位  | 示例  | 要求                      |\n| ---- | ------------ | --- | --- | ----------------------- |\n| 新层材料 | 从本型号已有的材料中选择 | —   | —   | 与资源库固定材料版本的绑定在“材料核对”中完成 |","table":"table-2"},"811":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-36","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 字段   | 含义  | 单位  | 示例  | 要求                      |\n| ---- | --- | --- | --- | ----------------------- |\n| 新层厚度 | 层厚  | mm  | 0.2 | 必须大于 0；没有工程依据时来源显示“未提供” |","table":"table-2"},"812":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-37","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 字段   | 含义               | 单位  | 示例     | 要求  |\n| ---- | ---------------- | --- | ------ | --- |\n| 新层构造 | 未给定、挤包或连续层、带层、丝层 | —   | 挤包或连续层 | —   |","table":"table-2"},"813":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-38","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**删除结构层**：选中后点 **删除结构层**，确认后删除。修改可以撤销，保存后需要重新计算受影响的结果。"},"814":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-39","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**分层表**：每层的材料引用、尺寸（层厚或导体直径，扇形导体为扇形高度）和来源；“绘图外径”逐层累加，只读。"},"815":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-40","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**材料核对**：每层材料绑定到资源库中已发布的固定材料版本。批量绑定按同名同类预选，没有唯一匹配时不自动绑定。"},"816":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-41","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"**外径与用料**：点 **更新结构推导**，预检后勾选“已核对输入来源与方法适用范围”，点 **确认并运行**。结果给出成品外径（mm）、理论每公里重量（kg/km）和建模长度（m），“外径与用料”表逐层列出体积（m³/km）、密度（kg/m³）、用量（kg/km）和依据。缺少密度或构造输入时明确提示，不估算。"},"817":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-42","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 提示               | 处理     |\n| ---------------- | ------ |\n| 请选择结构层、材料并填写正厚度。 | 补齐后再添加 |","table":"table-3"},"818":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-43","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 提示                  | 处理    |\n| ------------------- | ----- |\n| 该位置已存在相同结构层，请编辑已有层。 | 编辑已有层 |","table":"table-3"},"819":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-44","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 提示              | 处理   |\n| --------------- | ---- |\n| 当前 CAD 支持最多16芯。 | 减少芯数 |","table":"table-3"},"820":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-45","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 提示      | 处理                                                                  |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 截面暂不可绘制 | 点“定位……尺寸”或“定位……位置”按钮（例如“定位芯 1 · 绝缘尺寸”）跳到出错的字段，或“撤销上一步修改”；原因在“诊断详情”中 |","table":"table-3"},"821":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-46","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#1-结构设计","content":"| 提示                       | 处理        |\n| ------------------------ | --------- |\n| 以下为历史推导；保存修改后点击『更新结构推导』。 | 保存后更新结构推导 |","table":"table-3"},"822":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-47","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#2-要求与标准","content":"**打开哪里**：型号浏览器 **要求与标准**，页签为要求清单、执行标准、待批准导入。"},"823":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-48","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#2-要求与标准","content":"**声明执行标准**：在“执行标准”页签点 **声明执行标准**，在“确认执行标准版本”中勾选“已核对执行标准版本”，点 **确认执行标准并查询依据**。声明保存为新修订并查询依据，旧判定保留为历史；要求的批准需要另行确认。完成后显示“执行版本已声明”，表中列出标准及版本、覆盖条款和依据。"},"824":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-49","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#2-要求与标准","content":"**批准要求**：在“要求清单”点 **生成要求目录**（已有时为 **更新要求目录**），勾选要求，点 **批准所选要求**，填写审批人，勾选“本人已核对所选要求的来源和判定绑定”后确认。这一步不批准计算结果，也不发布型号。"},"825":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-50","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#2-要求与标准","content":"要求的状态：待批准、已批准、版本冲突、未定义 / 未覆盖；缺字段的要求标为“待补数据”，不能批准。不适用于本型号结构的条款收在“不适用条款”中。"},"826":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-51","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"**打开哪里**：型号浏览器 **标准核对**。"},"827":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-52","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"**点什么**：**执行标准核对**，预检后 **确认并运行**。"},"828":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-53","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"**看到什么**：表格逐项列出要求、余量和判定。汇总为“声明范围内要求满足”“N 项不满足”“核对尚未完整覆盖”或“暂无适用要求”，另列“N 项待补数据”“N 项未覆盖”。右侧“依据”给出该次运行的条款、输入来源、公式中间值和摘要。"},"829":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-54","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"**怎么判读**："},"830":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-55","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义              | 下一步 |\n| --- | --------------- | --- |\n| 满足  | 有完整输入和标准依据，判定满足 | —   |","table":"table-4"},"831":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-56","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义    | 下一步                      |\n| --- | ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 不满足 | 判定不满足 | 点 **定位结构层** 修改结构，保存后重新核对 |","table":"table-4"},"832":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-57","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 判定   | 含义                 | 下一步           |\n| ---- | ------------------ | ------------- |\n| 待补数据 | 缺少判定所需的数值，或需要出厂实测值 | 补齐有来源的输入后重新核对 |","table":"table-4"},"833":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-58","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义                          | 下一步                  |\n| --- | --------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 未覆盖 | 依据库尚未收录该条款或版本（依据显示“本库暂未收录”） | 由工程师按标准原文人工核对，不能视为满足 |","table":"table-4"},"834":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-59","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"**运行失败时**：界面显示该次运行的实际错误和缺失字段的位置；没有具体原因时显示“本次运行未取得有效结果，请查看运行记录中的失败诊断，不采用预检结论作为计算结果。”原始错误放在“诊断详情”中。常见原因："},"835":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-60","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 提示                                 | 处理            |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| 当前标准依据与本次校核条件不一致，请在方法参数中重新核对并查询依据。 | 重新声明执行标准并查询依据 |","table":"table-5"},"836":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-61","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 提示       | 处理      |\n| -------- | ------- |\n| 待补字段 · N | 按列表补齐字段 |","table":"table-5"},"837":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-62","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 提示                 | 处理     |\n| ------------------ | ------ |\n| 结构缺项 · 先补齐型号名片中的字段 | 补齐后再运行 |","table":"table-5"},"838":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-63","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 提示                           | 处理            |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------- |\n| 标准核对插件文件与发布记录不一致，请联系管理员重新安装。 | 插件封签不一致，见常见问题 |","table":"table-5"},"839":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-64","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"| 提示                          | 处理        |\n| --------------------------- | --------- |\n| 输入或方法已变化；保留原要求与判定，人工批准保持关闭。 | 重新核对后才能批准 |","table":"table-5"},"840":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-65","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#3-标准核对","content":"方法原理与判定依据见标准核对。"},"841":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-66","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"**打开哪里**：型号浏览器 **电气参数** 或 **短路容量**，页签为“结果”和“方法参数”。"},"842":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-67","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"**填什么**（“方法参数”页签）："},"843":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-68","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"| 参数  | 含义   | 单位  | 常见取值 | 要求                             |\n| --- | ---- | --- | ---- | ------------------------------ |\n| 频率  | 电源频率 | Hz  | 50   | 页面给出的 50 Hz 是明示的试算初值，须核对实际电源频率 |","table":"table-6"},"844":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-69","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"| 参数    | 含义        | 单位    | 常见取值               | 要求           |\n| ----- | --------- | ----- | ------------------ | ------------ |\n| 运行相电压 | 导体对地电压 U₀ | **V** | 8.7/15 kV 电缆填 8700 | 按 V 填写，不是 kV |","table":"table-6"},"845":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-70","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"| 参数   | 含义     | 单位  | 常见取值 | 要求     |\n| ---- | ------ | --- | ---- | ------ |\n| 持续时间 | 短路持续时间 | s   | —    | 短路容量需要 |","table":"table-6"},"846":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-71","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"每个参数都要写明出处，缺少出处的参数不产生对应的计算结果。修改的参数来源记为“工程师在方法参数中填写；未经批准”。点 **保存方法条件** 后才能运行；**试算** 的结果标为“试算 · 未保存 · 不作为发布依据”。"},"847":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-72","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"**点什么**：在“结果”页签点 **计算电气参数** 或 **计算短路容量**，预检后确认运行。"},"848":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-73","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#4-电气参数与短路容量","content":"**看到什么**：汇总“N 项已计算”“N 项待补数据”“N 项未覆盖或拒绝”。电气参数包括导体直流与交流电阻、集肤与邻近因数、电容、充电电流和介质损耗；短路容量另给出电流—持续时间曲线。依据见型号电气参数与短路容量。"},"849":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-74","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"一个型号的载流量表由若干工况组成，每个工况一个允许电流。"},"850":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-75","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"**添加工况**：点 **添加工况**，填写后点 **添加到工况表**："},"851":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-76","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段   | 含义      | 要求  |\n| ---- | ------- | --- |\n| 工况名称 | 工况的中文名称 | —   |","table":"table-7"},"852":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-77","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段   | 含义                                                                 | 要求    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| 工况排列 | 单芯：直埋 · 品字、直埋 · 水平、排管 · 品字、空气；三芯：三芯直埋 · 单回、三芯直埋 · 三回水平、三芯排管 · 三回水平 | 按结构可选 |","table":"table-7"},"853":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-78","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段   | 含义         | 要求                  |\n| ---- | ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 交流频率 | 电源频率，单位 Hz | 大于 0、不超过 1000，默认 50 |","table":"table-7"},"854":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-79","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"**编辑工况条件**：在“结果表”中选中工况，编辑“所选工况条件”："},"855":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-80","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段    | 含义                           | 单位  | 示例     | 要求     |\n| ----- | ---------------------------- | --- | ------ | ------ |\n| 载流量口径 | “全回路等负荷”，或“首回路变化，其他回路保持保存负荷” | —   | 全回路等负荷 | 每行单独设置 |","table":"table-8"},"856":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-81","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段  | 含义   | 单位  | 示例  | 要求  |\n| --- | ---- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 环境  | 环境温度 | °C  | 25  | —   |","table":"table-8"},"857":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-82","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段   | 含义  | 单位  | 示例  | 要求  |\n| ---- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 中心埋深 | —   | m   | 0.7 | —   |","table":"table-8"},"858":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-83","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段    | 含义  | 单位    | 示例      | 要求  |\n| ----- | --- | ----- | ------- | --- |\n| 土壤热阻率 | —   | K·m/W | 1.0、1.5 | —   |","table":"table-8"},"859":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-84","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段  | 含义       | 单位  | 示例  | 要求  |\n| --- | -------- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 中心距 | 相邻电缆中心距离 | m   | —   | —   |","table":"table-8"},"860":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-85","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段  | 含义            | 单位  | 示例   | 要求       |\n| --- | ------------- | --- | ---- | -------- |\n| 接地  | 两端接地、单点接地或待明确 | —   | 两端接地 | 待明确时不能计算 |","table":"table-8"},"861":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-86","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段            | 含义       | 单位      | 示例  | 要求     |\n| ------------- | -------- | ------- | --- | ------ |\n| 管内径、管外径、管材热阻率 | 排管的几何与材料 | m、K·m/W | —   | 排管工况需要 |","table":"table-8"},"862":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-87","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"| 字段   | 含义      | 单位  | 示例  | 要求  |\n| ---- | ------- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 条件来源 | 本行条件的出处 | —   | —   | 必填  |","table":"table-8"},"863":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-88","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"**点什么**：勾选工况，点 **计算所选工况**，预检后确认运行。"},"864":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-89","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"**看到什么**：“载流量表”列出计算、工况、允许电流（A）、状态、余量（A）和条件，最多 100 行。状态为已计算、未运行、计算失败、待补数据、输入错误或超出范围；拒算的工况保留原因。"},"865":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-90","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#5-载流量表","content":"“方法参数”页签只编辑全表共用的方法参数；每行的排列、环境和载流量口径在“结果表 → 所选工况条件”中修改。四芯及 3+1 芯结构显示“四芯载流量 · 方法未覆盖”，可以点 **新建载流量研究** 改用适用的方法。需要更深入地研究某个工况时，点 **用于载流量研究** 以这个型号新建研究。依据见型号载流量表。"},"866":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-91","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#6-方案对比","content":"用于比较同一型号的不同设计方案，并把选定的方案采纳为新版本草稿。"},"867":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-92","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#6-方案对比","content":"**建立方案**：点 **建立方案**，填写方案名称（最多 80 字），点 **建立方案**。方案从当前已保存版本分支，原版本的计算结果不会成为新方案的当前结果。"},"868":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-93","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#6-方案对比","content":"**比较**：页签为“结果矩阵”（方案结果矩阵与全部适用要求对比）、“参数差异”和“截面对比”。指标包括外径、单位长度用料、导体铜用料和标准核对通过情况；要求判定为满足、不满足、缺项或未覆盖，另有未运行、历史和无法判断。单元格中的 **补结构数据**、**打开标准核对** 跳到对应位置。"},"869":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-94","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#6-方案对比","content":"**采纳为新版本草稿**：在“采纳方案”中选择方案，点 **采纳为新版本草稿**，勾选“已核对方案、全部要求与保存结果；采纳不代表批准或发布”，点 **确认采纳**。缺项和未覆盖项随草稿保留。完成后可以 **打开新草稿规格书**。"},"870":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-95","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**打开哪里**：型号浏览器 **规格书**，页签为内容、预览、审核与发布、修订记录。"},"871":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-96","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**点什么**："},"872":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-97","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**生成规格书**：按需补算结构、电气、载流量、短路和标准核对五部分，生成当前版本并下载 PDF。被预检阻止时显示“查看结构推导条件”等入口。"},"873":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-98","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**文档版本**：客户版或内部审核版；内部审核版可以 **导出内部审核稿**，缺项随文列出。"},"874":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-99","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**正式交付（PDF / Excel）**：填写单位名称、文件编号和版次，核对来源与签栏后下载，见正式交付文件。"},"875":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-100","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"**看到什么**：规格书共八章：封面、标准、结构、电气、载流、短路、核对、修订，客户版第 7 章为“标准核对表”，第 8 章为“文档修订记录与来源”。状态为草稿、待人工审核、已批准、已发布或已过期。"},"876":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-101","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"| 提示                           | 处理      |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- |\n| 已过期：输入或来源已变化；重新生成后才能交付当前客户版。 | 重新生成规格书 |","table":"table-9"},"877":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-102","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"| 提示                    | 处理               |\n| --------------------- | ---------------- |\n| 当前规格书来源已过期，请先重新生成并保存。 | 正式交付不可用；重新生成后再导出 |","table":"table-9"},"878":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-103","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"| 提示                            | 处理      |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- |\n| 生成期间输入发生变化；已完成运行已保存，请保存后重新生成。 | 保存后重新生成 |","table":"table-9"},"879":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-104","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#7-规格书","content":"| 提示          | 处理     |\n| ----------- | ------ |\n| 请先保存型号与方法条件 | 保存后再生成 |","table":"table-9"},"880":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-105","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"**打开哪里**：规格书的 **审核与发布** 页签。"},"881":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-106","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"**看到什么**：“N 项阻止发布”，按以下几组列出，每项都有处理入口："},"882":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-107","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"| 分组       | 含义         |\n| -------- | ---------- |\n| 需要工程师补输入 | 缺少有来源的设计输入 |","table":"table-10"},"883":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-108","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"| 分组      | 含义            |\n| ------- | ------------- |\n| 需要出厂实测值 | 标准要求按实测值判定的项目 |","table":"table-10"},"884":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-109","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"| 分组      | 含义         |\n| ------- | ---------- |\n| 标准依据未覆盖 | 依据库尚未收录的条款 |","table":"table-10"},"885":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-110","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"| 分组     | 含义                          |\n| ------ | --------------------------- |\n| 需要人工批准 | 执行标准声明、要求审核、材料固定版本核对等人工确认关口 |","table":"table-10"},"886":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-111","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"某一项不在本次发布范围内时，点 **声明本次发布不含此项**，填写不含原因（至少 5 个字），点 **本人确认不含此项**；该项移到“已声明不含”组，规格书封面列出“本次发布不含项”及原因和声明人。**撤销声明** 可以收回。"},"887":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-112","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"**发布流程**："},"888":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-113","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"阻止项处理完后点 **采纳为版本草稿**。"},"889":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-114","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"**提交评审**：填写变更摘要（最多 500 字）和编制人（最多 120 字），勾选“已核对当前版本与提交前校核清单”。状态变为待人工审核。"},"890":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-115","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"审核人点 **人工批准**，勾选“我本人已核对来源、校核清单并确认此操作”。"},"891":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-116","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"点 **发布型号版本**，同样勾选确认。发布后版本内容固定，按钮变为 **导出 PDF**。"},"892":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-117","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"提交评审绑定当时的内容摘要；内容变化后原提交失效，需要重新提交。导出或下载文件不会改变审核和发布状态。"},"893":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-118","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#8-审核与发布","content":"**修订记录** 页签的“文档修订记录”列出每次提交的文件版本、变更摘要、编制人和日期；尚未提交时显示“尚未提交文档评审”。"},"894":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-119","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"**打开哪里**：型号设计列表的“型号批量操作”。"},"895":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-120","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"勾选型号，在 **批量操作** 中选择生成规格书、下载规格书、建立方案或提交审核；生成与下载还要选择客户版或内部审核版。"},"896":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-121","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"点 **预览批量操作**，逐项核对每个型号是否可操作，以及不能操作的原因。"},"897":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-122","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"勾选确认后点 **确认<操作>（N 项）**。执行中可以 **停止剩余项**；结束后可以 **重新核对未完成项**。"},"898":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-123","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"提交审核只提交已采纳的新版本草稿，可以“统一填写”编制人和变更摘要后“应用到可提交项”。建立方案的名称为 1–80 字。"},"899":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-124","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示               | 处理   |\n| ---------------- | ---- |\n| 先勾选列表中的型号，再预览操作。 | 勾选型号 |","table":"table-11"},"900":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-125","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示                | 处理    |\n| ----------------- | ----- |\n| 请先在方案对比中采纳为新版本草稿。 | 先采纳方案 |","table":"table-11"},"901":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-126","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示                       | 处理      |\n| ------------------------ | ------- |\n| 已发布版本不可再次提交；需要修改时请先建立方案。 | 建立方案后修改 |","table":"table-11"},"902":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-127","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示                             | 处理        |\n| ------------------------------ | --------- |\n| 当前有 N 项阻止发布的校核问题，请在规格书页处理后再提交。 | 到审核与发布中处理 |","table":"table-11"},"903":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-128","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示                       | 处理      |\n| ------------------------ | ------- |\n| 规格书引用了历史结果，请生成当前规格书后再提交。 | 重新生成规格书 |","table":"table-11"},"904":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-129","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#9-批量操作","content":"| 提示                                | 处理     |\n| --------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 尚无当前有效的规格书结果；请先生成，或选择内部审核版查看真实缺项。 | 先生成规格书 |","table":"table-11"},"905":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-130","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                    | 原因       | 处理         |\n| --------------------- | -------- | ---------- |\n| N 处未保存 · 保存后重算受影响的结果。 | 有尚未保存的修改 | 保存（Ctrl+S） |","table":"table-12"},"906":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-131","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示       | 原因       | 处理                 |\n| -------- | -------- | ------------------ |\n| 型号有未保存修改 | 离开页面时有草稿 | 保存后再离开，或点“放弃修改并离开” |","table":"table-12"},"907":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-132","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                  | 原因         | 处理  |\n| ------------------- | ---------- | --- |\n| 请先保存结构修改 / 请先保存方法条件 | 运行前有未保存的修改 | 先保存 |","table":"table-12"},"908":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-133","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示         | 原因       | 处理      |\n| ---------- | -------- | ------- |\n| 已过期 · 方法 … | 输入或方法已变化 | 重新运行该模块 |","table":"table-12"},"909":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-134","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示   | 原因       | 处理    |\n| ---- | -------- | ----- |\n| 尚未运行 | 有方法，没有结果 | 运行该模块 |","table":"table-12"},"910":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-135","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                         | 原因       | 处理         |\n| -------------------------- | -------- | ---------- |\n| 此版本只读 / 此型号版本保持只读，请建立新版本方案 | 历史或已发布版本 | 建立方案或新版本草稿 |","table":"table-12"},"911":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-136","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                                                  | 原因       | 处理            |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | -------- | ------------- |\n| 型号结构来源待补：请核对三芯尺寸、成缆绞距、屏蔽电阻与铠装绕包的真实依据，在结构页录入出处后重新计算。 | 结构参数缺少来源 | 在结构页录入出处后重新计算 |","table":"table-12"},"912":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-137","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                             | 原因    | 处理          |\n| ------------------------------ | ----- | ----------- |\n| 计算方法暂时不可用，请重新读取；仍失败时联系管理员检查安装。 | 插件不可用 | 重新读取，或联系管理员 |","table":"table-12"},"913":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-design-138","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-design","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-design#状态与报错","content":"| 提示                | 原因        | 处理            |\n| ----------------- | --------- | ------------- |\n| 前次运行连接中断，可查询同一请求。 | 运行请求的连接中断 | 查询同一请求，不会重复运行 |","table":"table-12"},"914":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"page","content":"型号库与结构表导入","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","用户指南"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library"},"915":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-0","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library","content":"分步说明型号库：浏览电缆型号版本，导入厂家结构表（XLS / XLSX / CSV 五步向导），提取厂家 PDF 并逐项核对，管理系列与规格，复用部件与研究模板，以及各状态与报错的处理。"},"916":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-1","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"电缆型号版本"},"917":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-2","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#导入厂家结构表","content":"导入厂家结构表"},"918":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-3","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"第 1 步：选择文件"},"919":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-4","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-2-步选择工作表","content":"第 2 步：选择工作表"},"920":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-5","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"第 3 步：确认列映射"},"921":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-6","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"第 4 步：填写系列声明与来源"},"922":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-7","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"第 5 步：核对入库预览"},"923":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-8","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#提取厂家-pdf","content":"提取厂家 PDF"},"924":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-9","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"1. 设定提取范围"},"925":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-10","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#2-逐项核对候选值","content":"2. 逐项核对候选值"},"926":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-11","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"3. 生成提案并批准"},"927":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-12","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"系列与规格"},"928":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-13","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#其他页签","content":"其他页签"},"929":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-14","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"部件与研究模板"},"930":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-15","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library","content":"型号库保存电缆型号的固定版本，研究按版本引用它们。数据可以来自厂家结构表、厂家资料（PDF 原件）、工程师给定或型号设计。每个数值都保留来源和可信分档：原表实测、标准限值和工程补充互相区分，不会混在一起。"},"931":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-16","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"**打开哪里**：侧栏 **资源 → 电缆型号版本**。页头显示“N 项 · 研究按版本引用”，右侧有 **提取厂家 PDF** 和 **导入厂家结构表** 两个入口。"},"932":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-17","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"**怎么查**：“检索型号版本”按型号、厂家或规格查找；“来源”按厂家资料、标准、推导、工程师给定、资源库或演示筛选。表格按型号系列分组，列出型号、规格、内容、主要来源、版本和状态。"},"933":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-18","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"**看到什么**：点一行，右侧显示版本、状态、内容、规格和制造商，以及按类别统计的来源（“N 项 · 已核对 M”）。"},"934":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-19","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"**用于载流量研究**：以这个固定版本新建工程和研究。版本缺少研究所需的完整结构时不可用，提示“此版本尚未提供研究所需的完整结构；请先在型号设计中补齐结构与工程参数。”"},"935":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-20","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"**建立型号草稿**：以这个版本建立独立的型号设计草稿。版本不在可复制清单中时不可用。"},"936":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-21","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#电缆型号版本","content":"“系统教学示例”区的型号用于演示结构与规格书，不是厂家实测，不能作为工程型号引用。"},"937":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-22","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#导入厂家结构表","content":"结构表是厂家目录里“每行一个规格”的表格，例如 YJV22-8.7/15 kV 各截面的导体外径、绝缘厚度、内衬、钢带、护套厚度、外径和重量。"},"938":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-23","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#导入厂家结构表","content":"**打开哪里**：“电缆型号版本”页的 **导入厂家结构表**，进入“结构表导入与系列”页的“导入结构表”页签。进度条分五步，随时可以 **重新开始**。完整演示见快速上手：电缆厂。"},"939":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-24","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"点 **选择结构表文件**，或把文件拖入页面。支持 `.xlsx`、`.xls`、`.csv`，不超过 10 MiB，每行一个规格。页面提供人民电缆和 Bahra 的公开示例结构表下载。"},"940":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-25","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"上传后自动选择带表格标记的工作表（否则取第一张）和数据起始行；系列名称默认取文件名。"},"941":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-26","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"| 提示                         | 处理      |\n| -------------------------- | ------- |\n| 请选择 .xlsx、.xls 或 .csv 结构表。 | 换成支持的格式 |","table":"table-0"},"942":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-27","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"| 提示                                   | 处理   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ---- |\n| 请选择非空且不超过 10 MiB 的结构表，请拆分过大的文件后重新选择。 | 拆分文件 |","table":"table-0"},"943":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-28","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-1-步选择文件","content":"| 提示             | 处理    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| 文件中没有可以读取的工作表。 | 检查原文件 |","table":"table-0"},"944":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-29","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-2-步选择工作表","content":"在“工作表”中选择（显示为“工作表名 · 行数”）。“工作表原始列”表列出原表列、列名和示例值（原表单位），用来确认选对了表。没有识别到表头时，检查原文件是否以列名和数值行组织。点 **确认工作表，设置列映射**。"},"945":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-30","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"| 字段    | 含义           | 要求        |\n| ----- | ------------ | --------- |\n| 数据起始行 | 第一行数据在原表中的行号 | 不小于 1 的整数 |","table":"table-1"},"946":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-31","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"| 字段      | 含义           | 要求      |\n| ------- | ------------ | ------- |\n| 复用已保存映射 | 选择以前保存的列映射模板 | 复用后逐列核对 |","table":"table-1"},"947":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-32","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"| 字段      | 含义                            | 要求                   |\n| ------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 目标字段与单位 | 每一列对应的目标字段和原表单位；不需要的列选“不导入此列” | 每个字段只使用一列；必须对应“标称截面” |","table":"table-1"},"948":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-33","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"| 字段     | 含义           | 要求      |\n| ------ | ------------ | ------- |\n| 映射模板名称 | 保存这套映射以便下次复用 | 最多 80 字 |","table":"table-1"},"949":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-34","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-3-步确认列映射","content":"按原表单位选择目标字段，例如原表写“mm”就选 mm 的字段，软件统一换算为 SI 单位保存。复用的映射与当前表头不一致时，逐列核对后保存新的映射。点 **填写系列声明**。"},"950":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-35","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段   | 含义        | 单位  | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| 系列名称 | 这批规格的系列名称 | —   | 必填，最多 120 字；不能与已有系列同名 |","table":"table-2"},"951":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-36","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段  | 含义  | 单位  | 要求       |\n| --- | --- | --- | -------- |\n| 制造商 | —   | —   | 最多 120 字 |","table":"table-2"},"952":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-37","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段  | 含义       | 单位  | 要求         |\n| --- | -------- | --- | ---------- |\n| 型号  | 例如 YJV22 | —   | 必填，最多 60 字 |","table":"table-2"},"953":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-38","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段               | 含义        | 单位  | 要求  |\n| ---------------- | --------- | --- | --- |\n| 额定相电压 U₀、额定线电压 U | 例如 8.7、15 | kV  | 必填  |","table":"table-2"},"954":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-39","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段        | 含义  | 单位  | 要求  |\n| --------- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 最高系统电压 Uₘ | —   | kV  | 可选  |","table":"table-2"},"955":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-40","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段  | 含义  | 单位  | 要求        |\n| --- | --- | --- | --------- |\n| 芯数  | —   | 芯   | 1–16，默认 3 |","table":"table-2"},"956":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-41","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段   | 含义                | 单位  | 要求      |\n| ---- | ----------------- | --- | ------- |\n| 数据身份 | 本厂结构表、公开厂家资料或结构演示 | —   | 默认本厂结构表 |","table":"table-2"},"957":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-42","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段          | 含义                                 | 单位  | 要求  |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------- | --- | --- |\n| 导体、绝缘、外护套材料 | 铜 / 铝；XLPE / PVC；PVC / PE；或按明确型号识别 | —   | —   |","table":"table-2"},"958":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-43","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段              | 含义                      | 单位  | 要求       |\n| --------------- | ----------------------- | --- | -------- |\n| 铠装材料类别、金属套材料与形式 | 镀锌钢、非磁性不锈钢；铅套、皱纹铝套、光滑铝套 | —   | 未声明时保留缺项 |","table":"table-2"},"959":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-44","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段        | 含义                                | 单位  | 要求     |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- | --- | ------ |\n| 原表缺少导体电阻时 | 保留缺项等待厂家提供，或采用 GB/T 3956 表 2 标准上限 | —   | 默认保留缺项 |","table":"table-2"},"960":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-45","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段   | 含义                             | 单位  | 要求    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | --- | ----- |\n| 执行标准 | 每行一项，包含年号，例如 GB/T 12706.2—2020 | —   | 入库时登记 |","table":"table-2"},"961":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-46","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段        | 含义                  | 单位  | 要求          |\n| --------- | ------------------- | --- | ----------- |\n| 资料名称、资料位置 | 原件的名称与位置（手册名、表号、页码） | —   | 没有加载来源说明时填写 |","table":"table-2"},"962":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-47","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段      | 含义                              | 单位  | 要求            |\n| ------- | ------------------------------- | --- | ------------- |\n| 全系列统一尺寸 | 导体、绝缘与屏蔽、保护层与外径三组，原表没有但全系列相同的尺寸 | 按字段 | 填写数值时必须同时填写依据 |","table":"table-2"},"963":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-48","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"| 字段      | 含义                     | 单位  | 要求                      |\n| ------- | ---------------------- | --- | ----------------------- |\n| 计算参数与来源 | 计算需要的参数，可以“选用有来源的参考参数” | 按字段 | 填写数值时必须同时填写参数依据；不由导入器猜测 |","table":"table-2"},"964":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-49","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"还可以加载“补充原列口径与原件定位”的 JSON 来源说明（不超过 1 MiB）。填写系列名称时即检查同名系列：库中已有同名系列时当场提示“系列名称“…”已被现有系列使用，请在上方修改系列名称后再预览。”，预览按钮不可用。没有计算参数时，预览会保留缺项，这些规格补齐后才能计算。"},"965":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-50","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-4-步填写系列声明与来源","content":"点 **逐行校验并预览**。"},"966":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-51","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**看到什么**：摘要“系列名 · 可入库 N 行 · 其中缺项 N 行 · 错误 N 行”，以及“逐行入库预览”表，每行有原表行号、规格与数值、状态（可入库、资料缺项、不可入库）、问题列与原因。点数值可以查看换算和来源。"},"967":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-52","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**怎么判读**："},"968":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-53","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**资料缺项**的规格可以保存为草稿，但缺少必需数据的规格不能计算。"},"969":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-54","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**不可入库**的错误行须回原表更正，或勾选“明确跳过 N 个错误行，仅保存其余 N 个规格”。"},"970":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-55","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"选择采用 GB/T 3956 标准上限时，页面注明“不是厂家实测值”，每个数保留标准出处。"},"971":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-56","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**点什么**：勾选“我已核对原始资料、列映射、系列声明与执行标准来源，确认将本次预览保存为未发布草稿。”，点 **确认入库 N 个规格**。入库被拒绝时，原因显示在按钮旁；前面各步的报错显示在页面顶部。"},"972":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-57","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"**结果**：“已保存 N 个规格草稿”，状态为“草稿 · 待人工核对”。可以 **继续导入其他工作表**，或 **打开系列，核对与计算**。原表没有的数值只按有出处的规则补充，并标明出处和可信分档。"},"973":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-58","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                    | 处理      |\n| --------------------- | ------- |\n| 同名系列已存在，请修改系列名称后重新预览。 | 改名后重新预览 |","table":"table-3"},"974":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-59","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                           | 处理        |\n| ---------------------------- | --------- |\n| 存在错误行；请修正原表，或明确选择跳过错误行后重新确认。 | 更正原表或勾选跳过 |","table":"table-3"},"975":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-60","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                       | 处理       |\n| ------------------------ | -------- |\n| 没有可入库的规格，请返回修正列映射或原始结构表。 | 检查列映射和原表 |","table":"table-3"},"976":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-61","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                        | 处理        |\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\n| 没有可预览的规格行，请核对工作表、起始行和列映射。 | 检查第 2、3 步 |","table":"table-3"},"977":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-62","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                                 | 处理             |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| 预览期间设置已修改，本次旧预览已作废。请核对当前设置后重新逐行校验。 | 以最后一次预览为准，重新预览 |","table":"table-3"},"978":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-63","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示                   | 处理      |\n| -------------------- | ------- |\n| 预览摘要已变化，请重新核对；未写入型号。 | 重新预览后确认 |","table":"table-3"},"979":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-64","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#第-5-步核对入库预览","content":"| 提示               | 处理     |\n| ---------------- | ------ |\n| 原始文件摘要不一致，已拒绝使用。 | 重新上传原件 |","table":"table-3"},"980":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-65","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#提取厂家-pdf","content":"**打开哪里**：“电缆型号版本”页的 **提取厂家 PDF**，进入资料目录。点 **上传 PDF**（不超过 64 MiB、500 页；同一文件重复上传返回原记录），进入该资料的工作区。厂家原件不随软件分发，需要自行导入。"},"981":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-66","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"展开“提取范围与方法”："},"982":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-67","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"| 字段   | 含义     | 示例     | 要求      |\n| ---- | ------ | ------ | ------- |\n| 型号系列 | 要提取的型号 | YJLW03 | 最多 80 字 |","table":"table-4"},"983":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-68","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"| 字段    | 含义     | 示例        | 要求      |\n| ----- | ------ | --------- | ------- |\n| 规格行／列 | 要提取的规格 | 800、3×300 | 最多 40 字 |","table":"table-4"},"984":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-69","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"| 字段   | 含义                               | 示例   | 要求         |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| 识别方法 | 规则优先 · 自动离线识别（默认）、离线文字识别、规则与云端补充 | 规则优先 | 云端方式需要确认外发 |","table":"table-4"},"985":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-70","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"| 字段            | 含义      | 示例  | 要求       |\n| ------------- | ------- | --- | -------- |\n| 厂家、电压、导体与护套分支 | 帮助定位的说明 | —   | 最多 300 字 |","table":"table-4"},"986":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-71","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"| 字段        | 含义                  | 示例  | 要求         |\n| --------- | ------------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| 原文页码、加入整页 | 选择提取的页或片段，也可以在原文上框选 | —   | 最多 4 个页或片段 |","table":"table-4"},"987":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-72","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"**点什么**：**开始离线提取**。选择云端方式时按钮为 **查看外发说明**：对话框“确认外发所选内容”列出服务、模型、发送内容和范围，勾选“我已核对目的地址、模型与范围，同意外发所选内容”后才开始；服务没有配置时不能外发。"},"988":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-73","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#1-设定提取范围","content":"**识别方式**：规则方式优先读取 PDF 的文字层、表格和字形位置；没有文字层的图像页自动使用本机离线文字识别（OCR）。识别结果独立保存，原件文字层保持原样；识别置信度低于 0.95 的候选标为待消歧。本机没有识别模型或运行库时明确报错，不会联网下载，也不会假装识别。"},"989":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-74","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#2-逐项核对候选值","content":"**看到什么**：“候选参数”表（有歧义的在“待消歧”中），列出参数、原始值和核对状态（待核对、已接受、已修改、已拒绝）。每一项可以展开原始值、国际单位值、数值语义（厂家最大值或厂家公开值）、表头原文和证据位置。"},"990":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-75","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#2-逐项核对候选值","content":"**点什么**：对每一项选择接受、修改或拒绝；修改时填写修订值和修订单位；填写核对人（最多 100 字）和核对理由（最多 500 字），点 **保存此项核对**。快捷键：J、K 切换，Enter 接受，X 拒绝。"},"991":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-76","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#2-逐项核对候选值","content":"无歧义、原件文字与候选一致的项目可以用 **确认本规格 N 项** 一次确认；识别（OCR）得到的项目和重复字段仍需逐项核对。没有找到候选时，检查型号、规格行、单位及选定范围后重新提取。"},"992":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-77","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"全部核对后点 **准备提案**，在“生成型号草稿提案”中选择目标型号：新建型号时填写型号名称、厂家、相对地电压和额定电压（kV）、芯数、每芯截面（mm²）、导体材料，以及“身份信息原文依据”（这些信息所在的页和原文）；填写新版本名称（最多 32 字）。点 **生成提案**；多个规格可以 **加入多规格批量**。"},"993":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-78","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"“核对变更提案”列出参数、原值和提案值，状态为“等待人工批准”；可以 **下载完整提案**。"},"994":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-79","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"点 **核对并批准**，填写批准人，勾选“我已核对本提案的逐项变更，批准生成新版本草稿”，点 **批准并生成草稿**。"},"995":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-80","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"结果为“型号草稿已生成”，状态“草稿 · 尚未发布”。可以 **新建型号设计** 继续编辑，或 **下载型号草稿**。"},"996":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-81","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"批准只生成新版本草稿，不发布，不自动补全物性，也不把候选值升级为工程认证。核对人与批准人是操作记录，不是身份认证。"},"997":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-82","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"| 状态或提示 | 处理                                 |\n| ----- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 提取失败  | 识别成功但字段提取失败，已收到的证据保留；查看“提取诊断”后重新提取 |","table":"table-5"},"998":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-83","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"| 状态或提示 | 处理                           |\n| ----- | ---------------------------- |\n| 提取已中断 | 网络中断、限流或重启；原件保留，重新发起提取才会再次调用 |","table":"table-5"},"999":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-84","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"| 状态或提示      | 处理                    |\n| ---------- | --------------------- |\n| 未找到有依据的候选值 | 检查型号、规格行、单位及选定范围后重新提取 |","table":"table-5"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-85","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"| 状态或提示                            | 处理           |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| 当前结构没有对应位置，请返回核对并拒绝此项，或新建公开规格草稿。 | 拒绝该项，或改为新建型号 |","table":"table-5"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-86","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#3-生成提案并批准","content":"| 状态或提示 | 处理             |\n| ----- | -------------- |\n| 上传未完成 | 检查文件大小与页数后重新上传 |","table":"table-5"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-87","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"“结构表导入与系列”页的“系列与规格”页签列出全部型号系列。打开一个系列可以看到每个规格的状态、缺项和下一步，点规格名查看每个数的原表来源，点 **打开型号设计** 进入该规格的型号设计。"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-88","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"勾选规格后可以批量操作，每个操作都要勾选“确认所选规格与版本”才会执行。结果显示在工具栏下方，逐个规格列出："},"1004":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-89","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"| 操作   | 做什么                                      |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 批量核对 | 对每个规格运行产品标准尺寸核对，保存真实运行，列出满足、待补数据和未覆盖的项目。 |","table":"table-6"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-90","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"| 操作   | 做什么                                                              |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 批量计算 | 按一套统一工况（埋深、土壤热阻率、环境温度、接地方式等，须写明来源）对每个规格计算载流量；超出方法范围的规格会被拒算并说明原因。 |","table":"table-6"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-91","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"| 操作   | 做什么                                 |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 批量审核 | 对已提交审核的版本做人工批准或退回；尚未提交审核的草稿会整批拒绝批准。 |","table":"table-6"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-92","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#系列与规格","content":"需要修改已入库的规格时，在规格的来源对话框里选择“将当前设计保存为新版本”，填写改版说明并确认，建立独立的新版本草稿。旧版本和它的运行记录保持不变。"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-93","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#其他页签","content":"**公开样本对照**：把软件计算的外径、重量、导体直流电阻和载流量与厂家公开样本逐项对照，并标明哪些是厂家声明、哪些是研究参考情景。各规格共用的说明（如拒算原因和缺项）按原表分组写在表格上方，只有个别规格独有的说明留在行内。"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-94","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#其他页签","content":"**材料与环境**：查看厂家手册里与材料、敷设环境有关的原始资料。这些资料只供查阅，不会自动变成计算输入。"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-95","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#其他页签","content":"**部件与研究模板**：把已保存型号的部件或成功运行的研究定义冻结为参考草稿，供其他工程采用，见下文。"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-96","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#其他页签","content":"**数据交换**：把资料和工程导出为 JSON 或 Excel 交换文件，或导入其他实例导出的交换文件。"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-97","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"“部件与研究模板”页签用于在工程之间复用经过核对的输入，分为两类："},"1013":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-98","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"| 类别  | 来源                          | 采用后的结果                   |\n| --- | --------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 部件  | 已保存型号中的导体、线芯层或公共层，连同材料和逐项出处 | 写入目标型号中指定的同类位置，可沿原撤销路径恢复 |","table":"table-7"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-99","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"| 类别   | 来源                          | 采用后的结果               |\n| ---- | --------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 研究模板 | 一次成功运行的研究定义，连同固定的方法版本、参数和出处 | 在目标工程中新建一项独立研究，不自动运行 |","table":"table-7"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-100","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"使用流程："},"1016":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-101","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"**创建参考草稿**：选择实际保存的结构或成功的研究运行，预览逐项来源、方法版本和缺项，人工确认后保存为参考草稿。"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-102","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"**发布参考版本**：核对固定输入、来源和限制后发布。发布后仍为“参考”分档，不代表制造实测或工程批准。"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-103","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"**采用到另一个工程**：指定目标位置（部件）或逐项映射对象（研究模板），预览完整变化，人工确认后写入。"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-104","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"需要注意："},"1020":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-105","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"冻结的是创建时保存的完整输入与出处；来源工程之后的修改不会带入已冻结的版本。"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-106","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"部件字段在证据表中按工程单位显示（如 mm²、mm、Ω/km），研究参数保留原 SI 单位；数值保留全部保存位数。"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-107","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"没有明确出处的非空工程字段不能创建为参考部件。结构表导入生成的型号，其结构层用途等字段尚无逐项出处，目前不能创建参考部件。"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-108","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"实测值（实测 R₂₀、实测厚度等）不作为参考部件复制。"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-109","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"研究模板目前支持 IEC 60287 稳态载流量的单工况研究。"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-110","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"采用研究模板只新建研究，不修改目标工程的输入，也不发起计算；计算仍按研究的预检和运行流程由人确认。"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/guide/type-library-111","page_id":"/docs/guide/type-library","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/guide/type-library#部件与研究模板","content":"创建、发布和采用都须人工确认；Agent 只能查看和预览。"},"1027":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"文档总览","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"1028":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"面向电缆制造企业与科研院所的电缆设计、载流量计算、有限元仿真与工程智能体文档。"},"1029":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#快速上手含实操视频","content":"快速上手（含实操视频）"},"1030":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"按模块查阅"},"1031":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"CableSimPro 将**电缆结构设计、IEC 60287 / GB 标准载流量校核、超算有限元热仿真与受控工程智能体（Agent）**整合在同一套可追溯工程库上。每一项计算结果均绑定输入快照、方法封签与版本，缺数据明确终止，审核签发由工程师确认。"},"1032":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<VideoPlayer kind=\"overview\" />"},"1033":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#快速上手含实操视频","content":"五步向导导入 Excel 结构表 → 逐项追溯原始行号 → 全系列批量核对与载流量计算 → 导出产品规格书"},"1034":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#快速上手含实操视频","content":"新建 110 kV 品字形直埋研究 → 预检求解 → 修改土壤热阻率重算对比 → 预览并下载 PDF 计算书"},"1035":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#快速上手含实操视频","content":"只读快照查询、“待你审阅”字段级修改提案卡、人工单步授权重算与带四级签栏正式计算书"},"1036":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"Windows / Linux 离线安装包、release.toml 配置、AI 模型接入、Slurm 超算接入、内网部署与备份恢复"},"1037":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"型号库与结构表导入、型号设计、载流量研究与参数扫描、有限元仿真、正式交付文件与资源管理"},"1038":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"IEC 60287、GB 50217 校正、热网络交叉校核、产品标准核对、有限元对照及完整验证等级清单"},"1039":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"cablesim.plugin/2 清单规范、报告模板与 Agent 技能声明示例、宿主架构契约与 REST 接口参考"},"1040":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"安装排错、缺项拦截原因、结果口径区分与电缆热工符号对照"},"1041":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#按模块查阅","content":"各版本功能范围与当前工程边界声明"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/install/agent","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"page","content":"Agent 对话服务","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-0","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent","content":"离线安装包自带的 Agent 对话服务：随包内容、启动与关闭、模型配置的优先顺序、安全边界与故障排查。"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-1","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#随包内容","content":"随包内容"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-2","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"启动与关闭"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-3","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"模型只需配置一处"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-4","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#安全边界","content":"安全边界"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-5","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#安装与升级时的检查","content":"安装与升级时的检查"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-6","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"故障排查"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-7","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent","content":"离线安装包自带 Agent 对话服务。安装并接入模型后即可在工作台使用 Agent 对话，安装和运行过程均不需要联网，也不需要系统中预装 Node.js、npm 或 Python。Agent 的用法见 Agent 的用法和边界。"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-8","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#随包内容","content":"| 目录              | 内容                                                                                               |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `runtime/node/` | 固定版本的官方 Node.js 24.22.3，只含解释器和许可证文件，不含 npm、npx、corepack，安装后不能再安装或更新软件包。版本、下载地址与 SHA256 固定在构建清单中。 |","table":"table-0"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-9","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#随包内容","content":"| 目录       | 内容                                                         |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `agent/` | Agent 对话服务（边车进程）：对话服务源码、9 份 Agent 技能、预构建的对话页面，以及运行所需的生产依赖。 |","table":"table-0"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-10","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#随包内容","content":"两个目录的每个文件都记录在发行清单 `release-manifest.json` 中，计入构建编号；文件损坏会阻止安装或启动。第三方许可汇总在 `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`。"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-11","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#随包内容","content":"Linux 版的 Node.js 还要求系统提供兼容的 glibc 和 libstdc++。构建时实测的最低 glibc 版本写在 `runtime/node-runtime.json`，安装前自动核对。"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-12","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"`release.toml` 的 `[agent]` 一节控制对话服务："},"1056":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-13","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"启动程序先启动平台，再启动对话服务；退出时两者一起停止。Windows 上用 Ctrl+Break 通知对话服务先关闭会话再退出。"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-14","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"对话服务只监听 `127.0.0.1:<port>`。浏览器只访问平台端口下的 `/agent-app/`（对话页）和 `/agent-sidecar/`（平台转发），内网用户不需要直接访问 8111 端口。"},"1058":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-15","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"对话服务是**可选进程**：没有启动成功时，型号、计算、仿真、交付等其余功能照常可用，启动窗口和 Agent 页都会写明原因。"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-16","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"端口被占用时，启动程序在改动任何数据之前就明确失败，并提示修改 `[agent] port` 或关闭 Agent。"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-17","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"对话服务异常退出后不会自动重启，工作台其余功能继续可用；重新启动程序即可恢复。"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-18","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#启动与关闭","content":"对话记录保存在 `数据目录/agent/`，随数据目录一起保留。它不在工程库备份（`workspace_db.py backup`）的范围内，需要保留时一并备份这个目录。"},"1062":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-19","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"对话服务**不接触任何模型密钥**：它只向平台查询当前模型名，模型请求由平台加上密钥后转发。平台按以下顺序确定使用哪个模型（Agent 与其他 AI 功能共用）："},"1063":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-20","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"| 优先级 | 来源                   | 密钥保存位置                                 |\n| --- | -------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | 界面“设置 → AI 模型”中保存的配置 | 操作系统凭据库（Windows 凭据管理器、Linux 密钥环），页面读不回 |","table":"table-1"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-21","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"| 优先级 | 来源                                                                                                   | 密钥保存位置                                                       |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 2   | `release.toml` 的 `[model]`，或环境变量 `CABLESIM_LLM_BASE_URL`、`CABLESIM_LLM_MODEL`、`CABLESIM_LLM_API_KEY` | `[model]` 的 `api_key_env` 所指的环境变量（默认 `CABLESIM_LLM_API_KEY`） |","table":"table-1"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-22","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"| 优先级 | 来源                                                                                      | 密钥保存位置 |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 3   | 环境变量 `CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_BASE_URL`、`CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_ID`、`CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_API_KEY` | 同名环境变量 |","table":"table-1"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-23","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"规则："},"1067":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-24","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"`[model]` 的 `base_url` 和 `model` 都留空时，这一节不指定任何连接，环境变量 `CABLESIM_LLM_*` 照常生效。"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-25","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"只要写了 `base_url` 或 `model` 其中一项，整个连接就以 `[model]` 为准，密钥只取 `api_key_env` 所指的变量；该变量没有设置就视为没有密钥，不会借用其他来源的密钥。"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-26","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"服务地址、模型名和密钥须来自同一个来源，不同来源的值不会拼在一起。"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-27","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"没有配置模型时，Agent 页显示“还没有配置 AI 模型：在‘设置 · AI 模型’里填写……”，发送消息会被拒绝，不调用任何服务，也不产生任何结果。"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-28","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#模型只需配置一处","content":"配置方法见接入模型。"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-29","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安全边界","content":"**只在本机通信**：对话服务只监听 127.0.0.1，API 同时校验令牌和请求的主机名。"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-30","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安全边界","content":"**一次一密**：平台与对话服务之间的令牌在每次启动时随机生成，只存在于这两个进程的环境中；启动程序自身和它启动的其他进程都拿不到，也不写入配置、日志或文件。"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-31","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安全边界","content":"**拿不到密钥**：对话服务进程的环境变量按白名单设置，任何服务商密钥、代理设置和 `NODE_OPTIONS` 都不会传入。"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-32","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安全边界","content":"**写操作须人工接受**：Agent 的每一次写入都是提案，须由人在对话中接受，详见 Agent 的用法和边界。"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-33","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安装与升级时的检查","content":"安装时实际运行一次随包的 Node.js；失败时提示检查杀毒软件，或在 `release.toml` 中关闭 `[agent]`。"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-34","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安装与升级时的检查","content":"Windows 安装前的路径长度检查覆盖 `agent/` 与 `runtime/node/`。"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-35","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安装与升级时的检查","content":"Linux 安装前核对 Node.js 要求的最低 glibc 版本。"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-36","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#安装与升级时的检查","content":"**回退到不含 Agent 的旧版本前**，须先从 `release.toml` 删除 `[agent]` 一节：旧版本不认识这一节，会拒绝启动。回退方法见升级与备份恢复。"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-37","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象                   | 原因                                    | 处理                                                                                                           |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 安装时提示随包 Node.js 无法运行 | 杀毒软件拦截了 `runtime/node/` 中的 `node.exe` | 在杀毒软件中信任程序目录（`数据目录/programs/<构建编号前16位>/`），然后重新安装；暂时不用 Agent 时，在 `release.toml` 中设置 `[agent] enabled = false` |","table":"table-2"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-38","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象                | 原因                    | 处理                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 启动时提示 Agent 端口被占用 | 8111 端口已被其他程序或另一个实例占用 | 关闭占用端口的程序，或修改 `[agent] port`（须不同于 `[server] port`），也可以设置 `enabled = false` |","table":"table-2"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-39","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象                       | 原因             | 处理                            |\n| ------------------------ | -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Agent 页显示“Agent 对话服务未连接” | 对话服务没有启动成功或已退出 | 查看启动窗口中的原因；处理后重新启动程序。其余功能不受影响 |","table":"table-2"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-40","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象                     | 原因             | 处理                          |\n| ---------------------- | -------------- | --------------------------- |\n| Agent 页提示“还没有配置 AI 模型” | 三个来源都没有完整的模型配置 | 在“设置 → AI 模型”中填写并测试连接，见接入模型 |","table":"table-2"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-41","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象        | 原因                | 处理                                                                                                    |\n| --------- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 模型连接失败或超时 | 防火墙或代理阻止了平台访问模型服务 | 模型请求由平台进程发出，不由对话服务发出；在防火墙中放行平台的出站连接（Windows 上是程序目录 `.venv` 中的 `python.exe`）。对话服务只监听本机，**不需要**为它添加入站规则 |","table":"table-2"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-42","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"| 现象                                | 原因             | 处理                     |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------- | ---------------------- |\n| Windows 防火墙弹窗询问是否允许 `node.exe` 联网 | 首次启动对话服务时的系统提示 | 对话服务只在本机通信，可以不允许公用网络访问 |","table":"table-2"},"1086":{"id":"/docs/install/agent-43","page_id":"/docs/install/agent","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/agent#故障排查","content":"更多问题见常见问题。"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"page","content":"release.toml 配置","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration"},"1088":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-0","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration","content":"发行版配置文件各项的含义、默认值和取值规则。"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-1","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"[server] 服务"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-2","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"[storage] 数据"},"1091":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-3","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#initialization-初始化","content":"[initialization] 初始化"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-4","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#model-模型","content":"[model] 模型"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-5","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#agent-agent-对话服务","content":"[agent] Agent 对话服务"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-6","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"[[processes]] 伴随进程"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-7","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration","content":"安装包根目录带一份 `release.toml`（UTF-8 编码）；安装时把它复制到解压目录之外保存，启动时用 `--config` 指定（见安装）。相对路径以配置文件所在目录为基准；Windows 路径请写成正斜杠（如 `D:/CableSimPro-data`）或放在 TOML 单引号里。配置文件不在程序完整性摘要之内，可以随时编辑，**升级时继续使用同一份**。"},"1096":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-8","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"| 键      | 默认值           | 说明                                                  |\n| ------ | ------------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `host` | `\"127.0.0.1\"` | 监听地址，必须是 IP 地址或 `localhost`。只允许本机访问时保持默认；内网访问见内网部署。 |","table":"table-0"},"1097":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-9","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"| 键      | 默认值    | 说明                                   |\n| ------ | ------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `port` | `8100` | 界面和所有接口共用这一个端口。端口已被占用时启动失败，不会改用别的端口。 |","table":"table-0"},"1098":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-10","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"| 键              | 默认值    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `open_browser` | `true` | 启动后是否自动打开浏览器。服务器上设为 `false` 或启动时加 `--no-browser`。 |","table":"table-0"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-11","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 说明                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `startup_timeout_seconds` | `300` | 等待服务就绪的上限。首次生成示例可能需要几分钟；超时即判定启动失败，升级时会恢复升级前的快照。 |","table":"table-0"},"1100":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-12","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#server-服务","content":"| 键               | 默认值  | 说明                                    |\n| --------------- | ---- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `trusted_hosts` | `[]` | 允许出现在浏览器地址栏里的主机名或 IP。只接受明确的名字，不支持通配符。 |","table":"table-0"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-13","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"| 键          | 默认值                    | 说明                                                        |\n| ---------- | ---------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `data_dir` | `\"~/CableSimPro-data\"` | 工程库、数据集、复现资料、工程证据、备份和保留的各个程序版本都放在这里。`~` 指用户主目录。必须在解压目录之外。 |","table":"table-1"},"1102":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-14","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"数据目录里的主要内容："},"1103":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-15","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"| 位置                   | 内容                    |\n| -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `engineering.sqlite` | 工程库（工程、研究、运行、型号、交付记录） |","table":"table-2"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-16","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"| 位置                                             | 内容            |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| `datasets/`、`library/`、`engineering-evidence/` | 数据集、复现资料、工程证据 |","table":"table-2"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-17","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"| 位置                     | 内容                       |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `programs/<构建编号前16位>/` | 已安装的各个程序版本及其独立 Python 环境 |","table":"table-2"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-18","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#storage-数据","content":"| 位置                   | 内容              |\n| -------------------- | --------------- |\n| `release-snapshots/` | 每次升级前自动创建的工程库快照 |","table":"table-2"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-19","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#initialization-初始化","content":"| 键               | 默认值    | 说明                                                                   |\n| --------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `seed_examples` | `true` | 只在工程库不存在时生效：用随附的公开教学输入生成示例工程。设为 `false` 得到空工程库。已有工程库无论如何都不会被重新生成或替换。 |","table":"table-3"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-20","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#model-模型","content":"| 键          | 默认值  | 说明                                                              |\n| ---------- | ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `base_url` | `\"\"` | OpenAI 兼容接口的完整 API 基址，如 `https://llm.example.com/v1`。留空表示不调用模型。 |","table":"table-4"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-21","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#model-模型","content":"| 键       | 默认值  | 说明   |\n| ------- | ---- | ---- |\n| `model` | `\"\"` | 模型名。 |","table":"table-4"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-22","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#model-模型","content":"| 键             | 默认值                      | 说明                           |\n| ------------- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `api_key_env` | `\"CABLESIM_LLM_API_KEY\"` | 保存密钥的**环境变量名**。密钥本身不要写进配置文件。 |","table":"table-4"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-23","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#model-模型","content":"这些值只是初始连接。管理员在界面“设置 → AI 模型”里保存过的设置优先于本文件。写了 `base_url` 或 `model` 其中一项时，整个连接以本节为准，密钥只取 `api_key_env` 所指的变量；两项都留空时，本节不指定连接，环境变量 `CABLESIM_LLM_*` 照常生效。完整的优先顺序见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-24","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#agent-agent-对话服务","content":"| 键         | 默认值    | 说明                                                |\n| --------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | 是否随程序启动 Agent 对话服务。设为 `false` 时完全不启动，工作台其余功能不受影响。 |","table":"table-5"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-25","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#agent-agent-对话服务","content":"| 键      | 默认值    | 说明                                                       |\n| ------ | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `port` | `8111` | 对话服务的本机端口，只监听 127.0.0.1，须不同于 `[server] port`。被占用时启动前即失败。 |","table":"table-5"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-26","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#agent-agent-对话服务","content":"对话服务的随包内容、安全边界与故障排查见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-27","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#agent-agent-对话服务","content":"不含 Agent 的旧版本不认识 `[agent]` 一节，会拒绝启动。回退到这类版本前，先从 `release.toml` 删除整个 `[agent]` 一节。"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-28","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"可以追加随应用一起启动和停止的其他进程（Agent 对话服务由 `[agent]` 管理，不需要在这里配置）。安装包自带的 `release.toml` 中，这一节是注释掉的示例，格式如下："},"1117":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-29","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"`command` 是参数数组，直接执行，不经过 shell；不会自动下载进程依赖。"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-30","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"占位符 `{python}` 是发行环境的解释器，`{app_dir}`、`{data_dir}` 是当前程序目录和数据目录的绝对路径。"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"`env` 只放非敏感设置。"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/install/configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/install/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/configuration#processes-伴随进程","content":"`required = true` 的进程退出会停止整个应用；可选进程退出不影响核心工作台。"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"page","content":"部署本文档站点","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-0","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site","content":"构建本文档站点，并把静态文件放到 Nginx、内网服务器或 GitHub Pages 上离线使用。"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-1","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#获取构建产物","content":"获取构建产物"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-2","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到网站根目录","content":"放到网站根目录"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-3","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到子路径","content":"放到子路径"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-4","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#本机预览","content":"本机预览"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-5","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"GitHub Pages"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-6","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/docs-site#发布清单与检查","content":"发布清单与检查"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-7","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site","content":"本文档站点是纯静态网页：HTML、CSS、JavaScript、图片、公式字体和中文搜索索引全部在构建产物里，打开时不访问任何外部资源，可以放进没有外网的内网服务器使用。"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-8","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#获取构建产物","content":"**直接下载**：向 main 的推送和每个拉取请求的 CI 都会构建站点，在 GitHub Actions 对应运行的 “Docs site” 任务里下载产物 `docs-site`（保留 14 天），解压后就是可以直接部署的站点目录。"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-9","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#获取构建产物","content":"**自己构建**（需要 Node.js 22.12+ 和 Python 3.11+，Python 用于从后端导出接口说明）："},"1132":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-10","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#获取构建产物","content":"产物在 `site/dist/`。构建会同时执行内部信息检查，发现内部主机名、本机路径、密钥等内容会失败。"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-11","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到网站根目录","content":"默认构建假定站点位于网站根目录（`/`）。把 `dist/` 中的全部文件复制到 Nginx 的站点目录即可："},"1134":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-12","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到网站根目录","content":"任何能提供静态文件的服务器都可以（IIS、Apache、对象存储的静态网站功能等），只要目录地址能返回其中的 `index.html`。"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-13","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到子路径","content":"要放在已有网站的子路径下（如 `https://intranet.example.com/cablesimpro-docs/`），构建时用 `DOCS_BASE` 指定这个路径，再把产物放到对应目录："},"1136":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-14","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#放到子路径","content":"页面中的链接和搜索索引都带有构建时的路径，所以**同一份产物只能放在构建时指定的路径下**；换路径需要重新构建。"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-15","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#本机预览","content":"然后在浏览器打开命令输出的地址。直接双击 `index.html` 以 `file://` 打开时，中文搜索等功能无法使用，请通过 Web 服务器访问。"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-16","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"仓库的 `.github/workflows/docs-pages.yml` 已准备好发布到 GitHub Pages 的工作流：只在 `main` 分支更新或手动触发时构建，并且只有仓库变量 `DOCS_PAGES_ENABLED` 为 `true` 时才真正发布。启用步骤："},"1139":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-17","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"仓库 Settings → Pages，Source 选择 “GitHub Actions”。"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-18","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"仓库 Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables，新建 `DOCS_PAGES_ENABLED`，值为 `true`。"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-19","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"在 Actions 页面手动运行 “Docs site to GitHub Pages”，或等待下一次 `main` 分支更新。"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-20","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#github-pages","content":"工作流会自动设置正确的站点地址和子路径。"},"1143":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-21","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#发布清单与检查","content":"发布哪些 `docs/` 文档由 `site/publish.json` 明确列出；未列出的文档默认不发布。"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-22","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#发布清单与检查","content":"内部信息检查规则在 `site/internal-check.json`。"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/install/docs-site-23","page_id":"/docs/install/docs-site","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/docs-site#发布清单与检查","content":"`npm run check:links` 检查站内死链，`npm run check:search` 用真实浏览器抽检中文搜索。"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","type":"page","content":"仿真计算环境（Slurm 集群）","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/hpc"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-0","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc","content":"为有限元、批量仿真等方法配置 Slurm 超算集群，以及各方法在哪里运行。"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-1","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"每个方法在哪里运行"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-2","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"配置超算连接"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-3","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/hpc#集群上需要准备什么","content":"集群上需要准备什么"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-4","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/hpc#作业与证据","content":"作业与证据"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-5","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc","content":"IEC 60287、GB 50217 校正、热网络、标准核对等解析方法在 CableSimPro 所在的服务器上直接运行（“本机”）。有限元温度场、暂态、电热耦合、批量仿真数据集和混合模型训练等计算量大的方法在 **Slurm 超算集群** 上运行；原生参考插件中规模固定的小型有限元参考算例（如直埋有限元温度、圆截面网格参考）声明为本机运行。没有配置集群时，只在超算运行的方法会在运行前预检中提示超算未配置，不会改到本机计算。"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-6","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"每个计算能力在插件清单里声明求解位置："},"1154":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-7","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"| 声明      | 含义     |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| `local` | 只在本机运行 |","table":"table-0"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-8","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"| 声明      | 含义     |\n| ------- | ------ |\n| `slurm` | 只在超算运行 |","table":"table-0"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-9","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"| 声明       | 含义             |\n| -------- | -------------- |\n| `either` | 两者均可，按计算位置设置选择 |","table":"table-0"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-10","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#每个方法在哪里运行","content":"声明见方法清单。研究的运行前预检会写明本次在本机还是超算上求解。"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-11","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"打开“设置 → 计算位置”，在“超算连接”中填写："},"1159":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-12","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目     | 说明                                                                                                       |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| SSH 别名 | 从服务器上已登记的 SSH 主机别名中选择。别名、主机地址、账号和密钥由管理员事先写在运行 CableSimPro 的系统账户的 `~/.ssh/config` 中，CableSimPro 不保存密码或私钥。 |","table":"table-1"},"1160":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-13","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目  | 说明                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| 分区  | 提交作业使用的 Slurm 分区名。 |","table":"table-1"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-14","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目     | 说明                                           |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 远程工作目录 | 集群上事先建好的绝对路径，作业文件放在其下的 `jobs` 目录。测试连接不会创建目录。 |","table":"table-1"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-15","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目  | 说明                         |\n| --- | -------------------------- |\n| 环境  | 集群上的 Python 或 Conda 环境根目录。 |","table":"table-1"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-16","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目     | 说明                                |\n| ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| 单批核时上限 | 一批作业允许使用的核时，最多 2000 核时；超出的提交会被拒绝。 |","table":"table-1"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-17","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"| 项目     | 说明                                             |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 累计核时上限 | 所有作业合计允许使用的核时，不小于单批上限，最多 20000 核时；用完后新的提交会被拒绝。 |","table":"table-1"},"1165":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-18","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"保存后用 **测试连接** 检查 SSH、分区和目录是否可用。保存会记录修订，必要时可以撤销到上一份设置。"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-19","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#配置超算连接","content":"“SSH 别名”下拉框会列出运行 CableSimPro 的系统账户 `~/.ssh/config` 中登记的**全部**主机别名，能打开设置页的用户都看得到。内网多人使用时，请用专门的系统账户运行 CableSimPro，并只在它的 `~/.ssh/config` 中登记超算集群的别名。"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-20","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#集群上需要准备什么","content":"能从 CableSimPro 服务器通过 SSH 免密登录的账号，以及有写权限的工作目录。"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-21","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#集群上需要准备什么","content":"一个 Python（或 Conda）环境，安装仿真插件声明的原生依赖：仓库中的 `plugins/requirements-native.txt`（网格、有限元求解器等）。插件清单列出各自依赖，安装插件不会自动安装依赖。"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-22","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#集群上需要准备什么","content":"作业所需的计算节点和分区访问权限。"},"1170":{"id":"/docs/install/hpc-23","page_id":"/docs/install/hpc","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/hpc#作业与证据","content":"提交到超算的作业在“记录 → 运行与作业”中可以看到排队、运行、完成状态，支持刷新和取消。作业完成后，宿主取回结果并与输入、方法版本、网格与收敛证据一起保存；实际使用的核时也会记录。仿真结果的验证依据见有限元对照。"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/install","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/install-0","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install","content":"Windows 与 Linux 离线安装包的获取、安装、首次启动和日常启动。"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/install-1","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#系统要求","content":"系统要求"},"1174":{"id":"/docs/install-2","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#获取安装包","content":"获取安装包"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/install-3","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"安装并启动"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/install-4","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#启动时做了哪些检查","content":"启动时做了哪些检查"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/install-5","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#从源码运行开发与评估","content":"从源码运行（开发与评估）"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/install-6","page_id":"/docs/install","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"进一步阅读"},"1179":{"id":"/docs/install-7","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install","content":"CableSimPro 以离线安装包发行：Windows 10 / 11 x64 和 Linux x86_64 各一个 ZIP。包里带有固定版本的 Python 运行时、全部依赖和预构建的界面，**安装端不需要预装 Python、Node、编译器或 Git，也不需要管理员权限，安装过程不联网**。"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/install-8","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install","content":"安装包还带有固定版本的 Node.js 和 Agent 对话服务，安装后接入模型即可使用 Agent 对话，见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/install-9","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#系统要求","content":"| 项目   | 要求                                                                  |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 操作系统 | Windows 10 / 11 x64；或 glibc 兼容的 Linux x86_64（安装前核对包内记录的最低 glibc 版本） |","table":"table-0"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/install-10","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#系统要求","content":"| 项目  | 要求                                           |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 浏览器 | 较新的 Chrome、Edge 或 Firefox，推荐 1366×768 及以上分辨率 |","table":"table-0"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/install-11","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#系统要求","content":"| 项目  | 要求                                  |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 网络  | 安装和计算都不需要外网；只有接入模型服务或超算时，才需要与对应服务连通 |","table":"table-0"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/install-12","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#系统要求","content":"不支持 ARM 平台，也不保证所有 Linux 发行版都可用；特定系统的图形运行库请先在目标机器上试装确认。"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/install-13","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#获取安装包","content":"正式版本由发行方提供 ZIP 和同名的 `.zip.json` 回执。回执记录归档的 SHA256、源码提交和构建编号，收到文件后先核对摘要："},"1186":{"id":"/docs/install-14","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#获取安装包","content":"开发中的版本可在代码仓库 GitHub Actions 的 “Offline release installation” 任务产物里下载（`CableSimPro-release-Windows`、`CableSimPro-release-Linux`）。这些是验证用的构建，不是正式发布。"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/install-15","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"把 ZIP 解压到任意目录，例如 `D:\\CableSimPro`。"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/install-16","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"把解压目录里的 `release.toml` 复制到解压目录之外长期保存，例如 `D:\\CableSimPro-config\\release.toml`（Linux 如 `/etc/cablesimpro/release.toml`），以后启动、升级和回退都用这一份。用文本编辑器打开这份副本，至少确认数据目录 `storage.data_dir`：默认是用户主目录下的 `~/CableSimPro-data`，**数据目录也必须在解压目录之外**。其他配置项见 release.toml 配置。"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/install-17","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"启动时用 `--config` 指向这份配置：Windows 在 PowerShell 中运行 `.\\start.cmd --config D:\\CableSimPro-config\\release.toml`；Linux 运行 `sh start.sh --config /etc/cablesimpro/release.toml`。没有桌面的服务器加 `--no-browser`；只想完成安装和校验、不启动服务时加 `--no-start`。"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/install-18","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"首次启动会把运行时复制到 `数据目录/programs/<构建编号前 16 位>/`，在那里建立独立的 Python 环境，只从包内的 wheel 按哈希离线安装依赖，再做依赖完整性和导入检查。依赖缺失会明确失败，不会临时联网补装。"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/install-19","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"工程库不存在且 `initialization.seed_examples = true` 时，用随附的公开教学输入生成示例工程（不调用外部模型，不生成有限元结果），需要几分钟。随后服务启动，浏览器打开 `http://127.0.0.1:8100/`。"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/install-20","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"平台启动后，启动程序再启动 Agent 对话服务（默认端口 8111，只监听本机）。对话服务没有启动成功时，启动窗口会写明原因，其余功能照常可用；处理方法见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/install-21","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"安装完成后可以删除解压目录：解释器和程序都已装进数据目录，配置文件也已经放在外面。以后运行程序目录里的同名入口，并用 `--config` 指向这份配置文件："},"1194":{"id":"/docs/install-22","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#安装并启动","content":"安装程序会读取系统的 `LongPathsEnabled` 设置，按实际文件逐个检查路径长度。超出 260 字符限制时拒绝安装，并提示换一个更短的数据目录（例如 `D:/CableSimPro-data`），不要求修改系统策略。"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/install-23","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#启动时做了哪些检查","content":"服务启动后同时检查 `/api/health`、`/api/release-info` 和前端首页，全部正常才打开浏览器。`/api/release-info` 返回当前构建编号和源码提交，用来确认访问到的是刚安装的版本。"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/install-24","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#启动时做了哪些检查","content":"启动程序持有独占运行锁，同一数据目录同时只能运行一个实例。"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/install-25","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#启动时做了哪些检查","content":"启动完成前，工程接口一律返回 `503 RELEASE_STARTING`，不会在仍可能回退的时间窗口里写入工程数据。"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/install-26","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#启动时做了哪些检查","content":"运行期间不执行 npm、pip、自动更新或任何外部下载。"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/install-27","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#从源码运行开发与评估","content":"需要 Python 3.11+、Node.js 22.12+ 和 npm，首次运行要联网安装依赖。在代码仓库根目录："},"1200":{"id":"/docs/install-28","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#从源码运行开发与评估","content":"它会构建界面，在 `.data/release/` 下用与安装包相同的发布种子生成示例库，然后在 `http://127.0.0.1:8100/` 启动；之后启动保留已有数据。常用参数：`--skip-install`（依赖已就绪）、`--no-browser`、`--port 8101`。按 Ctrl+C 停止。"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/install-29","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#从源码运行开发与评估","content":"一键演示同时构建并启动 Agent 对话服务（需要 Node.js 22.12+），退出时一并停止。Agent 需要先接入模型；模型密钥只从系统凭据或环境变量读取，不写入配置文件或工程库。"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/install-30","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"配置项：release.toml 配置"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/install-31","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"Agent 对话服务：Agent 对话服务"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/install-32","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"安装或启动遇到问题：常见问题"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/install-33","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"多人通过内网访问：内网部署"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/install-34","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"升级、备份与恢复：升级与备份恢复"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/install-35","page_id":"/docs/install","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install#进一步阅读","content":"打包、校验与回退的完整技术说明：离线发行技术说明"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"page","content":"内网部署","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-0","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet","content":"让同一内网的多台电脑通过浏览器使用一台服务器上的 CableSimPro。"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-1","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#1-修改-releasetoml","content":"1. 修改 release.toml"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-2","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#2-放行端口","content":"2. 放行端口"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-3","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#3-访问","content":"3. 访问"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-4","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#放在反向代理后面","content":"放在反向代理后面"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-5","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#agent-对话","content":"Agent 对话"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-6","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#计算资源","content":"计算资源"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-7","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/intranet#数据与备份","content":"数据与备份"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-8","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet","content":"默认配置只允许本机访问。要让同一内网的同事通过浏览器使用，在服务器上按下载与安装装好后，改三处配置并放行端口。"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-9","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet","content":"当前版本不提供登录、账号和权限服务，访问到服务的人都可以读写全部工程。只在受信任的内网中开放，必要时在前面加机构已有的访问控制（VPN、带认证的反向代理等），**不要直接暴露到公网**。"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-10","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#1-修改-releasetoml","content":"`host` 必须是 IP 地址或 `localhost`，不能写主机名。"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-11","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#1-修改-releasetoml","content":"`trusted_hosts` 列出同事在浏览器地址栏里实际输入的主机名或 IP（上例为示例值，请换成你们的）。宿主会拒绝其他 Host 的请求（返回 403），也拒绝来自其他站点的跨站写入。"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-12","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#1-修改-releasetoml","content":"保存后重启服务。"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-13","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#2-放行端口","content":"在服务器防火墙中允许内网访问 `port` 指定的端口（默认 8100）。只对需要使用的网段开放。"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-14","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#3-访问","content":"同事在浏览器打开 `http://<trusted_hosts 中的名字>:8100/`。界面和全部接口都走这一个端口。"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-15","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#放在反向代理后面","content":"如果用 Nginx 等反向代理统一入口，代理把请求转发到 `http://127.0.0.1:8100`，并保留原始 Host："},"1225":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-16","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#放在反向代理后面","content":"此时浏览器地址栏里的主机名仍要列入 `trusted_hosts`。上传大小：结构表等一般请求不超过 11 MiB，厂家 PDF 原件不超过 65 MiB，超过时宿主返回 413。"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-17","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#agent-对话","content":"内网用户通过平台端口使用 Agent 对话：对话页和对话服务都经平台转发，对话服务本身只监听服务器本机（默认 8111 端口），**不需要**放行 8111 端口。模型请求由服务器上的平台进程发出，内网部署模型服务时，确认服务器能访问模型服务的地址。见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-18","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#计算资源","content":"本机方法在服务器上运行。有限元、批量仿真等标为“超算”的方法需要另外配置 Slurm 集群，见仿真计算环境。"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/install/intranet-19","page_id":"/docs/install/intranet","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/intranet#数据与备份","content":"所有用户共用服务器上的一个工程库。定期备份见升级与备份恢复。"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/install/model","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"page","content":"接入模型","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/install/model-0","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model","content":"为 Agent 接入 OpenAI 兼容接口的模型服务，包括内网私有化部署的模型。"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/install/model-1","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"在界面里配置（推荐）"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/install/model-2","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model#密钥保存在哪里","content":"密钥保存在哪里"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/install/model-3","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model#用-releasetoml-预设适合批量部署","content":"用 release.toml 预设（适合批量部署）"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/install/model-4","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model#没有配置模型时","content":"没有配置模型时"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/install/model-5","page_id":"/docs/install/model","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/model#私有化部署的模型","content":"私有化部署的模型"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/install/model-6","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model","content":"Agent 通过 **OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions 接口**（`<服务地址>/chat/completions`，Bearer 密钥）调用模型。不配置模型时，除 Agent 对话外的全部功能照常可用；计算和导出从不依赖模型。"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/install/model-7","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model","content":"模型只需配置一处：平台按“设置 → AI 模型” > `release.toml [model]` 或环境变量 `CABLESIM_LLM_*` > 环境变量 `CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_*` 的顺序确定使用哪个模型。Agent 对话服务本身拿不到密钥，模型请求由平台加上密钥后发出。详见 Agent 对话服务。"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/install/model-8","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model","content":"无论接入哪个模型，Agent 都只能读取和提出方案；保存修改、运行计算、批准和发布都要由人确认。详见 Agent 的用法和边界。"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/install/model-9","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"打开“设置 → AI 模型”："},"1240":{"id":"/docs/install/model-10","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**服务商**：从 DeepSeek、通义千问、智谱 GLM、Kimi、本机 Ollama 中选择，或选“其他兼容服务”。"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/install/model-11","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**服务地址**：API 基址，必须以 `http://` 或 `https://` 开头，不能包含账号密码、查询串或片段，例如 `https://llm.example.com/v1`。"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/install/model-12","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**模型名** 和 **API 密钥**。密钥留空表示保留已保存的密钥。"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/install/model-13","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"点 **测试连接**，通过后 **保存**。"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/install/model-14","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"其他选项："},"1245":{"id":"/docs/install/model-15","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**自定义指令**：每次对话都会带上，只影响表达方式和关注点，不能放宽权限、数值核验或批准规则。"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/install/model-16","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**单次模型请求超时**：默认 30 秒，网络慢或模型较大时调高，对新建任务生效。"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/install/model-17","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**上下文窗口与最大输出**（token）：Agent 按这两项安排每次请求和长对话的自动压缩。上下文窗口留空时按 64,000 处理；最大输出留空时最多 16,384，并至少为输入保留 8,192。修改后对空闲对话的下一条消息生效。"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/install/model-18","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#在界面里配置推荐","content":"**长期记忆**：按工程和研究隔离地记住偏好与经验，需要先安装对应依赖；记忆不是工程依据，也不代表批准。"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/install/model-19","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#密钥保存在哪里","content":"服务地址、模型名、自定义指令和超时保存在工程库里；**API 密钥保存在操作系统的凭据管理器中**（Windows 凭据管理器、Linux 密钥环等）。系统没有可用的凭据管理器时，密钥只保存在当前进程内存里，重启后需要重新输入。密钥不会写进工程库、文件、接口响应或日志。"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/install/model-20","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#用-releasetoml-预设适合批量部署","content":"在 release.toml 的 `[model]` 中填写服务地址和模型名，密钥放在环境变量里："},"1251":{"id":"/docs/install/model-21","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#用-releasetoml-预设适合批量部署","content":"界面中保存过的设置优先于 release.toml；界面只改了模型名、服务地址不变时，继续使用环境变量里的密钥。无论哪种方式，密钥都只从系统凭据或环境变量读取。"},"1252":{"id":"/docs/install/model-22","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#用-releasetoml-预设适合批量部署","content":"也可以不写 `[model]`，直接设置三个环境变量 `CABLESIM_LLM_BASE_URL`、`CABLESIM_LLM_MODEL`、`CABLESIM_LLM_API_KEY`；从源码运行时使用的 `CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_BASE_URL`、`CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_ID`、`CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_API_KEY` 优先级最低。服务地址、模型名和密钥须来自同一来源，不会混用。"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/install/model-23","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#没有配置模型时","content":"Agent 页显示“还没有配置 AI 模型：在‘设置 · AI 模型’里填写……”，发送消息会被拒绝，不调用任何服务，也不产生任何结果。型号、计算、仿真、交付等其余功能不依赖模型。"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/install/model-24","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#私有化部署的模型","content":"内网里自建的模型服务只要提供 OpenAI 兼容的 Chat Completions 接口即可接入，例如本机或内网的 Ollama、vLLM 等推理服务。把服务地址填成它的 API 基址（Ollama 通常是 `http://<主机>:11434/v1`），模型名填服务中已部署的模型。"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/install/model-25","page_id":"/docs/install/model","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/model#私有化部署的模型","content":"Agent 会调用多个工具完成任务，请选择支持工具调用（function calling）的模型。接入后在 Agent 页面提一个只读问题，例如“列出这个工程里的研究和最近一次运行结果”，确认模型能正确调用工具。"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","type":"page","content":"工程库备份、恢复与版本保护","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署","发行与维护技术说明"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-0","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"提交级变化通知与索引回退"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-1","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#命令行","content":"命令行"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-2","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"宿主接口"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-3","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#源码封签与平台一致性","content":"源码封签与平台一致性"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-4","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","content":"数据库的 `PRAGMA user_version=2` 标识当前宿主存储基线。版本0/1库在取得独占所有权的启动初始化中保留全部工程、研究和运行，增量建立四张Agent任务侧表，升级为2；任务表的具体职责见模块设计 §14。计划修订不可变、事件只追加，工程事实和运行仍由原表保存。仅支持版本0/1的旧程序不能写版本2库；后续不兼容存储改动须继续增加版本并提供迁移。构造工程库对象时以及启动初始化前均用只读连接检查版本，新于程序支持范围则抛出 `DATABASE_VERSION_TOO_NEW`，不执行DDL、WAL设置或其他数据库写入。"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-5","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","content":"备份使用 SQLite 在线 backup API，包含已提交的 WAL 内容，输出独立SQLite文件、SHA256及JSON元数据；不直接复制运行中的主文件。包含库内所有表：工程及版本、型号资料、厂家原件BLOB、提取/审批、运行快照、JSON工件、保存报告，以及Agent任务、计划、步骤和审计事件。模型的非敏感设置包含在备份中；密钥由系统凭据库、进程内存或环境提供，不进入数据库或备份，恢复数据库不会恢复密钥。插件程序、外部超算原始作业/数据集目录和环境配置不是数据库备份的一部分；本接口不宣称打包这些外部资产。"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-6","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"宿主在版本2库内增加两张内部通知表和每张普通工程业务表的三个原生 `AFTER INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE` 触发器。这是附加元数据，未增加 `user_version`；通知表沿用的 `schema_version` 字段现在保存实际结构的 SHA256，而消费游标中的同名字段保存 SQLite 的结构变化计数，两者均与前述存储版本门禁不同。SQLite backup/restore 可改变内部结构计数而不改变任何建表/触发器定义，不能因此追加工程变化通知。"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-7","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"| 对象                        | 内容与用途                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `_workspace_change_state` | 单行保存通知命名空间 `namespace`、行变化序号 `epoch` 和触发器覆盖时的结构 SHA256（历史字段名 `schema_version`）。摘要核对 `sqlite_master` 中的实际定义；旧计数格式在当前宿主初始化时转为摘要格式。用于判断增量窗口是否连续，不能用序号推断运行或研究状态。 |","table":"table-0"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-8","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"| 对象                   | 内容与用途                                                                                                        |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `_workspace_changes` | 每个受影响行记录序号、来源表、操作和旧/新行键。行键含物理主键及可用的 `id/proposal_id/task_id/workspace/study/document`；没有安全行键时记空值，索引保守比较该来源表。 |","table":"table-0"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-9","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"| 对象                                                | 内容与用途                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `_workspace_change_<表名摘要>_<insert/update/delete>` | 工程业务表的通知触发器；排除 SQLite 内部表、上述两张通知表和 `agent_` 元数据表。其他宿主连接、外部普通 SQL 同样触发，不依赖 Python 回调。UPDATE 用空值安全、区分存储类型的二进制比较，只在新旧行值实际不同时记录。 |","table":"table-0"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-10","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"通知与业务修改在同一连接、同一事务内写入，提交才对其他连接可见，事务或保存点回滚会同时撤回通知和序号。它不保存字段差异、工程输入/输出正文、工件、原件BLOB或凭据，也不代替业务审计、历史版本与撤销记录；索引仍从原表读取并核验冻结摘要、引用和当前性。DDL 不逐行记录，安装或修复覆盖时追加 `source_table='*', operation='SCHEMA'` 屏障。"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-11","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"索引单次最多消费4096条连续通知。仅在本次 `WorkspaceStore` 事务确实留下通知时，提交前删除 `epoch < 当前序号 - 4096` 的记录，因此该次提交后最多保留4097条（含边界记录）；空事务、同值更新和已撤回全部变化的保存点不修剪、不改 epoch。这是条数窗口，不是按时间过期，也不是数据库字节上限。独立模块连接或外部 SQL 的触发器只追加，不自行修剪，需等下一次产生通知的正常宿主写事务修剪；期间可能超过4097条。消费者落后超过窗口、记录缺失或格式异常时回退完整来源身份比较，不以缺记录表示“没有变化”。"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-12","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"只读 Agent 回答可以记录任务、计划、步骤、事件等 `agent_` 元数据，但不能因此修改工程通知表。索引对这些较小的任务/方案身份做完整精确比较，身份包含相关事件序号；工程运行等大来源仍按通知增量读取。方案提出、批准或拒绝后，任务名片、方案状态和统一待办照常即时刷新。没有新增通知表，也没有给测试的 authorizer 或完整转储断言开例外。"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-13","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"备份包含这两张表、已提交通知和触发器，包含未合并到主文件的已提交WAL；索引内存缓存和消费游标不在备份中。离线恢复后重启宿主，索引首先完整比较来源并核验，再建立新的增量基线。当前通知格式的库若实际结构不变，幂等接口和恢复后的初始化均保持通知表及触发器内容不变；旧通知格式升级会在初始化中修复触发器并建立结构屏障。恢复没有通知表的旧备份时，当前宿主在启动写初始化中建立通知表与触发器，第一次索引仍完整比较，随后使用连续通知。不要手动删除通知表而保留触发器，否则后续业务写入会因触发器找不到表而失败。"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-14","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"外部新增表、增加列或改动触发器使 SQLite `schema_version` 改变，下一次索引读取立即完整比较。只读索引不修复数据库结构；下次正常 `WorkspaceStore` 写事务在提交前安装或修复触发器并写结构屏障，索引再完整比较一次、建立基线，之后连续提交恢复增量。未覆盖的新表不会被当成“已完整记录”；不能省略这两次可能出现的回退，也不要求工程师手动清缓存。"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-15","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#提交级变化通知与索引回退","content":"回退到仍支持版本2、但不认识通知的旧宿主时，已有原生触发器仍随普通业务写入追加记录；旧宿主不会修剪，通知表可持续增长，并增加写入与备份体积。它也不会给新建业务表补触发器。再次用当前宿主打开时修复覆盖、按窗口修剪并完整建立索引基线。更老且不支持版本2的程序仍受版本门禁拒绝；附加通知结构不保证任意版本降级兼容。需要降级时先备份并核对目标版本，不把通知日志当作可独立恢复工程的文件。"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-16","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#命令行","content":"输出为UTF-8 JSON；成功退出0，拒绝/失败退出2。备份目标已存在时拒绝覆盖。恢复取得与宿主相同的OS独占锁；仍在运行则返回 `DATABASE_IN_USE`。恢复前核对SHA256、SQLite完整性、必要工程表和版本，先生成 `数据库路径.snapshots/before-restore-UUID.sqlite` 安全副本，再通过SQLite事务恢复。校验失败不替换原库。"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-17","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"接口在既有宿主router中挂载，所有请求/JSON响应有OpenAPI模型。时间为UTC；大小为byte；版本与ID无物理单位。"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-18","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                          | 输入与结果         |\n| --------------------------- | ------------- |\n| `GET /api/database/version` | 当前库版本和支持的最高版本 |","table":"table-1"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-19","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                           | 输入与结果                                                                                         |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `POST /api/database/backups` | `{request_id:UUID}`；201返回id、SHA256、schema_version、size_bytes、created、download_url；相同编号重试复用原备份 |","table":"table-1"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-20","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                          | 输入与结果            |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `GET /api/database/backups` | 已完成且通过完整性核对的备份列表 |","table":"table-1"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-21","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                                    | 输入与结果                             |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `GET /api/database/backups/{id}/file` | 下载SQLite备份，`X-Artifact-SHA256`响应头 |","table":"table-1"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-22","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                            | 输入与结果                                                                                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `POST /api/database/restores` | `{request_id:UUID,backup_id:UUID,sha256:HEX,confirm_replace:true}`；202表示`pending_restart`，当前库尚未改变 |","table":"table-1"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-23","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                                   | 输入与结果                                         |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `GET /api/database/restores/current` | `none/pending_restart/restored`，恢复完成后给出安全副本位置 |","table":"table-1"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-24","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"| 请求                                                      | 输入与结果                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| `DELETE /api/database/restores/current?request_id=UUID` | 取消同一待执行请求；204。不同编号返回409 |","table":"table-1"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-25","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"API恢复在下次宿主启动、取得工程库独占锁后执行，早于任意模块初始化；不在活跃请求、计算线程或WAL锚连接存在时替换数据库。恢复前安全副本包含重启前最新保存的数据。前端收到`pending_restart`应提示停止编辑并重启；确认对象是整个工程库，不是单个工程。恢复凭据保存在数据库外，恢复完成后的相同请求重放不会再次覆盖数据。损坏备份在启动时仍会阻止恢复，保留原库和待处理请求，不宣称成功。"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-26","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#宿主接口","content":"常用错误码：`DATABASE_VERSION_TOO_NEW`、`DATABASE_SNAPSHOT_CORRUPT`、`DATABASE_SNAPSHOT_INVALID`、`DATABASE_SNAPSHOT_EXISTS`、`DATABASE_RESTORE_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED`、`DATABASE_RESTORE_PENDING`、`DATABASE_RESTORE_CONFLICT`、`DATABASE_IN_USE`、`DATABASE_IO_ERROR`。接口拒绝使用404/409/422，磁盘/权限/SQLite I/O故障为503。"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-27","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#源码封签与平台一致性","content":"`.gitattributes` 对全部backend公共源码、SDK、插件源码和清单指定LF；插件assets使用`text=auto eol=lf`，SVG等文本固定LF，PNG等二进制保留原字节。`tests/test_checkout_seals.py` 将当前源码放入隔离Git索引，以`core.autocrlf=true`干净检出后实际执行`plugin_sdk.py verify`，不提交或改动主仓库索引。"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-28","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#源码封签与平台一致性","content":"运行中的宿主每次解析方法重新读取清单并核验源码；`/api/input-contracts`及方法调用遇到封签不符返回409和原`PACKAGE_*`错误码，清单解析/文件读取失败分别用`PLUGIN_MANIFEST_INVALID`、`PLUGIN_SEAL_INVALID`、`PLUGIN_INPUT_CONTRACT_INVALID`。旧运行不重算，已保存工程不丢失。"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations-29","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/database-operations#源码封签与平台一致性","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/architecture/database-operations.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"page","content":"离线发行构建、安装与回退","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署","发行与维护技术说明"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-0","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"构建与发行范围"},"1289":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-1","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"一条命令安装并启动"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-2","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"升级与恢复"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-3","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"Agent 对话"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-4","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#伴随进程扩展","content":"伴随进程扩展"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-5","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","content":"发行入口是 `scripts/build_release.py`、`scripts/install_release.py` 和\n`scripts/run_release.py`。`scripts/run_demo.py` 的开发构建和数据行为保持原样。"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-6","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"为 Windows 10 / 11 x64 和 Linux x86_64 分别构建 ZIP。**安装端不需要预装 Python、Python Launcher、Node、npm、编译器或 Git**，也不需要管理员权限。\n包内 `runtime/python` 是固定的 64 位 CPython 3.12.15（python-build-standalone，20261003）；\n`start.cmd` / `start.sh` 直接运行这个解释器，不寻找系统的 `py`、`python` 或 `python3.12`。\n系统只有 Python 3.11 或完全未装 Python，不改变发行入口选择。\nAgent 对话由随包的 Node.js 运行（见下文“Agent 对话”），同样不寻找系统的 `node`，也不需要 npm。\nLinux 使用兼容 wheel 的 glibc 系统；发行包包含 CAD 需要的图形运行库和对应许可证，\n`runtime/native-manifest.json` 记录实际依赖的最低 glibc，安装前核对当前系统版本。\n发行包不替换系统 glibc、动态加载器或硬件驱动。CI 的干净 Ubuntu / Windows runner\n会实际验证安装和 CAD 导出。包内运行时、标准库、venv、ensurepip、pip、SQLite/TLS 依赖和上游许可一并保留；不宣称适用于所有 Linux 发行版或 ARM。\n运行时 URL、版本及 SHA256 固定在 `scripts/python_runtime.lock.json`；下载仅发生在构建机，\n校验摘要后安全解包，把包内符号链接物化为普通文件，拒绝越界、循环链接和特殊文件。\n`runtime/python-runtime.json` 记录来源与许可路径，所有运行时文件纳入发行摘要。"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-7","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"构建机器联网准备既有前端生产构建和平台 wheel；最终用户安装时全程离线："},"1296":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-8","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"CI 使用 `.github/workflows/ci.yml` 的既有发行任务在两个系统完成构建与安装验收。\n前端目录必须有真实 `index.html`、JS 和 OCCT WASM；打包前执行全库插件封签核验。\nLinux 可使用同一套经核验的跨平台前端构建。发行构建不运行有限元求解器。"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-9","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"`build_release.py` 将宿主依赖和 `cablesim.cable-geometry` 声明的精确依赖解析为当前\n平台 wheel，生成包含所有传递依赖 SHA256 的 `requirements.lock`。可用\n`--wheelhouse <目录>` 重用已经解析的完整 wheel 集；多版本重复包或非 wheel 文件会拒绝。\nZIP 内含后端、SDK、封签插件、种子入口、规格书样式、预构建前端、Python 运行时、Node.js 运行时、Agent 边车和离线依赖。\n构建时还用实际随包解释器离线解析完整哈希锁，确认 wheel 与其 ABI 相容；不只依据构建机版本判断。\n源码来自 Git 跟踪文件，开发库、密钥、测试输出和本地环境不会进入发行包。"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-10","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#构建与发行范围","content":"每个 ZIP 旁生成 `.zip.json`，记录归档 SHA256、源码提交、平台/Python 目标和 build_id；\n同提交的 `.source.zip` 保存 Git 跟踪的构建与测试源码，摘要写入回执，用于独立复现，不包含工作区生成物。\n包内 `release-manifest.json` 记录每个不可变文件的大小与 SHA256；文件损坏会阻止安装\n或启动。它提供完整性核验，不冒充发行方数字签名。`release.toml` 为可编辑配置，不纳入\n不可变文件摘要；安装后的每个程序版本都有独立的不可变目录。"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-11","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"解压后编辑根目录的 `release.toml`（源模板为 `scripts/release.toml`）。保留这份配置，\n升级继续使用同一个 `storage.data_dir`。新配置默认 `~/CableSimPro-data`，其中 `~` 是\n用户主目录；Windows 不依赖 Downloads 中可能很深的解压路径。已有配置里的显式路径\n继续原样使用。其它相对路径仍相对于配置文件目录解释，也可指定 `D:/CableSimPro-data`\n等短路径。数据目录必须放在解压目录之外。"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-12","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"Windows："},"1301":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-13","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"也可以双击 `start.cmd`（源文件 `scripts/start_release.cmd`）。Linux："},"1302":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-14","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"`start.sh` 源文件为 `scripts/start_release.sh`。两个入口都直接使用当前解压包内的解释器，\n安装时先把运行时复制到 `data_dir/programs/<build_id前16位>/runtime/python`，再由该副本创建 `.venv`。\n因此 `pyvenv.cfg` 不引用系统 Python 或原下载目录；清理原解压目录不会破坏已安装解释器。\n后续可运行安装目录内的同名入口，并通过 `--config` 指向保留在程序目录外的配置。\n可追加 `--no-browser` 在无桌面系统使用；`--no-start` 只完成安装校验。\n安装命令使用 `--no-index --require-hashes --no-cache-dir`，只从随包 wheelhouse 安装，\n再执行依赖完整性检查和真实宿主/CAD 导入检查。依赖缺失会明确失败，不临时联网补装。"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-15","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"首次启动仅在工程库不存在且 `initialization.seed_examples=true` 时调用现有的\n`seed_release`，从公开、注明用途的随附教学输入生成发布示例。它不读取开发库，不调用\n外部模型，不生成有限元结果。已有库无论种子版本是否变化都不会重新播种或替换。\n设置 `seed_examples=false` 可创建空工程库。"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-16","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"服务启动后同时检查 `/api/health`、`/api/release-info` 和前端主页，再打开浏览器。\n`GET /api/release-info` 返回当前发行 `build_id` 和 `git_commit`，用于确认健康检查命中\n正确发行版本。所有 API 和前端共用配置中的一个端口。缺少的 API 或静态资源返回 404，\n前端页面导航才回退到 SPA。正常退出、启动失败或必需伴随进程退出都会回收子进程。"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-17","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#一条命令安装并启动","content":"运行期间不执行 npm、pip、自动更新或外部资产下载。默认模型连接为空；使用内网模型时\n填写 `model.base_url`、`model.model`，密钥填写在 `model.api_key_env` 指定的环境变量，\n不要把密钥写进配置。已有后端模型设置仍按现有规则优先。对外网络断开时，计算与导出\n使用本地方法、字体、前端资产和依赖；不需要模型服务。"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-18","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"停止当前服务，把新发行包解压到另一个目录，使用原配置执行同一安装命令："},"1307":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-19","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"Windows 使用 `start.cmd --config D:\\config\\release.toml`，同样无需系统 Python。\n程序、运行时与依赖安装在 `data_dir/programs/<build_id前16位>/`，运行解释器是其 `.venv`；旧程序与\n环境被保留。工程库位于 `data_dir/engineering.sqlite`，数据集、复现资料和工程证据\n分别位于 `datasets/`、`library/`、`engineering-evidence/`。"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-20","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"清单与安装记录始终使用完整 64 位 build_id；复用短目录前核对完整身份，身份冲突会拒绝，\n不会覆盖另一个版本。Windows 安装前读取并记录 `LongPathsEnabled`，按实际 wheel\n成员及字节码目标检查路径长度；超出默认限制时提示选择更短 `data_dir`，不要求修改系统\n策略。旧的完整摘要目录仍可读取和回退。"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-21","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"启动程序使用独占运行锁，先调用既有 `database_ops.check_existing` 的只读版本门禁。\n新于程序支持版本的库在任何迁移前被拒绝。切换到新的发行版本前，在数据库所有权锁下\n调用 SQLite backup API（含已提交 WAL）创建 `release-snapshots/` 快照，校验完整性\n和 SHA256，随后才允许新宿主初始化。已有待重启恢复请求时升级会拒绝，须先用当前版\n完成或取消。备份范围与工程库维护契约一致。"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-22","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"只有 API 和前端都健康才更新 `release-state.json`。健康检查前失败会停止新进程并\n恢复升级前工程库，旧 active 版本不变；进程被强制中断时，下次启动从\n`release-pending.json` 恢复未完成升级。健康检查后已经可以接受用户写入，之后的运行\n错误不会自动丢弃用户数据。"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-23","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"启动提交完成前，发行入口仅允许 `/api/health`、`/api/release-info` 和静态页面访问；\n所有工程 API 读写均返回 `503 RELEASE_STARTING`。更新 active 并清除 pending 后才开放，\n因此不能在仍可能回退的健康检查窗口接受工程写入。"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-24","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"若首次启动在没有旧快照时失败但已经产生数据库，会保留全部文件并写\n`release-initialization-failed.json`，后续启动明确拒绝把它当成完整初始化结果。\n应核对日志、使用数据库维护工具检查或恢复，完成后再移除失败标记；程序不自动删除它。"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-25","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"需要主动回退到上一版本时，停止服务后执行："},"1314":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-26","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#升级与恢复","content":"Windows 对应使用安装目录的 `.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe`，不是系统 `py`。\n回退到不含 Agent 的旧发行版前，须先从 `release.toml` 删去 `[agent]` 一节：旧版本不认识这一节，会拒绝启动\n（数据库已按上述契约恢复，删去后即可正常启动）。\n此命令恢复上一份已运行程序及其升级前数据库；回退前仍按既有恢复契约保留当前数据库\n安全副本。**升级后新增或修改的工程数据不会出现在升级前快照中**，因此只应在明确需要\n回退时使用；后续数据可从保留的安全副本核查。日常数据库恢复仍用\n`scripts/workspace_db.py` 和现有数据库 API，不手工复制运行中的 SQLite 主文件。\n存在未完成发行升级或已排队的数据库恢复请求时，版本回退明确拒绝；先完成或取消对应\n请求，避免两种恢复操作互相覆盖。"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-27","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"安装包自带 Agent 对话，装好、配好模型就能用，全程不需要网络安装或系统 Node。"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-28","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"**随包内容。** `runtime/node/` 是固定版本的官方 Node.js（版本、下载地址、SHA256 固定在\n`scripts/node_runtime.lock.json`，对应 `SHASUMS256.txt` 的 GPG 签名已核对）。只取解释器和\nLICENSE，不含 npm、npx、corepack：安装后的产品既不能装包也不能更新包。`agent/` 是边车：它实际\nimport 到的 `studio/` TypeScript 源码（`fusion/`、`host/`、`shared/` 中的文件）、构建好的对话页\n`dist-fusion/`，以及生产依赖 `node_modules/`。生产依赖从 `studio/package-lock.json` 推导出只含\npi 系列包及其传递依赖的子锁（`agent/package-lock.json`，条目的版本、地址与完整性值原样照抄），用\n`npm ci --omit=dev --ignore-scripts` 在构建机装好；页面工具链（React、Vite、three 等）不进包。构建时\n用随包 Node 加载入口模块和每个裸导入，装不全就构建失败。`better-sqlite3` 只为解析导入而存在，其原生\n模块不编译也不使用（边车不开本地库）。Node、`agent/` 的每个文件都在 `release-manifest.json` 里有大小\n与 SHA256，`node_runtime`、`agent` 两项记录进 build_id；第三方许可汇入 `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt`。\nWindows x64 与 Linux x86_64 两个包都带；Linux 的 Node 另要求 glibc（构建时从二进制实测并写入\n`runtime/node-runtime.json`，安装前核对）和系统 libstdc++（官方二进制动态链接，与 CAD 运行库同类前提）。"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-29","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"**启动与退出。** `release.toml` 的 `[agent]` 默认 `enabled = true`、`port = 8111`。`run_release.py`\n在平台之后启动 `runtime/node/node.exe fusion/server.ts`（工作目录 `agent/`），边车只监听\n`127.0.0.1:<port>`；退出、必需进程失败或被中断时与平台一起回收（Windows 用 Ctrl+Break，边车在其中\n先关闭会话再退出）。边车是可选进程：没起来时工作台其余功能照常，启动窗口和 Agent 页都会说明原因，\n`enabled = false` 则完全不启动。端口被占用在启动前就明确失败，提示改 `[agent] port` 或关闭 Agent。"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-30","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"**一次一密的私链。** 平台与边车共用的令牌每次启动由启动器随机生成，只放进这两个进程的环境（以及\n平台向边车转发时的 `Authorization`），启动器自己和它启动的其他进程（用户配置的伴随进程、浏览器）都拿不到；\n不写配置、日志或文件；边车的 API 校验令牌与 Host、只收本机。\n平台通过 `CABLESIM_AGENT_SIDECAR_URL` 找到边车，用 `CABLESIM_AGENT_UI` 在同源的 `/agent-app/`\n提供对话页，浏览器只访问平台的 `/agent-sidecar/`。边车数据（对话文件）在 `data_dir/agent/`，随\n`data_dir` 一起保留；不属于 `workspace_db.py` 备份的工程库范围。"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-31","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"**模型只配一处。** 边车不接触任何模型密钥：它向平台询问当前模型名，模型请求由平台加上密钥后转发。\n边车进程的环境是白名单（Node 启动所需的系统变量、令牌与端口），任何服务商密钥、代理设置和\n`NODE_OPTIONS` 都不会传入。平台解析模型的顺序（`backend/harness/model_settings.py`，Agent 和其余 AI\n功能共用）是："},"1320":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-32","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"应用里“设置 · AI 模型”保存的配置，密钥进系统凭据库（Windows 凭据管理器），页面读不回；"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-33","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"`release.toml` 的 `[model]`（`base_url`、`model`，密钥取自 `api_key_env` 指的环境变量，默认\n`CABLESIM_LLM_API_KEY`），或直接设置 `CABLESIM_LLM_BASE_URL` / `_MODEL` / `_API_KEY`；"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-34","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"环境变量 `CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_BASE_URL` / `_ID` / `_API_KEY`，与 `scripts/run_demo.py` 同名同义。"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-35","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#agent-对话","content":"`[model]` 的 `base_url` 与 `model` 都留空时，本节不指定任何连接，环境里的 `CABLESIM_LLM_*` 照常生效；\n只要写了其中一项，整个连接就以本节为准，密钥只取 `api_key_env` 所指的变量，没设就是没有密钥，\n不会借用别处的。三项要配齐才算一组，不同来源的地址、模型和密钥不会拼在一起。没配模型时 Agent 页\n显示“还没有配置 AI 模型：在‘设置 · AI 模型’里填写……”，不调用任何服务、不产生假结果。\n开发时遗留在 shell 里的 `CABLESIM_AGENT_SIDECAR_*`、`CABLESIM_AGENT_UI` 不会进入平台，边车的链接只由启动器生成。"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-36","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#伴随进程扩展","content":"配置可追加 `[[processes]]`，设置唯一名称、参数数组 `command`、`cwd`、非敏感 `env`\n及 `required`。占位符 `{python}`、`{app_dir}`、`{data_dir}` 解析为发行解释器、当前\n程序和数据目录。命令直接执行，不交给 shell；不自动下载进程依赖。\n必需进程退出会停止宿主，可选进程退出不阻断核心工作台。Agent 边车由 `[agent]` 专门管理，\n不需要在这里重复配置。"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-37","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#伴随进程扩展","content":"Linux 宿主把随包 `runtime/linux-libs` 加入其原生库搜索路径，保留原有路径。插件宿主会\n清理子进程继承的环境，因此发行专用 `scripts/release_python.sh` 在进入同一 `.venv`\n之前重新绑定这个固定目录；不向插件开放宿主密钥或代理环境，也不改插件执行器和封签。"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-38","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#伴随进程扩展","content":"发行验收脚本 `scripts/verify_installation.py` 在解压目录外隔离数据，实际调用 `start.cmd` / `start.sh` 安装、启动并经发布示例 API 导出。\n安装子进程的 PATH 中没有 Python、py、pip、Node 或 npm；记录实际解释器、基础运行时、标准库路径与版本。\n同一进程里它还验收 Agent：边车由随包 Node 启动，未配模型时 Agent 页接口给出去“设置 · AI 模型”的提示；\n经设置接口配上本机假模型（只在进程内存存钥）后，用真实的只读工具问一次工程库，断言答案取自平台工具\n返回的数据、模型收到的密钥由平台加入，而边车响应、启动日志和整个数据目录（工程库、对话文件）里都搜不到它。\n验收环境会清掉开发者自己的 `CABLESIM_LLM_*`、`CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_*`、`CABLESIM_AGENT_*`。Windows 防火墙规则同样覆盖随包 `node.exe`。\n`prepare_release_verifier.py` 用发行 ZIP 自带运行时和随包哈希锁 wheel 创建独立的证据工具环境；\n进入操作系统网络隔离后的验证驱动也使用该环境，而非 `actions/setup-python` 的解释器。\nWindows 防火墙覆盖驱动、安装器、已安装基础解释器及 venv，避免重定向器绕过禁网。\n验收末尾删除原始解压目录后再次运行已安装的公开入口，并验证健康、运行时来源和外网阻断。\n`release_runtime_verification.py` 保存这些独立观察，不把单元测试替代实际安装证据。\n包、PDF、Excel、逐页图片、接口快照与验证日志只进入 CI artifact。\nWindows 10/11 真实桌面双击、机构内网策略和特定 Linux 系统运行库仍需在对应机器核验，\n不以 Windows Server runner 替代这些桌面环境结论。"},"1327":{"id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation-39","page_id":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/reference/release-installation#伴随进程扩展","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/architecture/release-installation.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"page","content":"升级与备份恢复","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","安装与部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-0","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","content":"升级到新版本、回退到上一版本，以及工程库的备份与恢复。"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-1","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"升级"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-2","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"升级后，已保存的结果是否仍然有效"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-3","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#回退到上一版本","content":"回退到上一版本"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-4","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#备份工程库","content":"备份工程库"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-5","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#恢复工程库","content":"恢复工程库"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-6","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#进一步阅读","content":"进一步阅读"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-7","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"停止正在运行的服务（在启动窗口按 Ctrl+C）。"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-8","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"把新版安装包解压到**另一个**目录。"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-9","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"用安装时保存在解压目录之外的那份配置文件，运行新包里的入口："},"1339":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-10","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"升级时会发生这些事："},"1340":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-11","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"新程序装进 `数据目录/programs/<新构建编号前16位>/`，旧程序和它的环境保留不动。"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-12","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"启动新版之前，先用 SQLite 备份接口给工程库做一份快照，放在 `数据目录/release-snapshots/`，并核对完整性和 SHA256。"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-13","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"新版只有在界面和接口都检查通过后才成为当前版本。健康检查前失败会停止新进程、恢复升级前的工程库，旧版本保持为当前版本；升级过程中被强制中断，下次启动会自动从未完成的升级中恢复。"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-14","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"工程库版本比程序支持的更新时，任何迁移之前就会拒绝启动。"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-15","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级","content":"数据目录中的工程库、数据集、复现资料、工程证据、备份和 Agent 对话记录（`数据目录/agent/`）全部保留；配置文件继续使用同一份。"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-16","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"升级可能同时更新计算插件。已保存的运行记录不会被改写，也不会自动重算。平台在读取每一次运行时，把它当时使用的插件发行与当前安装的发行逐一比较："},"1346":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-17","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"| 情况       | 界面显示 | 是否需要处理 |\n| -------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 插件发行没有变化 | 当前结果 | 不需要    |","table":"table-0"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-18","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"| 情况                                                   | 界面显示                | 是否需要处理            |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------- |\n| 新发行只改了说明或显示（方法说明，参数的显示单位、换算比例或偏移，SI 单位不变），且能证明计算内容不变 | 提示“方法说明已更新；保存结果仍有效” | 不需要；结果仍可用于对比和正式交付 |","table":"table-0"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-19","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"| 情况                                 | 界面显示                                                                                               | 是否需要处理                         |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 计算相关内容有变化（包括参数的 SI 单位），或无法证明计算内容不变 | 标为历史结果并写明原因，例如“基于旧版本方法 1.2.0（cablesim.iec60287）；当前安装版本 1.2.1”；研究页显示“方法 … 已更新（1.2.0 → 1.2.1），结果需重算” | 按当前方法重新运行后才是当前结果；不重算时结果保留为历史结果 |","table":"table-0"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-20","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"| 情况              | 界面显示                           | 是否需要处理       |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------ |\n| 研究引用的电缆型号发布了新版本 | “基于旧版本型号 1.0.0（……）；当前版本 1.0.1” | 需要采用新版本时重新运行 |","table":"table-0"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-21","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"| 情况               | 界面显示          | 是否需要处理              |\n| ---------------- | ------------- | ------------------- |\n| 运行所用的插件已卸载或当前不可用 | “方法 …… 当前不可用” | 恢复安装该插件，或改用其他方法重新运行 |","table":"table-0"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-22","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"“能证明计算内容不变”由平台比较新旧两个已封签发行中与计算有关的部分得出，不依据版本号判断。"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-23","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"对交付文件的影响："},"1353":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-24","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"**已导出的交付存档**保持当时生成的文件，不会被改写。"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-25","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"**重新生成规格书**时，若引用的运行是历史结果，封面会注明“历史结果 · ……；请重算后生成当前规格书”。先在型号设计中重新运行相应通道，再生成。"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-26","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"**已提交审核或已发布的规格书**与提交时的内容摘要绑定。重新运行使规格书内容发生变化后，原提交即失效，需要重新提交审核；失效的批准记录不会填入交付文件的签栏。"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-27","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效","content":"**计算书**引用的运行若为历史结果，文件中会标明版本状态；需要当前结果时先重新运行再生成。"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-28","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#回退到上一版本","content":"只在升级后确实需要回到旧版时使用。停止服务后，用**当前版本**程序目录里的解释器执行："},"1358":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-29","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#回退到上一版本","content":"Windows 使用 `.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe`。回退会恢复上一版程序和它的升级前工程库；回退前仍会保留当前工程库的安全副本。"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-30","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#回退到上一版本","content":"回退到不含 Agent 对话服务的旧版本前，先从 `release.toml` 删除整个 `[agent]` 一节，否则旧版本会拒绝启动。"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-31","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#回退到上一版本","content":"**升级之后新增或修改的工程数据不在升级前快照里**，回退后看不到这些数据，需要时可以从保留的安全副本中核查。存在未完成的升级或已排队的数据库恢复请求时，回退会被拒绝，先完成或取消对应请求。"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-32","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#备份工程库","content":"备份包含整个工程库：厂家原件、输入版本、运行结果、内嵌工件和计算书。它不是插件安装包，也不包含超算上的原始作业目录。"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-33","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#备份工程库","content":"**在界面里**：打开“设置 → 数据与备份”，点 **立即备份**。完成的备份列在同一页，可以下载。"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-34","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#备份工程库","content":"**用命令行**（在程序目录中，用其 `.venv` 的 Python）："},"1364":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-35","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#备份工程库","content":"命令输出 JSON，其中有备份文件的 SHA256，请和备份文件一起保存。目标文件已存在时拒绝覆盖。备份使用 SQLite 在线备份接口，包含已提交的数据，服务运行时也可以执行。"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-36","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#恢复工程库","content":"**在界面里**：在“设置 → 数据与备份”选择一份备份发起恢复。恢复不会立即替换当前工程库，而是在**下次启动**、取得工程库独占锁之后执行；替换前会先保留一份当前工程库的副本。待执行的恢复可以取消。"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-37","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#恢复工程库","content":"**用命令行**：先停止服务，再执行："},"1367":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-38","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#恢复工程库","content":"服务仍在运行时会返回 `DATABASE_IN_USE`。恢复前会核对 SHA256、SQLite 完整性、必要的工程表和库版本。"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-39","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#恢复工程库","content":"不要手工复制运行中的 `engineering.sqlite` 主文件来代替备份。"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-40","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#进一步阅读","content":"离线发行技术说明：升级状态文件、回退条件和失败处理的完整规则。"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore-41","page_id":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/install/upgrade-restore#进一步阅读","content":"工程库维护技术说明：备份内容、版本门禁、接口和错误码。"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","type":"page","content":"方法清单","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/catalog"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"当前发行的全部计算插件、计算能力、方法版本、验证等级与求解位置。"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"下表由各插件清单（`plugins/*/plugin.json`）在构建时生成，与软件实际安装的插件一致。每项能力的适用范围、输入参数和验证用例见对应的方法页，或在软件的“方法 → 插件”中查看。"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"验证等级的含义："},"1375":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"| 验证等级   | 含义              |\n| ------ | --------------- |\n| 解析基准核对 | 与独立的解析解或手算逐项核对。 |","table":"table-0"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"| 验证等级   | 含义                         |\n| ------ | -------------------------- |\n| 参考算例核对 | 与公开算例、标准附录、文献或商业软件的保存结果核对。 |","table":"table-0"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"| 验证等级 | 含义                       |\n| ---- | ------------------------ |\n| 接口测试 | 验证了输入输出契约和拒绝规则，数值本身另有出处。 |","table":"table-0"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"| 验证等级   | 含义                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------- |\n| 未经独立验证 | 仅作参考研究使用，结果不能单独作为工程依据。 |","table":"table-0"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/methods/catalog-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/catalog","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/catalog","content":"<PluginCatalog />"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"page","content":"有限元对照","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem","content":"有限元温度场、暂态、护套损耗与电热耦合方法，以及与 IEC 60287 的对照：原理、公式与求解器来源、收敛判据、适用范围、超出范围时的处理、验证算例和已知限制。"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"原理"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"公式与求解器来源"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"收敛与证据"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#与-iec-的对照","content":"与 IEC 的对照"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#适用范围与输入","content":"适用范围与输入"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"超出范围时"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"验证算例"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"已知限制"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/fem#插件清单","content":"插件清单"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem","content":"有限元方法求解电缆截面和敷设区域的温度场与电磁场，用来检查 IEC 60287 解析假设之外的影响，并给出可视化的温度分布。主要由两个插件提供："},"1392":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem","content":"`cablesim.simulation`（电缆有限元仿真）：多区域稳态导热、GetDP 时谐涡流、Elmer 稳态与瞬态热场，在 Slurm 超算集群上运行；"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem","content":"`cablesim.native-reference`（有限元与线源参考）：单回路直埋的固定功率有限元温度、电热耦合和线热源交叉校核，在本机运行，作参考研究。"},"1394":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"截面稳态导热（二维、轴向无限长）："},"1395":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"$k$ 为各区域热导率，$q$ 为体积热源（导体、金属套、铠装损耗和介质损耗）。与 IEC 的“热阻串联”不同，有限元直接求解整个区域的温度分布，能够处理回填、分层土壤、多根电缆的真实几何。"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"**IEC 损耗反馈**：损耗按 IEC 60287 公式计算，并随金属层平均温度迭代更新。"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"**护套损耗**：GetDP 求解二维时谐涡流场，按相序与接地拓扑（单点、两端、交叉互联）计算护套环流与涡流损耗。"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"**电热耦合**：电导率随温度变化 $\\sigma(T)$ 与导热双向迭代，保存逐轮的温度、功率与能量残差。"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#原理","content":"**暂态**：给定均匀初温和逐区体积热容，计算阶跃、周期或应急负荷下的温升过程。"},"1400":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分             | 来源                            |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 导体、金属套、铠装与介质损耗 | IEC 60287-1-1:2023，随金属层平均温度迭代 |","table":"table-0"},"1401":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分        | 来源                                            |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 皱纹护套的环形等效 | IEC 60287-2-1:2023 §4.1.2.1、§4.1.5.1，气隙参数须有来源 |","table":"table-0"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分   | 来源                                        |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 管内空气 | IEC 60287-2-1:2023 的管内热阻，换算为固定等效导热率；不求解流体 |","table":"table-0"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分   | 来源                                       |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 远场边界 | 均匀半无限土壤、地表等温时的 Kennelly 镜像线热源；也可选择环境定温截断 |","table":"table-0"},"1404":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分        | 来源                         |\n| --------- | -------------------------- |\n| 护套损耗与电热耦合 | GetDP 3.5.0，二维磁准静态时谐场与场路联立 |","table":"table-0"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"| 部分      | 来源                                      |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 稳态与瞬态热场 | Elmer 26.1（求解器报告 9.0）；scikit-fem 用于交叉校核 |","table":"table-0"},"1406":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#公式与求解器来源","content":"外部求解程序不随插件分发，启动前检测版本，缺失或版本不符时明确失败，不退化到其他求解器。每次运行保存问题定义、网格、求解器版本和结果工件。"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"有限元结果必须给出收敛证据："},"1408":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"**IEC 与有限元对比**：按多档网格比例（默认 1.5、1.0、0.75）逐档求解，再把计算域放大（默认 2 倍）求解一次。最后两档网格之间、以及最细网格与放大计算域之间，最高温度变化都不超过温度迭代容差（默认 0.1 K）、允许电流变化都不超过载流量校核容差（默认 0.5 A），才输出偏差结论。"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"**有限元热场的自动加密与扩域**：逐级把网格减半或计算域加倍，网格与扩域各自连续两级的热点温度变化都小于门槛（默认 0.1 K）才算收敛，之后在最终网格上反求允许电流。"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"**迭代容差**：温度收敛容差、温度迭代容差和收敛门槛都是**温差**，以 K 显示和输入；初始温度、环境温度等绝对温度以 °C 显示。"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"**能量平衡**：电热耦合同时检查温度、功率与能量残差。"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#收敛与证据","content":"没有合格收敛证据的结果不显示为正式值，也不能正式导出。逐级结果、核时和保存运行见仿真研究 · 收敛研究。"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#与-iec-的对照","content":"“研究敷设截面 IEC 与收敛有限元对比”在同一保存工况下逐回路反求允许电流，与 IEC 结果并列。两者的模型假设不同（有限元为有限计算域与侧底边界，IEC 为半无限均匀土壤；集总温度与层内梯度；标准介质损耗路径与体热源），**差异本身不是误差证明**，报告会列出差异来源，不据此判定优劣。网格和加倍计算域都通过后才输出偏差结论，结果标为“仅供参考，未经工程批准”。"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#适用范围与输入","content":"截面为同心圆层电缆（单芯，或各芯独立屏蔽的三芯，视具体能力而定），多区域土壤、矩形回填与分层土壤；多区域稳态热场支持 1–64 根有正间隙的同心圆缆。"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#适用范围与输入","content":"材料热导率、体积热容、电导率及其有效温区必须有来源；每个材料域的体积热容须有正文页码、表号与摘要，没有默认热容。"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#适用范围与输入","content":"多回路的电损耗须有独立来源；反求某一回路的允许电流时，其他回路保持保存负荷。"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#适用范围与输入","content":"求解在 Slurm 超算集群执行，配置见仿真计算环境。"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"只在超算运行的方法遇到超算未配置时，预检提示“超算未配置，请前往设置 → 计算位置。输入已保存。”，不会改到本机计算。"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"超出材料有效温区、不收敛或几何不受支持（如相切以外的接触、非圆截面）时明确拒绝，不外推材料数据。"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"缺少网格、热容或材料来源时预检列出缺项，不使用默认值。"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"未收敛的结果保留在运行记录中，但不进入有效结论，也不导出为应急额定输入；单次求解不自动证明网格或时间步收敛。"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#超出范围时","content":"多回路护套损耗的固定点系数不能用于 IEC 的变温迭代；只有单截面完整温度表并通过独立中心点验证后，才允许在声明范围内迭代。"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力                | 验证算例                                               |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 电缆有限元热场（IEC 损耗反馈） | 均匀半空间圆盘热源的 Kennelly 解析解；三芯导体、屏蔽、铠装热源守恒与 IEC 损耗交叉核对 |","table":"table-1"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力           | 验证算例               |\n| ------------ | ------------------ |\n| IEC 与收敛有限元对比 | 均匀半空间手算参考，网格与计算域收敛 |","table":"table-1"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力   | 验证算例                                  |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 暂态温升 | 均匀圆柱 Bessel 阶跃叠加（逐时间步）；独立平板 Fourier 解 |","table":"table-1"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力         | 验证算例                |\n| ---------- | ------------------- |\n| 有限元阶跃与预载暂态 | 镜像线热源解析解（恒温地表）与稳态极限 |","table":"table-1"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力        | 验证算例                                       |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 接地拓扑与护套损耗 | 独立的 Faraday / Kirchhoff 手算回路；公开 GetDP 电磁基准 |","table":"table-1"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力       | 验证算例                            |\n| -------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 双向稳态电热耦合 | 同轴 I²R(T) 手算；独立同轴解析解与 COMSOL 对照 |","table":"table-1"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力                   | 验证算例                                            |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 完整接触热域、多端子电容场、同轴频域电流 | COMSOL 教程模型（COMSOL02、COMSOL06、submarine02/03）对照 |","table":"table-1"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-49","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力     | 验证算例                    |\n| ------ | ----------------------- |\n| 平排护套回路 | Lunca 2023 论文表 3 的解析子模型 |","table":"table-1"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-50","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"| 能力                | 验证算例                                                             |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| GetDP 涡流、Elmer 热场 | 圆柱 Bessel（V01）、平板 Fourier 阶跃与周期（V02）、干湿土交叉校核（E03）、平排护套场路联立（E05）等 |","table":"table-1"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-51","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#验证算例","content":"各算例与原文的最大相对偏差在软件的“方法 → 验证算例”中列出。本机参考能力（`cablesim.native-reference`）为“未经独立验证”，只作参考研究。"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-52","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"二维截面、轴向无限长：不含三维端部与绞合效应、土壤水分迁移与干燥、对流流场；辐射只在多区域热场中作为对给定环境的局部交换，不含相互遮挡。"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-53","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"相切的外护套按零面积理想点接触，不代表实测的接触宽度或接触热阻。"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-54","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"暂态按恒定热物性和声明温度下冻结的电阻计算，不含 R(T) 双向反馈。"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-55","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"交叉互联按三个独立二维截面加电路计算，不含弯曲的三维效应和大地回流。"},"1437":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-56","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#已知限制","content":"与 IEC 的对照结果为参考研究，不自动批准，也不代替 IEC 载流量或工程批准。"},"1438":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-57","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.simulation\" />"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-58","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#插件清单","content":"本机参考研究能力："},"1440":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-59","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.native-reference\" />"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/methods/fem-60","page_id":"/docs/methods/fem","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/fem#插件清单","content":"技术细节见均匀土壤热参考（英文）、线热源交叉校核（英文）和电热耦合参考（英文）。"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"page","content":"GB 50217 载流量校正","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","content":"按 GB 50217—2018 附录 D，把有出处的单根基准载流量换算到实际工况：原理、公式来源、适用范围、超出范围时的处理、输入要求、验证算例和已知限制。"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#原理","content":"原理"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"公式来源"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#适用范围","content":"适用范围"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"超出范围时"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"输入要求"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"验证算例"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#已知限制","content":"已知限制"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#与-iec-结果比较","content":"与 IEC 结果比较"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#插件清单","content":"插件清单"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","content":"插件 `cablesim.gb50217-correction` 不自己计算载流量。它把**有出处的单根电缆基准载流量**（厂家样本或已保存的载流量表）按 GB 50217—2018《电力工程电缆设计标准》附录 D 的校正系数换算到实际敷设条件。"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#原理","content":"校正后的允许电流等于基准值乘以各适用校正系数之积："},"1455":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#原理","content":"环境温度不在表 D.0.1 的格点上时，按标准 D.0.2 规定的公式计算温度校正系数："},"1456":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#原理","content":"$\\theta_m$ 为导体最高允许温度，$\\theta_1$ 为基准环境温度（空气 40 °C、土壤 25 °C），$\\theta_2$ 为实际环境温度。其余系数只按表内条件取值，表外的土壤热阻率、根数或间距**不插值、不外推**，直接拒绝。"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"全部系数和公式取自 GB 50217—2018 附录 D（标准印刷第 72–74 页）："},"1458":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"| 条款      | 条件与取值规则                   |\n| ------- | ------------------------- |\n| 表 D.0.1 | 10 kV 及以下，环境温度校正，取表内唯一单元格 |","table":"table-0"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"| 条款    | 条件与取值规则            |\n| ----- | ------------------ |\n| D.0.2 | 其他环境温度按上式计算，不是表格外推 |","table":"table-0"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"| 条款      | 条件与取值规则                                                  |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 表 D.0.3 | 土壤热阻率校正，只适用于表 C.0.1-2 的 1 kV PVC、70 °C、基准土壤热阻率 1.2 K·m/W |","table":"table-0"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"| 条款      | 条件与取值规则                            |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 表 D.0.4 | 同深度直埋、并列 2–6 根，净距为表内条件；不用于三相交流单芯电缆 |","table":"table-0"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"| 条款      | 条件与取值规则                                  |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 表 D.0.5 | 空气中单层、并列 2–6 根，中心距与直径之比为表内条件；不用于三相交流单芯电缆 |","table":"table-0"},"1463":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#公式来源","content":"系数通过标准依据库查询，只接受已核验、唯一命中、带原件摘要和页码的结果。每个系数保存查询条件、单元格位置、公式输入和依据库发行摘要；依据库发行变化时拒绝静默换表，已保存的工程继续固定原来的依据。"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#适用范围","content":"10 kV 及以下；均匀土壤直埋，或空气中单层水平等间距排列。"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#适用范围","content":"基准必须是同型号、同正常导体温限、同中心埋深的**单根**电缆载流量，已经乘过并列系数的基准不能再用。"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#适用范围","content":"每个回路为一根多芯电缆；并列电缆须为同一型号和直径，间距一致。"},"1467":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#适用范围","content":"并列校正的结果是所有回路等负荷时每根电缆的允许电流，不是并联电流之和。"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"不在表内的条件不插值、不外推，插件拒绝计算并指出需要修改的字段，不输出电流。常见提示："},"1469":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况          | 提示                                 |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 排管、桥架、多层或回填 | “仅覆盖均匀土壤直埋或空气单层敷设；排管、桥架、多层与回填未覆盖。” |","table":"table-1"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况      | 提示                      |\n| ------- | ----------------------- |\n| 日照或强制风冷 | “日照或强制风冷不在本次已实现的表格范围内。” |","table":"table-1"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况    | 提示                   |\n| ----- | -------------------- |\n| 有外部热源 | “存在外部热源，本方法不叠加热源校正。” |","table":"table-1"},"1472":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况           | 提示                             |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------ |\n| 系统电压高于 10 kV | “环境温度校正只覆盖附录 D 的 10 kV 及以下范围。” |","table":"table-1"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况          | 提示                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 实际中心埋深与基准不同 | “实际中心埋深与基准不同；附录 D 不提供通用埋深校正，请改用完整计算。” |","table":"table-1"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况                         | 提示                                               |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 基准环境温度不是空气 40 °C 或土壤 25 °C | “本版只接受表 D.0.1 的基准：空气 40 °C / 土壤 25 °C；不作系数比值外推。” |","table":"table-1"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况              | 提示                                         |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 厂家基准的土壤热阻率与实际不同 | “表 D.0.3 不适用于任意厂家基准；实际与基准土壤热阻率不同，请使用完整计算。” |","table":"table-1"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况               | 提示                                               |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 并列根数、净距或中心距比不在表内 | 原因代码 `CORRECTION_TABLE_NOT_COVERED`，指向敷设截面中的电缆位置 |","table":"table-1"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况        | 提示                     |\n| --------- | ---------------------- |\n| 并列电缆间距不一致 | “并列电缆间距不一致，本版不采用平均间距。” |","table":"table-1"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况         | 提示                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 三相交流单芯电缆并列 | “表 D.0.4 / D.0.5 不适用于三相交流单芯电缆。” |","table":"table-1"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况       | 提示                         |\n| -------- | -------------------------- |\n| 并列电缆型号不同 | “并列电缆必须为相同型号与直径，不对混合型号套表。” |","table":"table-1"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况        | 提示                      |\n| --------- | ----------------------- |\n| 没有填写系统线电压 | “请填写系统线电压；不能由型号额定电压代替。” |","table":"table-1"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况         | 提示                                                                 |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 标准依据库发行已变化 | 原因代码 `BASIS_VERSION_CHANGED`：“标准依据库发行已变化；请读取当前方法契约并重新核对依据，不能静默换表。” |","table":"table-1"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"| 情况              | 提示                                    |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 没有勾选“基准条件已人工核对” | “请核对基准载流量、单根敷设条件、正常温限和原件出处，再确认基准已核对。” |","table":"table-1"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#超出范围时","content":"“完整计算”指 IEC 60287 或有限元方法。D.0.6、D.0.7 本版未实现，相关条件明确拒绝，不能用 D.0.4 / D.0.5 代替。"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数    | 单位  | 要求                |\n| ----- | --- | ----------------- |\n| 基准载流量 | A   | 必填；同型号、单根、同温限、同埋深 |","table":"table-2"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数     | 单位  | 要求                    |\n| ------ | --- | --------------------- |\n| 基准环境温度 | °C  | 必填；空气 40 °C 或土壤 25 °C |","table":"table-2"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数      | 单位    | 要求  |\n| ------- | ----- | --- |\n| 基准土壤热阻率 | K·m/W | 必填  |","table":"table-2"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数   | 单位  | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --- | --------------------- |\n| 基准类型 | —   | 厂家基准，或表 C.0.1-2 的标准基准 |","table":"table-2"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数     | 单位  | 要求          |\n| ------ | --- | ----------- |\n| 基准中心埋深 | m   | 必填，须与实际埋深相同 |","table":"table-2"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数               | 单位  | 要求  |\n| ---------------- | --- | --- |\n| 基准原件名称与条件出处、原文页码 | —   | 必填  |","table":"table-2"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数          | 单位  | 要求            |\n| ----------- | --- | ------------- |\n| 基准原件或保存工件摘要 | —   | 必填，原件的 SHA256 |","table":"table-2"},"1491":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数        | 单位  | 要求       |\n| --------- | --- | -------- |\n| 基准条件已人工核对 | —   | 必须由工程师勾选 |","table":"table-2"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-49","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"| 参数        | 单位  | 要求      |\n| --------- | --- | ------- |\n| 标准依据库发行摘要 | —   | 由方法契约给出 |","table":"table-2"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-50","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#输入要求","content":"实际环境温度、导体温限、介质、并列根数和间距取自研究中保存的同一份输入。"},"1494":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-51","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"下列算例用手算的系数乘积核对插件结果，系数经标准依据库实际查询，并核对查询返回的页码和原件摘要。算例中的 400 A 基准是为核验给定的值，不是厂家额定值。"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-52","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"| 条件                           | 系数（条款）      | 结果                 |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------- | ------------------ |\n| 空气 30 °C，导体温限 90 °C，基准 40 °C | 1.09（D.0.1） | 400 × 1.09 = 436 A |","table":"table-3"},"1496":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-53","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"| 条件                                                  | 系数（条款）                   | 结果      |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------- |\n| 表 C.0.1-2 基准（1 kV PVC、70 °C），土壤 20 °C，热阻率 1.5 K·m/W | 1.05（D.0.1）× 0.93（D.0.3） | 390.6 A |","table":"table-3"},"1497":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-54","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"| 条件                     | 系数（条款）                   | 结果      |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------ | ------- |\n| 土壤 30 °C，三根直埋、净距 0.1 m | 0.96（D.0.1）× 0.85（D.0.4） | 326.4 A |","table":"table-3"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-55","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"| 条件                       | 系数（条款）                   | 结果       |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------ | -------- |\n| 空气 30 °C，三根单层、中心距为 2 倍直径 | 1.09（D.0.1）× 0.98（D.0.5） | 427.28 A |","table":"table-3"},"1499":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-56","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"| 条件                          | 系数（条款）                            | 结果         |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| 土壤 27 °C（不在表格点上），导体温限 90 °C | D.0.2：√((90−27)/(90−25)) ≈ 0.9845 | 公式值，不是表格插值 |","table":"table-3"},"1500":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-57","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#验证算例","content":"同一组测试还核对拒绝路径：三根直埋、净距 0.15 m 不在表内（`CORRECTION_TABLE_NOT_COVERED`）；厂家基准改变土壤热阻率被拒绝；依据库摘要变化时报 `BASIS_VERSION_CHANGED`；温度错误指向需要修改的那一个值。"},"1501":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-58","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#已知限制","content":"结果的可信度取决于基准：基准由工程师核对，校正结果不是 IEC 完整热路计算，也不代表厂家保证值。"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-59","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#已知限制","content":"不支持排管、桥架、多层、回填、日照、强制风冷和外部热源；不提供埋深校正。"},"1503":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-60","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#已知限制","content":"D.0.3 只用于表 C.0.1-2 的标准基准；D.0.4、D.0.5 不用于三相交流单芯电缆。"},"1504":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-61","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#与-iec-结果比较","content":"在研究中用“方法对比”与 IEC 60287 比较时，只与“全回路共同能力”口径配对，分别列出两者的允许电流和差值，以及各自的方法范围，不判定优劣。"},"1505":{"id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217-62","page_id":"/docs/methods/gb-50217","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/gb-50217#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.gb50217-correction\" />"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","type":"page","content":"IEC 60287 稳态载流量","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287"},"1507":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","content":"按 IEC 60287-1-1 / 2-1:2023 计算地下电缆的稳态温度与允许电流：原理、适用范围、输入要求、验证依据和已知限制。"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"原理"},"1509":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"适用范围"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"输入要求"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#验证依据与限制","content":"验证依据与限制"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","content":"插件 `cablesim.iec60287` 按 IEC 60287-1-1:2023（损耗）和 IEC 60287-2-1:2023（热阻）计算地下电缆在稳态下的导体温度和允许电流，并输出逐项损耗、热阻和互热，便于逐项核对。"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"在给定敷设条件下，导体温度刚好达到允许最高温度时的电流就是载流量。IEC 60287 把电缆和周围介质看成一串热阻，各处损耗沿热路逐段产生温升："},"1514":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号             | 含义            | 单位  |\n| -------------- | ------------- | --- |\n| $\\Delta\\theta$ | 导体允许温度与环境温度之差 | K   |","table":"table-0"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号  | 含义                                        | 单位  |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------- | --- |\n| $R$ | 最高工作温度下的单位长度交流电阻（公式按 SI 取 Ω/m，界面显示为 Ω/km） | Ω/m |","table":"table-0"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号    | 含义       | 单位  |\n| ----- | -------- | --- |\n| $W_d$ | 单位长度介质损耗 | W/m |","table":"table-0"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号              | 含义           | 单位    |\n| --------------- | ------------ | ----- |\n| $T_1, T_2, T_3$ | 绝缘、内衬、外护套的热阻 | K·m/W |","table":"table-0"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号    | 含义                | 单位    |\n| ----- | ----------------- | ----- |\n| $T_4$ | 电缆外部（土壤、排管、回填）的热阻 | K·m/W |","table":"table-0"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号  | 含义          | 单位  |\n| --- | ----------- | --- |\n| $n$ | 电缆中承载电流的导体数 | —   |","table":"table-0"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"| 符号                     | 含义              | 单位  |\n| ---------------------- | --------------- | --- |\n| $\\lambda_1, \\lambda_2$ | 金属套、铠装损耗与导体损耗之比 | —   |","table":"table-0"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"各项损耗从产生的位置开始，依次流过外层热阻散到环境："},"1522":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"直埋单根电缆的外部热阻："},"1523":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"其中 $\\rho_T$ 为土壤热阻率（K·m/W），$L$ 为电缆中心埋深，$D_e$ 为电缆外径。多根电缆之间的互热按镜像法叠加：第 $p$ 根电缆因其他电缆 $k$ 产生的温升为"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#原理","content":"$d_{pk}$ 为两缆中心距离，$d'_{pk}$ 为电缆 $p$ 到电缆 $k$ 关于地表的镜像的距离，$W_k$ 为电缆 $k$ 的总损耗。电阻随温度变化，温度与损耗迭代至收敛。"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"单芯电缆，以及各芯有独立屏蔽的三芯电缆；直埋、排管和单一矩形回填区；多回路互热。"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"金属套损耗：两端接地的环流、单点接地与交叉互联的涡流；磁性钢带、钢丝铠装损耗；皱纹铝护套（须声明间隙有效热阻率及来源）。"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"交叉热源降额、IEC 60853 应急额定（给定有来源的阶跃响应）、CIGRE TB 880 参考链。"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#适用范围","content":"不支持：分层土壤、多种介质分区、土壤干燥区、架空与空气中敷设。单芯多回路的电损耗只在完整平衡三相单回路或已验证的双回平排分支中自动计算，其他排列须给出外部损耗系数及其来源。"},"1529":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"型号：各层尺寸与材料、导体 R₂₀、温度系数、绝缘介电常数与介质损耗因数等，全部带来源。"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"敷设：埋深、排列与间距、排管或回填几何、金属套接地方式。"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"环境：地表温度、土壤（回填）热阻率。"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"设计准则：导体允许温度。"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#输入要求","content":"缺少任何必需输入时，运行前预检会指出缺哪一项，不会用默认值代替。"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#验证依据与限制","content":"以下为 `steady-rating` 能力的清单内容；其他能力（应急额定、TB 880 参考链、三芯工程参数推导等）见方法清单。逐项依据、工程算例和核对表见 IEC 60287 逐项依据与算例。"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/iec-60287#验证依据与限制","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.iec60287\" />"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/methods","page_id":"/docs/methods","type":"page","content":"方法与依据总览","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/methods-0","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"计算方法如何组织、如何验证、如何追溯，以及结果怎么读。"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/methods-1","page_id":"/docs/methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods#一次计算是怎样进行的","content":"一次计算是怎样进行的"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/methods-2","page_id":"/docs/methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"验证等级"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/methods-3","page_id":"/docs/methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods#结果口径","content":"结果口径"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/methods-4","page_id":"/docs/methods","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"方法"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/methods-5","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"CableSimPro 的宿主只提供工程底座（工程与版本、运行快照、来源追溯、结果工件、交付和审批），**不内置任何算法**。每种计算方法都是一个插件，在清单里声明："},"1543":{"id":"/docs/methods-6","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"计算能力、方法版本和适用的研究任务；"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/methods-7","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"输入要求（参数、单位、范围、必填项）和输出；"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/methods-8","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"适用范围与已知限制；"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/methods-9","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"验证等级与验证用例；"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/methods-10","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"求解位置（本机、超算或两者均可）。"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/methods-11","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods","content":"插件清单与源码由封签（逐文件 SHA256）绑定。宿主每次调用方法前都会重新核对封签，不一致就拒绝运行。"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/methods-12","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#一次计算是怎样进行的","content":"每次运行都保存输入快照（SI 单位）、所用方法和插件的版本、结果工件以及核验证据；之后输入变化只会让结果标为“过期”，不会改写历史运行。"},"1550":{"id":"/docs/methods-13","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"| 等级     | 含义              |\n| ------ | --------------- |\n| 解析基准核对 | 与独立的解析解或手算逐项核对。 |","table":"table-0"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/methods-14","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"| 等级     | 含义                                         |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 参考算例核对 | 与公开算例（如 CIGRE TB 880）、标准附录、文献或商业软件的保存结果核对。 |","table":"table-0"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/methods-15","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"| 等级   | 含义                       |\n| ---- | ------------------------ |\n| 接口测试 | 验证了输入输出契约和拒绝规则，数值本身另有出处。 |","table":"table-0"},"1553":{"id":"/docs/methods-16","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"| 等级     | 含义                     |\n| ------ | ---------------------- |\n| 未经独立验证 | 仅作参考研究使用，结果不能单独作为工程依据。 |","table":"table-0"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/methods-17","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#验证等级","content":"验证只说明列明范围内的对拍结果，不代表未覆盖的工况也已验证。已复现的公开算例、文献案例和解析基准在软件的“方法 → 验证算例”中查看，并列出与原文的最大相对偏差。"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/methods-18","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#结果口径","content":"多回路时，允许电流区分“单回路能力”“全回路共同能力”和“其他回路固定负荷下的条件上限”，结果里写明是哪一种，不能混用。详见载流量研究 · 读结论。"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/methods-19","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"地下电缆稳态温度与允许电流，多回路直埋、排管与矩形回填"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/methods-20","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"把有出处的单根基准载流量按附录 D 换算到实际工况"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/methods-21","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"可审计的简化稳态热网络，用于同输入方法对比"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/methods-22","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"有限元温度场、暂态、护套损耗与电热耦合，以及与 IEC 的对照"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/methods-23","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"按已核验的 GB 产品标准核对结构尺寸与导体电阻"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/methods-24","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"全部插件、能力、验证等级与求解位置"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/methods-25","page_id":"/docs/methods","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods#方法","content":"各方法的逐项依据、算例与核对表见侧栏“技术说明”。"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","type":"page","content":"三根电缆均匀土壤热参考（英文）","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#exact-physical-problem","content":"Exact physical problem"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#numerical-and-artifact-checks","content":"Numerical and artifact checks"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#reproduce","content":"Reproduce"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","content":"The `cablesim.native-reference` v2 plugin accepts a saved SI domain document;\nlegacy data must pass the explicit domain migration first. It uses the shared\nplugin_host executor, immutable Study/Run records and source-bound JSON bundles.\nThe six-domain radial field retains `cablesim.thermal-field/1`, and the 19-domain\nfield retains `cablesim.buried-field/1`. Physical artifact schema versions are\nindependent of the retired v1 execution protocol."},"1568":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#exact-physical-problem","content":"Three identical six-layer single-core cables, flat or trefoil, invariant along the\naxis. Each conductor has an independently specified nonnegative **power per unit\nlength** in W/m. Each material is isotropic with constant thermal conductivity.\nSolve `-div(k grad(T)) = Q` using an interface-conforming Gmsh mesh and P1 triangular\nfinite elements in scikit-fem. The conductor's equivalent radius follows the saved\nfill factor; individual strands are not resolved. The source is normalized over\neach polygonal conductor domain so its integral equals the specified W/m."},"1569":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#exact-physical-problem","content":"There are eighteen cable material domains (six per phase) and one homogeneous soil\ndomain. Domain IDs, semantic layer UIDs and phase labels are explicit. Geometry,\nspacing, arrangement, average center depth, ambient temperature and material\nresistivities come from the committed project snapshot. Metal conductivities and\nthree phase powers are mandatory research arguments. The UI currently exposes\n**equal power in each phase**; the API supports unequal powers. No power or metal\nconductivity is prefilled as manufacturer-certified data."},"1570":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#exact-physical-problem","content":"Coordinates are metres; positive y is depth. Ground is y=0. Define\n`L=max(max(phase_depths), max(abs(phase_x))+cable_outer_radius)` and the finite box\n`x in [-S*L,S*L], y in [0,S*L]`, with S=4,8,16. Ground, left, right and bottom are\nDirichlet boundaries at the project's ambient temperature. This is a finite\napproximation, **not an infinite-soil boundary**. No convection, radiation,\nbackfill/ducts, soil drying, contact resistance, distributed screen/dielectric\nlosses, electrical loss calculation, temperature-dependent resistance or ampacity\ninversion are included. `ampacity_a` is always null; no current result is promoted."},"1571":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#numerical-and-artifact-checks","content":"The rectangular boundary is recovered independently from mesh connectivity and\nmust match the declared boundary nodes. Internal material interfaces must share\nnodes; holes, degenerate/duplicate triangles, unused nodes and nonmanifold edges\nare rejected. Fields are absolute kelvin with nodal association. The new bounded\ncontract allows at most 100,000 nodes / 200,000 triangles; the host retains its\n32 MiB per-file ceiling and worker timeout. Exceeding limits is a failure, not an\nautomatic coarse-mesh fallback. The radial adapter's existing limits are unchanged."},"1572":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#numerical-and-artifact-checks","content":"The same assembly is exercised by a manufactured solution\n`T=sin(pi*x)sin(pi*y)` with k=3 and `Q=6*pi^2*sin(pi*x)sin(pi*y)`, three mesh levels\nand L2 convergence. Additional tests exercise zero power, power scaling, ambient\noffset, unequal phase powers in trefoil, flat-arrangement symmetry, source heat,\nDirichlet reaction sum, free-equation residual and three resolutions."},"1573":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#numerical-and-artifact-checks","content":"The reaction sum checks **discrete energy balance**, not an independently measured\nheat flux. Mesh and domain-size studies are recorded separately. In the initial\nlocal default fixture, S=8 to S=16 changed the peak by about 0.228 K: it did **not**\nmeet an initially explored 0.2 K domain-insensitivity target. The published test\nchecks diminishing truncation influence and records all values; it does not label\nthis solution domain-independent or invent a precision certificate. Accuracy\nrequirements for a real engineering decision must be set and checked separately."},"1574":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#numerical-and-artifact-checks","content":"Host checks bind source powers, soil conductivity, ambient temperature, resolution,\ngeometry and domain setting to the saved invocation. `field.json` and\n`temperature.vtu` use the same solved nodal values. Browser downloads verify the\nfile size and SHA-256 before rendering. Local/full-domain views and mesh overlays\nonly change display; they do not solve again. The color of an element is its three\nnodal temperatures' mean. The local view is labelled as a crop, not as a computation\nboundary. Both spatial axes use the same scale."},"1575":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#reproduce","content":"Use a separate test environment and intentionally install the optional packages:"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#reproduce","content":"The generic method catalog exposes `fixed-power`, `electrothermal`, `line-source`,\nCAD/mesh/postprocessing and `line-source-crosscheck`. Upstream native references\nmust bind a saved run/case, unchanged domain input and artifact SHA256; direct\ncaller-supplied file bytes are refused. Native validation runs only under Slurm\ncluster and records actual core time. Installing a plugin does not install dependencies."},"1577":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/buried-reference#reproduce","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/BURIED_REFERENCE.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"page","content":"电热耦合参考（英文）","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Inputs and physical scope"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#computation-and-why-the-reduced-feedback-is-exact-for-this-model","content":"Computation and why the reduced feedback is exact for this model"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#two-explicit-operations","content":"Two explicit operations"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#domain-comparison-is-not-an-error-certificate","content":"Domain comparison is not an error certificate"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#artifacts-and-failure-boundaries","content":"Artifacts and failure boundaries"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#reproduction","content":"Reproduction"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"Primary technical references (checked during this increment)"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","content":"One PluginService, project store, catalog,\npermission/lock model and artifact API. The new first-party adapter has a fixed\nhost-owned worker entry; unrelated adapters retain their existing bytes, versions\nand digests. The new inert JSON record under plugins/releases is combined with\nthe legacy registry by the same Catalog, including global duplicate-ID/command\nchecks. It is not another runtime or an external package installer. Nothing is installed or imported from an arbitrary manifest path."},"1587":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Three identical single-core six-layer cables and homogeneous soil. The existing\nGmsh 19-domain mesh and scikit-fem P1 thermal assembly are reused. Each material's\nthermal conductivity is constant. Ground, sides and bottom are all at the saved\nambient temperature, with the same finite-domain S=4/8/16 and mesh16/24/32 options."},"1588":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"The project **must contain an explicit R20 in ohm/km**. Unlike the legacy demo,\nthis plugin never estimates R20 from area or material resistivity. The saved\nScenario supplies RMS conductor-to-screen U0 (kV), frequency, relative permittivity,\ntan-delta, AC-extra factor, screen-loss factor, temperature limit and operating\ncurrent. Arguments supply alpha20 (/K), the two metal conductivities and a mandatory\nhuman-written coefficient-basis note. A separate acknowledgement is required.\nThese are user declarations, not authenticated approval or manufacturer certification."},"1589":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"With mean conductor temperature Tc,j, define:"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Rac,j [ohm/m] = R20 [ohm/km]/1000 * (1 + ac_extra) * (1 + alpha20*(Tc,j - 20))."},"1591":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Pc,j [W/m] = I² * Rac,j, uniform over the equivalent conductor domain."},"1592":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Ps,j [W/m] = screen_loss_factor * Pc,j, uniform over the metal-screen domain."},"1593":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"C [F/m] = 2*pi*epsilon0*epsilon_r / log(r_insulation_outer/r_insulation_inner)."},"1594":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Pd,j [W/m] = 2*pi*f*C*(1000*U0)²*tan_delta, distributed proportionally to 1/r²\nin that phase's insulation, normalized to the declared total on the polygon mesh."},"1595":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"U0 is already phase-to-screen RMS voltage: do **not** divide by sqrt(3). All three\nloss components enter their own physical layers. The fixed screen ratio does NOT\nmodel induced screen current or its resistance/temperature feedback; skin/proximity\nand bonding-dependent loss factors are NOT calculated. No armouring, soil drying,\nbackfill, ducts, contact resistance, axial conduction, load history or thermal\nproperty nonlinearity is included. This is not complete IEC60287 or EM FEM."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#inputs-and-physical-scope","content":"Resistance uses the **area-average** conductor temperature. The temperature limit\nuses the **maximum conductor nodal temperature**. This distinction is included in\nresults and verified from the field. Individual strands and current redistribution\ninside a nonisothermal conductor are not resolved."},"1597":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#computation-and-why-the-reduced-feedback-is-exact-for-this-model","content":"Let A be the thermal FEM matrix, B the nine normalized source vectors, and U=A⁻¹B\non free DOFs. These nine real FEM solutions are not an imported thermal-network\napproximation. Define Ueff=Uconductor + lambda*Uscreen and u0=Pd*sum(Udielectric).\nWith conductor averaging weights Bc, H=Bcᵀ Ueff and t0=Bcᵀ u0. For balanced current,\ng=I²*R20ac and the three conductor powers satisfy:"},"1598":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#computation-and-why-the-reduced-feedback-is-exact-for-this-model","content":"For constant thermal conductivities and the stated linear mean-temperature\nresistance law, this is an exact elimination of the full discrete thermal problem,\nnot a surrogate fit. Every accepted final state also runs a bounded Picard feedback\niteration and cross-checks its power with the small-system solution. The native\nsuite independently iterates the **full sparse thermal system**, without using H,\nand compares all nodal temperatures."},"1599":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#computation-and-why-the-reduced-feedback-is-exact-for-this-model","content":"Reject negative/nonfinite solutions and feedback spectral radius >=1-1e-8. A\nfailed final Picard check never becomes success. The residual from A*u-B*p is\nreported at free DOFs and summed at Dirichlet boundaries. This is a discrete\nreaction-based energy check, not independently measured heat flux."},"1600":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#two-explicit-operations","content":"**operating-point:** uses Scenario.operating_current_a. It may report an over-limit\nstate up to150°C, but `ampacity_a` is null. Higher accepted-point temperatures\nare rejected as outside this reference model's declared range. Zero current still includes dielectric heating\nwhen voltage and tan-delta are nonzero. No fabricated all-zero loss assumption."},"1601":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#two-explicit-operations","content":"**ampacity:** finds the common phase current at which the hottest conductor reaches\nthe saved limit. Bracket between zero current and a stable high trial, bounded by\nmaximum_search_current_a (default3000A). Reject a zero-current over-limit state,\nunbracketed interval, unstable feedback or nonconvergence. Bisection returns the\n*feasible lower endpoint*, not an arbitrary last iterate. Both endpoints, trial\nhistory, <=0.01A bracket width and <=0.005K lower-end temperature shortfall are saved.\nThese tolerances describe the numerical root, NOT the accuracy of the physical model."},"1602":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#domain-comparison-is-not-an-error-certificate","content":"An optional strictly larger domain is remeshed and independently solved at the same\nmesh setting and electrical inputs. It has its own inverse current, bracket, field,\nmesh and iteration evidence. Report the pairwise current change and the larger-domain\npeak at the original current. Both remain bound to the same saved Scenario."},"1603":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#domain-comparison-is-not-an-error-certificate","content":"`within_pairwise_tolerance` only compares two numbers against a user-selected drift\nthreshold (default0.5%). `mesh_independence_certified` and\n`infinite_domain_accuracy_certified` are always false. The primary ampacity is NOT\nsilently replaced with the comparison result. A small pairwise change alone is\nnot a bound on remaining truncation error. Nor does this run establish mesh\nindependence, experimental accuracy, regulatory compliance or a production rating."},"1604":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#artifacts-and-failure-boundaries","content":"Primary: buried.msh, field.json (existing buried-field/1), temperature.vtu,\nthermal.json (new electrothermal-reference/1), iteration.json. Optional:\ncomparison.msh, comparison-field.json, comparison.json. VTU/JSON nodal values agree.\nFile length/SHA-256 are checked by host and field viewer. Before persisting success,\nthe host verifies R(T), I²R, screen/dielectric losses, total heat, electrical input\nbinding, field means/peaks, boundary temperature, domain extents, root bracket and\ncomparison binding. Missing or incorrect evidence fails rather than silently\nfalling back to the previous solver."},"1605":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#artifacts-and-failure-boundaries","content":"The host does not modify project parameters or automatically promote this result\nto its existing ampacity run. No separate project DB, global navigation or third-party\nremote-code loader is introduced. A fixed process is fault isolation, not OS sandboxing."},"1606":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#reproduction","content":"Use a separate environment. Install backend requirements and optionally only\n`plugins/requirements-electrothermal.txt` (full CAD environment not required for this\nnew plugin). The full regression workflow still tests Windows CAD clean exits."},"1607":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#reproduction","content":"Numerical examples use explicitly labelled synthetic test inputs, not manufacturer\nrecords. Exact source SHA, platform environment, JUnit and browser screenshots\naccompany CI evidence. Local Python3.13 numerical tests do not replace Windows or\npinned-host acceptance."},"1608":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"COMSOL, Submarine Cable6—Thermal Effects: distinguishes temperature-dependent\nphase resistance from fully coupled electromagnetic heating and screen behavior.\nhttps://doc.comsol.com/6.4/doc/com.comsol.help.models.acdc.submarine_cable_06_thermal_effects/submarine_cable_06_thermal_effects.html"},"1609":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"scikit-fem how-to/assembly: https://scikit-fem.readthedocs.io/en/latest/howto.html"},"1610":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"IEC60287-1-1:2023 scope (not a license or implemented-formula certification):\nhttps://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/68118"},"1611":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"QuickField dielectric-loss example, voltage RMS/amplitude distinction:\nhttps://quickfield.com/advanced/cable_dielectric_losses.htm"},"1612":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"The reduction, validation rules and solver acceptance thresholds above are our\nimplementation choices. None of these upstream projects certifies this adapter."},"1613":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/electrothermal-reference#primary-technical-references-checked-during-this-increment","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/ELECTROTHERMAL_REFERENCE.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1614":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"page","content":"IEC 60287 地下稳态温度与载流量（cablesim.iec60287）","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287"},"1615":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"steady-rating 适用范围"},"1616":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"标准依据与逐项测试"},"1617":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"皱纹铝护套与缓冲层"},"1618":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"工程算例与核对表"},"1619":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装"},"1620":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"三芯直埋与 XLPE 介质损耗核验"},"1621":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"TB880 原始参数参考链"},"1622":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"交叉热源降额"},"1623":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"原文附录 A 验证"},"1624":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","content":"插件的精确包版本与各能力方法版本以 `plugins/cablesim.iec60287/plugin.json` 为准。steady-rating 主契约为 cablesim.domain/1；显式 single-core/1 验证输入改由 reference-rating 能力使用原接触品字形算法（数值版本 0.1.0）。工作台分别提供领域 schema 和 standalone_schema，不将旧三根等负荷模型当作 N 电缆契约。"},"1625":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","content":"所有物理计算在插件中执行；宿主只保存和呈现。每个电缆结果保留实体、工况与 SI 单位。目标判定逐回路 / 逐电缆保存，避免相同结果键覆盖其他对象。"},"1626":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目   | 已实现                             | 拒算或需补充输入               |\n| ---- | ------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 地下热源 | 任意 N 个不接触圆形电缆 / 管道，各源独立损耗、位置与外径 | 任意接触组合；单回路接触品字形另用标准等效组 |","table":"table-0"},"1627":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目  | 已实现                                               | 拒算或需补充输入                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 电缆  | 同心单芯圆绞线、光滑或明确缓冲/间隙参数的皱纹管套、无铠装；圆导体独立金属屏蔽三芯SL热路，见下节 | 分割、扇形、铜丝屏蔽、复合护套；三芯非磁性铠装与未验证接地分支 |","table":"table-0"},"1628":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目    | 已实现                 | 拒算或需补充输入                                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 自动电损耗 | 完整平衡三相单回路、等间距品字形或水平 | 多回路、任意排列或不平衡相电流需逐根 ac_extra_factor、lambda1 和 loss_input_source |","table":"table-0"},"1629":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目   | 已实现                        | 拒算或需补充输入                         |\n| ---- | -------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 回路之间 | 耦合全部实际热损耗，以有来源的外部电损耗系数求热平衡 | 未实现通用跨回路电磁求解器；不再套用单回路公式，缺系数时预检拒绝 |","table":"table-0"},"1630":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目  | 已实现                    | 拒算或需补充输入            |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 排管  | 每根一管、同心、电缆外径 25–100 mm | 多缆共管、偏心、空气经验式范围外、共腔 |","table":"table-0"},"1631":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目  | 已实现                                | 拒算或需补充输入                        |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 土壤  | 恒温地表、均匀原土，或包含全部热源的单个完整地下矩形回填 / 包封区 | 分层、多材料分区、干燥区、外部热源：改用数值热传导 / 有限元 |","table":"table-0"},"1632":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目  | 已实现                           | 拒算或需补充输入      |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | ------------- |\n| 接地  | 两端接地；品字形和未换位水平单点接地涡流；水平定期换位环流 | 交叉互联；换位水平涡流分支 |","table":"table-0"},"1633":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"| 项目   | 已实现                                 | 拒算或需补充输入            |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 数值边界 | 稳态、埋深≤10 m、集肤按5.1.2分段原语；邻近参数 xp≤2.8 | 时变、暂态、超出公式范围：采用专门方法 |","table":"table-0"},"1634":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#steady-rating-适用范围","content":"逐电缆电流保存在 load_cases[].currents[cable_id]，优先于回路默认电流。简化热网络遇到逐电缆覆盖会拒算，避免静默忽略。显式损耗模式必须填齐所有电缆及来源，缺失值不视为零。"},"1635":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"采用 IEC 60287-1-1:2023、IEC 60287-2-1:2023（Ed.3.0）：电损耗标准、热阻标准。公式核对采用本机受控原文；公开仓库不包含 PDF 或页面扫描。"},"1636":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目            | 条款                | 验证                          |\n| ------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------- |\n| Rdc、集肤、邻近、Rac | 1-1 5.1.2、5.1.5.1 | 原单回路 TB880 中间量；组算法温度 / 电阻迭代 |","table":"table-1"},"1637":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目      | 条款      | 验证                                      |\n| ------- | ------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 电容、介质损耗 | 1-1 5.2 | 领域算法 2πε₀ε/ln(Di/dc)，相电压 U₀；历史算法保留原基准常数 |","table":"table-1"},"1638":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目    | 条款        | 验证           |\n| ----- | --------- | ------------ |\n| 品字形环流 | 1-1 5.3.2 | TB880 0-1 分支 |","table":"table-1"},"1639":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目           | 条款                         | 验证                                             |\n| ------------ | -------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 水平换位 / 未换位环流 | 1-1 5.3.3、5.3.4 式 (8)–(10) | TB880 0-3 三相首轮 λ₁；按相序识别外侧领先 / 滞后，式 (10) 没有系数 2 |","table":"table-1"},"1640":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目        | 条款             | 验证                                    |\n| --------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 未换位水平护套涡流 | 1-1 5.3.7.1(2) | TB880 0-3 单点接地、GP31 变体；逐相涡流与两端接地 F 系数 |","table":"table-1"},"1641":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目       | 条款              | 验证                                 |\n| -------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 介质损耗内部热路 | 1-1 4.2.1 式 (1) | Wd 经过 0.5·T1，T1 包括两侧半导电层；零电流介质发热回归 |","table":"table-1"},"1642":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目        | 条款                | 验证                        |\n| --------- | ----------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 自热 / 镜像互热 | 2-1 4.2.2、4.2.3.2 | 两根等深闭式、不等深 / 不等损耗 N 源、互易性 |","table":"table-1"},"1643":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目   | 条款                          | 验证                 |\n| ---- | --------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 排管三段 | 2-1 4.2.6.3–4.2.6.5、Table 5 | 独立空气式、管壁对数式、各壁温升闭合 |","table":"table-1"},"1644":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目      | 条款                | 验证                        |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 回填 / 包封 | 2-1 4.2.7、Table 2 | 表节点、双线性内插、共同修正乘总损耗、区域包含边界 |","table":"table-1"},"1645":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"| 项目    | 条款                    | 验证                                    |\n| ----- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 接触品字形 | 2-1 4.2.4.3.2、4.2.6.5 | 标准等效组；直埋 T₃×1.6、管内×1.0；旧显式算法 TB880 回归 |","table":"table-1"},"1646":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#标准依据与逐项测试","content":"地表 z=0，电缆深度 L=-z，自热 Rii=rho/(2π)·acosh(Li/ri)，互热 Rij=rho/(2π)·ln(d_image/d_actual)。接收电缆 i 的管外温升为 Σj Rij·Wj；Wj 是源 j 的实际导体、护套与介质总损耗 W/m，不使用平均组负荷。"},"1647":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"领域层 `form=corrugated` 的 `thickness` 为金属壁厚，新增 `corrugation_depth` 为波峰到波谷的径向深度（不含壁厚），`corrugation_pitch` 为轴向节距，两者单位 m。径向包络计入壁厚与波深；单回路模板调用统一的 `CableType.radius()`，同时计入芯内层、公共层和波纹，不再只累加公共层。缺波深/节距时定位到该层具体字段；不能根据简化型号外径猜值。"},"1648":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"| 参数/热路    | 依据与受控原文位置                               | 实现                                                                                                                      |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 平均金属直径 d | IEC60287-1-1:2023 §5.3.2，CMV PDF24/印刷22 | `d=(Doc+Dit)/2`，Doc 为波峰外径，Dit 为波谷内径；平均直径薄壁等效 `Rs20=ρ20/(π d ts)`，温度修正见§5.3.1，铝套ρ20=2.84e-8 Ω·m、α20=0.00403 K⁻¹取表1/PDF40 |","table":"table-2"},"1649":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"| 参数/热路 | 依据与受控原文位置                   | 实现                                                |\n| ----- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| 环流/涡流 | 1-1 §5.3.2–5.3.7.1，PDF24–29 | 电抗/环流采用 d，涡流的外径采用 `d+ts`（§5.3.7.1注）；不增加无依据的节距电阻修正 |","table":"table-2"},"1650":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"| 参数/热路 | 依据与受控原文位置                        | 实现                                                      |\n| ----- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| T1    | 2-1:2023 §4.1.2.1/4.1.3，PDF14/18 | 各实体环形层相加；缓冲层从绝缘屏蔽到 Dit，间隙等效到平均内径 `d-ts`；材料/有效热阻率必须显式有来源 |","table":"table-2"},"1651":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"| 参数/热路 | 依据与受控原文位置             | 实现                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| T3    | 2-1 §4.1.5.1，PDF19–20 | 外覆盖层由平均外径 `d+ts` 积分至实际外径；多种涂敷/护套材料分别按§4.1.3相加；接触品字形的1.6修正保持原条款 |","table":"table-2"},"1652":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"| 参数/热路  | 依据与受控原文位置        | 实现                                                                      |\n| ------ | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 介质发热位置 | 1-1 §4.2.1及串联热平衡 | 原绝缘与半导电热路按½T1；绝缘以外新增缓冲/间隙通过全部Wd，工件另记 `dielectric_path_k_m_w`，不把外部缓冲再取一半 |","table":"table-2"},"1653":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"`parameters.corrugated_gap[cable_type_id]` 要求 `rho_k_m_w`（K·m/W）、`source`、`geometry_source`。它描述平均直径热路中的有效间隙属性；不自动用实心缓冲带或空气填缺项。支持的层序为导体屏蔽/绝缘/绝缘屏蔽/一个或多个缓冲层/皱纹金属套/可选涂敷层/外护套，缓冲与涂敷使用 `bedding/separator/binder`。`trace.corrugated_sheaths` 保存 Dit、Doc、d、节距、Rs20、缓冲/间隙热阻、介质热路及来源。节距作为几何来源记录；标准平均直径表达式不提供节距经验修正。局部波谷接触、脱离间隙、放电和烧蚀仍需数值插件，不能从本模型推断热点。"},"1654":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"起帆公开表 ZC-YJLW03-Z 64/110 kV 1×800 No.3–11给出导体34mm、屏蔽后36.7mm、绝缘后69.1mm、绝缘屏蔽后71.1mm、缓冲后79.1mm、金属套后91.1mm、成品100.6±3mm和R20≤0.0221Ω/km。计算重建采用各层近似外径之差，区别于名义厚度；缓冲带未压缩的3×2mm不能直接当安装径向6mm。原演示仅列绝缘16mm/铝套2mm/外套4mm、外径78mm，缺屏蔽、缓冲及波纹包络，不能作为原型号完整结构。"},"1655":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"城南校核采用声明的工程条件：波谷接触79.1mm缓冲外径，因此波深4mm；节距25mm来自王航等2020附表1的800mm²参考结构，非起帆实测；缓冲带k=0.17、等效均匀间隙采用空气k=0.023 W/(m·K)，引自刘黎等2021表2/PDF3，非起帆有效接触热阻试验。其余材料取上述IEC表值，XLPE ε=2.5/tanδ=0.001。地表25°C、土壤1K·m/W、中心埋深0.8m、两端接地、600A，按100.6mm外径重排接触品字形；原工作区/型号资料不覆盖。"},"1656":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"该参考条件下超算作业785281（运行5f5d7354-48b2-4242-9926-6c9fcb8c38da）求得单回路能力748.321974A；d=85.1mm、Rs20=5.311398806e-5Ω/m、T1=0.835430732K·m/W、T3（含接触修正）=0.160496881K·m/W，固定收敛电参数的热平衡手算最大电流差6.61e-6A。不是厂家载流量声明，结论依赖上述工程参考参数，计算书逐项列出。"},"1657":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"外部参数验证：王航等《波纹金属护套高压单芯电缆线芯护层互感的解析解》，电工技术学报2020，DOI10.19595/j.cnki.1000-6753.tces.190928，附表1/表1的800mm²波谷内半径37.95mm、波峰外半径45.95mm、壁厚2mm。独立等效圆筒积分 `2e-7 ln((d+ts)/(d-ts))` 得9.537nH/m，与文献近似解末位容差0.0005nH/m一致；这不是完整回路电抗或载流量实测验证。来源原件登记在标准资料目录，原件不入库。测试 `test_corrugated.py` 同时核对起帆各层外径、T1/T3分层对数式、缺项定位以及不伪造节距修正。"},"1658":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"矩形回填使用 **2023** Table 2，轴为 hb/wb、LG/hb；仅在表内双线性内插。rb=LG/exp(Gb)，C=(rho_earth-rho_fill)/(2π)·acosh(LG/rb)，各矩阵元素为按回填 rho 的基础值加 C。不等负荷修正温升为 C·ΣW，等负荷退化为标准 N·C 热阻修正。这是标准近似的线性叠加延伸，不能视作材料界面的数值场解。"},"1659":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"全部电缆 / 管道必须在同一矩形内。表范围外、无法核实的节点、无效等效半径或负修正热阻均拒算，不外推或钳制。受控原文 (hb/wb=3.0, LG/hb=3.0) 节点末位缺损；(0.3,17) 节点有印刷疑点，使用这些节点的插值拒算。"},"1660":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"T4′=U/[1+0.1(V+Y·theta_mean)·De_mm]，T4″=rho_duct/(2π)·ln(Douter/Dinner)；T4‴ 使用管外径的土壤矩阵。theta_mean 为电缆表面与管内壁温度均值。算例显式保存 Table 5 的 PVC 系数 U=1.87、V=0.312、Y=0.0037；管材 rho=6.0 K·m/W 来自 Table 1。"},"1661":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#皱纹铝护套与缓冲层","content":"导体电阻、各护套电阻、管内空气热阻随温度迭代并返回热平衡残差。逐回路求允许电流时，其他回路保持保存负荷；不平衡显式损耗模式保持相电流比例，返回最大相电流和每相电流。**各回路的独立上限不可同时使用。** 其他回路负荷令本回路零电流时仍超温，则允许电流不可用并给原因，保留真实运行超温结果。多回路目标电流校核须明确 target_circuit_id。"},"1662":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"“新建研究 → 敷设算例”提供九种输入：单回接触品字形、单回水平、双回品字形、双回水平、品字形排管、2×3 排管、3×3 排管、矩形回填、3×3 包封排管。唯一输入定义位于 backend/kernel/scenarios.py；创建独立研究，插件实际运行后才有结果。"},"1663":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"110 kV 使用 YJQ02 800 mm² 校核模型：型号系列与导体包络参考厂家资料，其余尺寸及物性为明示假设。10 kV 使用 6/10 kV 240 mm² 校核模型：Tratos 官方表提供导体参考直径 18.2 mm、绝缘 3.4 mm、R20 0.0754 Ω/km。原产品是铜丝屏蔽，本模型声明采用光滑铝管套，**不是厂家该产品**。现场条件、负荷与导热回填料为设计假设，未冒充测量。混凝土包封算例采用 Table 1 的 1.0 K·m/W 参考值，实际配比需核实。"},"1664":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-49","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"每次领域运行保存 verification 工件：不读取求解器土壤矩阵，以独立对数式重建自热 / 镜像热阻和内部热路；代入最终损耗核对逐根温度（1e-4 K）；分别核对管内空气与管壁；以最终 Rac、λ₁、空气均温做固定参数二次式允许电流手算（0.001 A）。核对失败则拒绝生成可用结果。"},"1665":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-50","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"研究“诊断”和计算书列出插件值、手算值、差值、单位、容差及条款。此检查验证热路与最终状态闭合，**不构成独立电磁复算、完整标准认证或现场试验**。"},"1666":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-51","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#工程算例与核对表","content":"公开测试位于 plugins/cablesim.iec60287/tests/test_iec60287_group.py；真实宿主 / 报告回归位于 tests/test_design_studies.py。受控 TB880 夹具默认从 .data/tb880/fixtures 读取，也可用 CABLESIM_TB880_FIXTURES 指定；不存在时明确 skip。14 项历史测试及领域算法 9 个工况均由同一物理输入运行；参考数值只用于断言，不输入求解器。"},"1667":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-52","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"每回路一个 CableInstance，phase=L1L2L3；内部三个 Core 的坐标、结构相同且相接触。多个回路采用每根整缆的实际损耗叠加互热，三根单芯与一根三芯不互换。领域映射在 three_core.py，宿主不计算物理系数。来源必须覆盖完整型号，输入与运行快照保存单位、来源和插件锁。"},"1668":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-53","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支     | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码                            | 验证与范围                                    |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 三芯铜带屏蔽T1 | 2-1 §4.1.2.3.1，CMV PDF17；§4.1.2.5/4.1.3，PDF18 | 挤包绝缘、各芯铜带屏蔽按SL，逐环形层T1/CLL；不使用纸绝缘屏蔽几何修正曲线 |","table":"table-3"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-54","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支    | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码                        | 验证与范围                                                       |\n| ------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 填充/内衬T2 | 2-1 §4.1.4.2、§5.6、图6，PDF19/38–39/49（英文正文） | 芯外独立保护层热阻/3；相接触上曲线涵盖相同热阻率的全部填充、包带和公共内衬，不拆成公共环形热阻；X在(0,0.15] |","table":"table-3"},"1670":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-55","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支  | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码 | 验证与范围              |\n| ----- | ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| 外护套T3 | 2-1 §4.1.5，PDF19   | 铠装或内衬外径至外护套外径的环形热阻 |","table":"table-3"},"1671":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-56","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支      | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码                | 验证与范围                                    |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| Rdc、ys、yp | 1-1 §5.1.2/5.1.3/5.1.5.1，PDF19–20 | R20按成品长度，不重复乘绞入；三芯内部中心距，xp≤2.8；ys按三个规定区间 |","table":"table-3"},"1672":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-57","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支     | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码                  | 验证与范围                                                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 铜带/金属套λ1 | 1-1 §5.3.1/5.3.2/5.3.11，PDF23–24/32 | 两端接地，非分割圆导体；铠装SL环流系数1.5；涡流按该条款为0；铜带纵向R20为有来源的输入，不能把螺旋带的带材截面当成沿电缆纵向导电截面 |","table":"table-3"},"1673":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-58","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支    | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码          | 验证与范围                                            |\n| ------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 磁性双钢带λ2 | 1-1 §5.4.3.4式17–20，PDF38–39 | 单带0.3–1.0mm，实际间隙与带宽计算等效厚度；磁滞、涡流分开保存；非50Hz按规定因子修正 |","table":"table-3"},"1674":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-59","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支   | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码              | 验证与范围                                                                                                                                                 |\n| ------ | ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 磁性钢丝λ2 | 1-1 §5.4.3.3.1/5.4.3.5，PDF37/39 | 需20°C工频AC铠装纵向电阻、α、平均直径；`longitudinal_resistance_basis=power_frequency_ac`，`longitudinal_resistance_frequency`(Hz)须等于回路频率，拒绝DC代替；圆导体≤400mm²；屏蔽环流降低铠装损耗 |","table":"table-3"},"1675":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-60","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支    | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码                | 验证与范围                                     |\n| ------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| C、Wd、成缆 | 1-1 §5.2，PDF22；2-1 Annex A，PDF102 | C乘CLL、T1除CLL，CLL由芯外径和成缆绞距算；显式计入Wd，每芯通过½T1 |","table":"table-3"},"1676":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-61","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"| 量/分支      | IEC 2023条款与受控PDF页码       | 验证与范围                                 |\n| --------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| T4直埋/一管一缆 | 2-1 §4.2.2/4.2.3.2/4.2.6 | 整缆外径或管外径进入镜像矩阵；空气、管壁、土壤三段，不把芯当作三根管内电缆 |","table":"table-3"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-62","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"载流量分母为 Rc[T1+3(1+λ1)T2+3(1+λ1+λ2)(T3+T4)]；介质温升为Wd[½T1+3(T2+T3+T4)]。T1/Rc/C/Wd按每芯，公开量值中的各项损耗为整缆W/m，trace另存每芯明细。各回路反求时其他回路保持问询目标负荷；同时满足由全部回路的保存工作点与目标判定核对，各独立上限不能同时使用。"},"1678":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-63","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"验证位于 test_three_core.py：无铠装/钢带/钢丝各有直埋和排管手算二次式，另外覆盖不等回路损耗及缺项门禁。TB880受控摘录 tb880-three-core.json 不入库：Case2 PDF165、175–178核对CLL、T1/T2/T3/T4，钢丝λ2工作点见PDF174；Case10 PDF319–320核对钢带等效厚度与λ2两个分量。已有armoured-sl参考能力继续核对Case2允许电流838.3399739336A。"},"1679":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-64","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"Case2的630mm²完整链采用旧版TB880的钢丝导体损耗1.5扩展及GP31护套涡流；它超出此IEC2023圆导体钢丝≤400mm²领域分支，不能宣称完整Case2领域链逐项通过。Case10为扇形PILC公共铅套，只有钢带损耗组件对应，不宣称完整PILC热路已支持。公开仓库不包含受控表格或原页。"},"1680":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-65","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"厂家样本的层厚与外径不能单独补出铜带纵向电阻、钢带实际间隙、成缆绞距、芯位置及填料牌号。公开资料与工程补全分开保存；符合条件的工程参数输入、径向闭合门禁、候选推荐和计算书依赖说明见选型契约。三芯模板提供单回、三回水平、三回排管、2×3六回和3×3九回。"},"1681":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-66","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"TB880:2022 Cases 0-1、0-2、0-3 的 9 个变体覆盖直埋精确 / 简化根式、排管、回填排管、单点接地和涡流。reference_basis=tb880_reference 明示使用原算例的旧版电容常数、矩形半径及 N·C 回填约定；trace 保存基准与结果范围。默认 iec2023 仍使用当前电容常数、2023 Table 2 及 C·ΣW。二者分别验证，不把旧版算例当作 2023 全部公式的数值基准。"},"1682":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-67","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯独立铜带屏蔽与磁性铠装","content":"IEC 60287-1-1:2023 5.3.1 将单芯金属套环流公式限定为单回路。1-3:2023 处理电气并联的多根电缆，要求共享端电压与总相电流；1-2:2023 只覆盖三相双回水平布置的涡流。当前独立回路输入缺相角、端接和接地拓扑，不能自动满足这些条件。外部损耗系数必须适用于保存负荷与求允许电流所经过的范围；否则应使用专门电磁方法。"},"1683":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-68","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"IEC 插件0.9.1 / group方法0.8.0修正公共内衬的T2。保存运行`eed7c43b-f697-4220-af96-54b5a84053fc`的YJV22 8.7/15 kV 3×300，20 °C、埋深0.8 m、均匀土壤1 K·m/W、90 °C温限，原590.657115 A改为565.476149 A。这是单根三芯电缆、单回路能力，未更换尺寸、损耗系数或温限来贴合目录。"},"1684":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-69","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量          | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据                                     |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| Rac，Ω/km·芯 | 0.079464487 | 0.079464487 | 1-1 §5.1；R20=0.0601 Ω/km，90 °C，集肤与邻近效应 |","table":"table-4"},"1685":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-70","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量   | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据                      |\n| --- | ----------- | ----------- | ----------------------- |\n| λ1  | 0.020532868 | 0.020497656 | 1-1 §5.3.11；屏蔽工作温度随热路更新 |","table":"table-4"},"1686":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-71","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量   | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据                                      |\n| --- | ----------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| λ2  | 0.013590064 | 0.013590064 | 1-1 §5.4.3.4式17–20；两钢带、μr=300、实际间隙30 mm |","table":"table-4"},"1687":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-72","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量          | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据          |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------- | ----------- |\n| T1，K·m/W·芯 | 0.236347314 | 0.236347314 | 逐层对数热阻与成缆修正 |","table":"table-4"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-73","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量          | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算     | 依据                                              |\n| ---------- | ----------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| T2，K·m/W·缆 | 0.076554089 | **0.151457985** | 2-1 §4.1.4.2 / §5.6 图6，t=0.2+2.0=2.2 mm，芯径33 mm |","table":"table-4"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-74","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量          | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据         |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| T3，K·m/W·缆 | 0.085810616 | 0.085810616 | 2-1 §4.1.5 |","table":"table-4"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-75","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量          | 原实现         | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据                            |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| T4，K·m/W·缆 | 0.575283434 | 0.575283434 | 2-1 §4.2.2，ρ/(2π)·acosh(2L/D) |","table":"table-4"},"1691":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-76","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量         | 原实现       | 修正实现 / 独立手算 | 依据                            |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------- | ----------------------------- |\n| Wd，W/km·芯 | 38.945665 | 38.945665   | tanδ=0.004；整缆为116.836994 W/km |","table":"table-4"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-77","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"| 量   | 原实现        | 修正实现 / 独立手算    | 依据                    |\n| --- | ---------- | -------------- | --------------------- |\n| I，A | 590.657115 | **565.476149** | 1-1 §4.2.1，逐项二次式与迭代对拍 |","table":"table-4"},"1693":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-78","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"错误原因：原先只用0.2 mm填充/包带进入图6，另把2 mm公共内衬当作同心圆筒，隐含不存在的等温公共边界。标准的G涵盖直至铠装内表面的整个公共填充/内衬。相同材料重新划分层标签不得改变T2；不同热阻率的公共填充/内衬组合仍拒算（SL_FILLER_MATERIALS，字段指向common_layers），不以平均值替代。"},"1694":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-79","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"厂家交叉参照：Keystone Medium Voltage Catalogue Rev 2022.4，PDF49/印刷46页Table27按原列标题读取，铠装300 mm²直埋482 A、排管435 A；PDF43/印刷40页Table17给土壤1.0修正系数1.15，故直埋参考554.3 A。当前结构的491.272366 A（ρ=1.5）和565.476149 A（ρ=1.0）分别高1.924%和2.016%。目录脚注明确按6/10 kV结构计算；本例8.7/15 kV且尺寸/工程参数不同，该差值仅为交叉比较，不是同结构认证误差，也不强行修正到520–540 A。厂家表未给λ和T分项，分项采用上述标准手算，不能冒称厂家实测分项。"},"1695":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-80","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"原件SHA256 `97011d0ae2a8355a89207d2ed64eef668d70f4ba216585eb7c0e861109b359eb`；受控标准资料库存档。原件不入库。回归`test_three_core.py`核对分项、独立热平衡、同物性层划分不变性；TB880 Case2/10原参考值不变。"},"1696":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-81","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"IEC 60287-1-1:2023 Table3（CMV PDF43/印刷41页）未填充XLPE按额定电压档：≤18/30 kV，εr=2.5、tanδ=0.004；更高档tanδ=0.001。因此12/20 kV之前的0.001为错档，系统型号生成新版本改为0.004；8.7/15的0.004与64/110的0.001保持。12/20 1×400规格书的C=0.396743872 μF/km（规格书插件ε₀=8.854×10⁻¹² F/m），Wd由17.948270改为71.793080 W/km·芯。通过实际规格书电气工件验证，未改渲染器。仅修正系统参考参数，不覆盖用户实测材料事实；历史快照保留，须引用新型号版本并重算。"},"1697":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-82","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#三芯直埋与-xlpe-介质损耗核验","content":"三回排管原扫描同样受T2修正影响，ρ=0.6/0.8/1.0的共同能力现为417.384416/386.973172/362.238246 A；原428.634715/395.846826/369.459552 A属于0.9.0历史结果。辅助条件上限（另两回路400 A）现为434.994054/315.085220/无可行电流；最后一点即便待调回路降到0，固定回路也已超温，不能把空值解释为共同能力缺失。"},"1698":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-83","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"两个独立参考能力按 TB880:2022 的出版物约定复现，不扩大上方 steady-rating 的领域映射范围："},"1699":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-84","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"| 能力                     | 输入                                  | 完整覆盖与结果                                                           |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| tb880-reference-rating | cablesim.iec60287.tb880-reference/1 | Case2 三芯铅护套/钢丝铠装，838.339973934 A；Case4 低覆盖铜线屏蔽三叶形，537.463109937 A |","table":"table-5"},"1700":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-85","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"| 能力                     | 输入                                  | 完整覆盖与结果                                                                      |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| tb880-wire-foil-rating | cablesim.iec60287.tb880-wire-foil/1 | Case1 铜丝屏蔽与铝箔并联：三叶形固接990.540145055 A；平排不换位不平衡交叉互联1460.454541754 A；两个分支只计一个来源 |","table":"table-5"},"1701":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-86","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"输入仅含有来源的SI原始层径、材料、丝径/根数/绞距、负荷制度及敷设；不接受参考Rc、Rs、λ或T1–T4作为输入。插件重新推导电阻、电容、分层热阻、金属层损耗与温度，并保留迭代。Case1 平排分别求三相温度与互热；Case2 同步更新护套和铠装温度；Case4 保留出版物对短绞距的1.07/1.6热阻修正。铜线屏蔽修正限定≤35kV、覆盖率<50%；钢丝6mm修正是出版物明确的线性外推，不改写成材料常数。"},"1702":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-87","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"原文定位：Case1 pp131–163、Case2 pp164–179、Case4 pp195–205。受控PDF SHA256 `9cb8b071f3bce12b18f04fbdbb2c1205c7900d131ebf16cf5cfc9cb57a533cd9`。公开仓库只保存必要验证参数和代码，不包含正文。夹具在 `plugins/cablesim.iec60287/tests/fixtures/tb880-*.json`；测试 `test_tb880_reference.py`、`test_tb880_wire_foil.py` 同时检查原文数值、热平衡、对边界变化的响应、平衡交叉互联极限和拒算路径。"},"1703":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-88","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#tb880-原始参数参考链","content":"重放：`python plugins/cablesim.iec60287/tests/replay_tb880_reference.py`。实际宿主运行、插件版本、输入与工件摘要在 `.data/tb880/complete-references/`，并由复现库导入；工件为 `x-cablesim.iec60287-reference`，`engineering_approval=false`。这是参考算例核验，不是标准认证或工程批准。"},"1704":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-89","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"插件 1.1.0 / steady-rating 方法 1.1.0 增加 IEC 60287-3-3:2007 的固定热源降额。工况参数 `crossing_heat_sources` 可保存多条热源，每条必须给名称、轴线埋深 `depth_m`（m）、外径 `diameter_m`（m）、锐交叉角 `angle_rad`（rad）、整条热源单位长度发热 `heat_w_m`（W/m）与参数出处 `source`。净距由两轴线深度差减两半径推导，接触时拒算；表面温度不能直接替代 W/m。导体材料优先取型号的 `standard_kind`，缺项时要求工程师明确给 `crossing_conductor_material`，不按型号名字推测。"},"1705":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-90","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"| 条款           | 实现和中间量                                                   | 原文定位                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| §1、§4.1 式（1） | 均匀土壤、等温地表、叠加原理；DF = √[1 − Δθ₀/(Δθmax − Δθd)]，I = I₀ × DF | 印刷 pp.6、8 / PDF pp.8、10 |","table":"table-6"},"1706":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-91","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"| 条款            | 实现和中间量                                                                                           | 原文定位                     |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| §4.2 式（2）–（9） | 沿电缆纵向的指数衰减热核积分；TL = ρcr/A，Tr = T1+n(T2+T3+T4)，T = T1+n[(1+λ1)T2+(1+λ1+λ2)(T3+T4)]；迭代温升依赖的 γ 与 ΔW | 印刷 pp.8–9 / PDF pp.10–11 |","table":"table-6"},"1707":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-92","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"| 条款              | 实现和中间量                                                          | 原文定位              |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| §4.2 式（10）–（13） | 自适应区间保证 γΔz < 0.01；终点的未衰减温升 < 0.01 K；同时记录指数尾项温升上界，迭代变化 < 10⁻⁹ K | 印刷 p.9 / PDF p.11 |","table":"table-6"},"1708":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-93","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"| 条款              | 实现和中间量                         | 原文定位                       |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| §4.3 式（14）–（16） | 仅交叉位置重合的多个固定热源叠加；未实现纵向错开的最热点搜索 | 印刷 pp.10–11 / PDF pp.12–13 |","table":"table-6"},"1709":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-94","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"领域接入目前限定一根三芯直埋电缆、无回填和土壤分层；固定热源水平、交叉位置重合且不接触。其他几何明确返回 `CROSSING_SCOPE` 与字段路径。§4.4 两条电缆联合重定额、错开交叉点、表面温升反推热量及给定负荷三维温度尚未覆盖。降额分支不生成未校正的二维场图，不把降额前导体温度作为交叉后的温度。降额前电阻、热阻、损耗和核验保存在 `baseline_evidence`，与降额后的能力区分。"},"1710":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-95","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#交叉热源降额","content":"工件 `crossing_derating` 保存降额前后 A、无量纲 DF、交叉温升 K、TL/Tr/T、介质温升、迭代行、热源输入、净距、分段和尾项上界及标准条款；结果另提供三个可比较的量 `x-cablesim.iec60287.crossing.baseline_ampacity`、`.derating_factor`、`.temperature_rise`，带显示名称与单位。研究结论、结果对照和计算书均引用保存工件，不在渲染时重算。"},"1711":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-96","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"受控原件 SHA256 `99860ba2272ba87b85e5a02d9b4a2cf3979b7bb7bd310379daabeb838317d0bc`。Table A.1/A.2（印刷 pp.13–14 / PDF pp.15–16）为标准验证值，不是厂家额定值：300 mm² 铜单芯平排电缆，90 °C、665 A、轴深1.2 m，与轴深0.9 m的132 kV三芯电缆垂直交叉；后者固定总热量3×25.90 W/m、土壤0.8 K·m/W、环境25 °C。纯原语验证此标准几何；领域映射的三芯单回边界另测。"},"1712":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-97","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量        | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算        | 判断     |\n| ---------- | ----- | ----------- | ------ |\n| TL，K/(W·m) | 8.67  | 8.666666667 | 出版精度一致 |","table":"table-7"},"1713":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-98","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量      | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算  | 判断  |\n| -------- | ----- | ----- | --- |\n| Tr，K·m/W | 1.745 | 1.745 | 一致  |","table":"table-7"},"1714":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-99","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量     | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算     | 判断     |\n| ------- | ----- | -------- | ------ |\n| T，K·m/W | 1.88  | 1.881259 | 出版精度一致 |","table":"table-7"},"1715":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-100","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量    | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算         | 判断             |\n| ------ | ----- | ------------ | -------------- |\n| 初始温升，K | 19.2  | 19.251027775 | 式（13）精算；印刷值似截位 |","table":"table-7"},"1716":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-101","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量    | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算    | 判断          |\n| ------ | ----- | ------- | ----------- |\n| 最终温升，K | 14.1  | 约14.110 | 在原文0.1 K精度内 |","table":"table-7"},"1717":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-102","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量 | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算     | 判断                                        |\n| --- | ----- | -------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| DF  | 0.89  | 约0.88483 | 式（1）精算；印刷14.1 K代入为0.884916，不放宽DF容差以匹配0.89 |","table":"table-7"},"1718":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-103","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"| 中间量    | 标准印刷值 | 实现精算    | 判断     |\n| ------ | ----- | ------- | ------ |\n| 降额电流，A | 未单列   | 约588.41 | 665×DF |","table":"table-7"},"1719":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-104","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"印刷 DF 的差异未取得官方勘误，不把四舍五入后的值当精确参考。回归 `test_crossing.py` 独立断言式（13）、式（1）与温升出版精度的误差传播，并验证远离热源时 DF→1、小交叉角的降额强于90°、接触拒算、多源叠加及领域能力。未声称复现附录 A 的联合重定额表 A.4。"},"1720":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287-105","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/iec-60287#原文附录-a-验证","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/IEC60287_SINGLE_CORE.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1721":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","type":"page","content":"半空间线热源交叉校核（英文）","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck"},"1722":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"Independent equation family"},"1723":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"Why a difference is expected"},"1724":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#provenance-and-fail-closed-behavior","content":"Provenance and fail-closed behavior"},"1725":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"Evidence gate"},"1726":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","content":"This increment adds `cablesim.line-source-crosscheck@0.1.0` without changing the\nexisting buried or electrothermal release bytes. It is a validation-category plugin\nthat consumes the **newest successful, current-revision** `cablesim.buried-reference@0.1.0`\njob. The v0.1 UI has no arbitrary job/file selector; the exact chosen job ID is sealed in the result. It does not accept arbitrary files, another project, a stale source snapshot or\nan electrothermal/ampacity job."},"1727":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"For three line sources at `(x_j, y_j)` in homogeneous semi-infinite soil with an\nisothermal ground plane at `y=0`, the method-of-images coefficient from source `j`\nto cable `i` is"},"1728":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"`G_ij = rho_soil/(2*pi) * ln(r_image / r_real)`."},"1729":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"`r_image = sqrt((x_i-x_j)^2 + (y_i+y_j)^2)`. For different cables,\n`r_real` is their center distance; for the self term, it is the cable jacket outer\nradius. Each cable's own center-to-jacket rise adds"},"1730":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"`R_internal = 1/(4*pi*k_conductor) + sum[ln(r_o/r_i)/(2*pi*k_layer)]`"},"1731":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"through the five outer material layers. The analytical conductor-center temperature\nis therefore"},"1732":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"`T_i = T_ambient + q_i*R_internal + sum_j(G_ij*q_j)`."},"1733":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#independent-equation-family","content":"This calculation shares the saved dimensions, material constants, positions, soil\nthermal resistivity and explicit W/m sources, but it does **not** share the FEM weak\nform, sparse assembly or solution. It is consequently useful as an independent\nequation-family check, not as experimental validation."},"1734":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"The FEM source job uses a finite rectangle with ambient-temperature ground, side and\nbottom boundaries and polygonal interfaces. The analytical model has only an\nisothermal ground plane and an otherwise infinite soil half-space, and represents\neach cable externally as a line source. Its internal cable resistance remains a\ncircular six-layer solution. Reported FEM-minus-analytical differences therefore\ncombine at least:"},"1735":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"finite side/bottom truncation in the FEM domain;"},"1736":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"line-source and circular-interface approximations in the analytical reference;"},"1737":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"polygonal geometry and P1 mesh discretization;"},"1738":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"numerical rounding and source integration."},"1739":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#why-a-difference-is-expected","content":"There is deliberately no built-in pass/fail tolerance. Expanding the FEM soil box\nshould normally reduce artificial cooling if truncation dominates, but a decreasing\ndifference does not prove infinite-domain accuracy, mesh independence, material\naccuracy or compliance."},"1740":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#provenance-and-fail-closed-behavior","content":"The host copies only the source job's sealed `thermal.json` and a bounded metadata\nrecord containing its exact plugin pin, command, arguments, project revision and\nsnapshot digest. The worker recalculates the comparison from the current saved\nScenario and CircularRecipe. It rejects changed powers, domain scale, resolution,\nambient temperature, soil conductivity, geometry, plugin identity or source command.\nThe resulting `line-source.json` is hashed like every other project artifact."},"1741":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#provenance-and-fail-closed-behavior","content":"The UI shows phase-by-phase source heat, FEM peak, analytical center temperature,\ndifference, the external resistance matrix and the finite-domain dimensions. It\nnever promotes the report to the host ampacity result and labels the absence of an\nengineering acceptance threshold."},"1742":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"`Line-source cross-check evidence` runs:"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"the full host regression suite and checked-in schema/integrity checks;"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"real Gmsh/scikit-fem buried sources at domain scales 4, 8 and 16 on Linux and\nWindows, checking that this fixture approaches the unchanged half-space result;"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"the actual install/enable/source/invoke/download chain, cross-project and stale\nsource rejection, and no engineering revision change."},"1746":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"The default synthetic fixture is not manufacturer data or a published cable rating.\nExact numerical claims must cite an exact commit and its workflow artifacts."},"1747":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/line-source-crosscheck#evidence-gate","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/LINE_SOURCE_CROSSCHECK.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"page","content":"计算方法与载流量口径","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"现行载流量结果契约"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#热网络交叉校核参考--mv-thermal-010","content":"热网络交叉校核参考 · MV-THERMAL-0.1.0"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"1. 身份与范围"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"2. 输入与单位"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#3-导体与介质损耗","content":"3. 导体与介质损耗"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"4. 热阻与三相耦合"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#5-电阻热反馈和载流量","content":"5. 电阻热反馈和载流量"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#6-结果核算","content":"6. 结果核算"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#7-图形的物理含义","content":"7. 图形的物理含义"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#8-追溯与数据完整性","content":"8. 追溯与数据完整性"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"9. 工程应用之前"},"1760":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"IEC 新输出的每个 `ampacity` 数量及对应计算工件条目都有 `rating_basis`："},"1761":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"| `kind`           | 显示名   | 含义                             |\n| ---------------- | ----- | ------------------------------ |\n| `single_circuit` | 单回路能力 | 只有一个回路，内部三相互热仍参与，按该回路各电缆温限求上限。 |","table":"table-0"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"| `kind`            | 显示名     | 含义                                              |\n| ----------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `common_balanced` | 全回路共同能力 | 所有回路同时采用相同平衡 RMS 电流，任一电缆首先达到温限即限制共同电流；独立于原目标负荷。 |","table":"table-0"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"| `kind`                   | 显示名            | 含义                                       |\n| ------------------------ | -------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `conditional_fixed_load` | 其他回路固定负荷下的条件上限 | 只调节目标回路，其余电缆保持保存负荷，检查全部电缆温限；各条件上限不能同时使用。 |","table":"table-0"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"对象还包含 `display_name`、`varied_circuits` 和 `fixed_currents_a`。最后一项按物理电缆 ID 保存固定 RMS 电流（A），不平均不平衡相负荷；条件上限的显示名同时列出这些负荷。单回路与共同能力的固定负荷字典为空。IEC 波形、电磁耦合及不平衡适用边界仍按插件契约执行，不因显示口径而扩大。"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"`case=rating` 仍是逐回路结果，`case=rating-simultaneous` 为等负荷结果，不能合并。新的扫描请求未指定 `driver.rating_basis` 时采用 `simultaneous`；明确指定 `individual` 以及已保存的旧定义保持原口径。`output.default_result` 提供完整的 `key/entity/case/unit` 默认选择器，前端必须按四项匹配，不能取第一条 `ampacity`；失败采样点保留缺口。显示文案取数量自身的 `rating_basis.display_name`。旧运行/尚未声明的插件缺此字段时不补造口径，旧数据必须显式重跑才能取得新工件。"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"IEC 0.9.1修正三芯公共内衬T2后，三回排管 YJV22 3×300 在土壤0.6/0.8/1.0 K·m/W下共同能力为417.384/386.973/362.238 A。旧0.9.0的428.635/395.847/369.460 A及固定400 A时181.274 A仅保留为历史口径核验；新热阻与损耗逐项核验见IEC方法说明，历史对照见选型契约。"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"接口路径不变：研究预检、提交运行、读取运行及运行列表的响应中，`cases[].results[]` 使用 OpenAPI `QuantityResult`，其可选 `rating_basis` 使用 `AmpacityBasis`；运行的 `output.default_result` 使用 `ResultSelector`。响应省略原工件未提供的可选字段，避免给历史输出补 `null` 而改变内容摘要。新数量示例："},"1768":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#现行载流量结果契约","content":"领域 `Layer` 新增 `corrugation_depth`（径向波峰至波谷深度，不含金属壁厚，m）与 `corrugation_pitch`（轴向节距，m）；均须为正值且只适用于 `form=corrugated`。IEC 另要求声明缓冲层物性和 `parameters.corrugated_gap[型号ID]` 的有效热阻率及来源，见皱纹护套契约。"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#热网络交叉校核参考--mv-thermal-010","content":"以下仅描述热网络参考方法，正式 IEC 能力及适用范围见IEC 方法说明，不将参考方法边界当成全平台边界。"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"本内核是可审计的稳态热网络 Demo，而非完整 IEC 60287 实现。标准目录仅用于说明稳态损耗和热阻问题的范围，不表示本仓库包含标准全文、逐条实现或已通过合规验证。"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"范围参考："},"1772":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"IEC 60287-1-1:2023，稳态载流量及损耗：https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/68118"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"IEC 60287-2-1:2023，热阻：https://webstore.iec.ch/en/publication/68134"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"适用几何：单回路、三根相同单芯无铠装电缆；同心层；水平或等边三角排列。介质为无限横向延伸的均匀土壤，地表为恒定环境温度，轴向无限长近似。三相承受相同有效值电流，但因散热位置不同，温度及电阻逐相求解。"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#1-身份与范围","content":"不支持排管、空气敷设、回填分区、干燥带、多回路、铠装、外热源、接头及端部、谐波、暂态、循环与应急负荷。U₀ 和绝缘尺寸的组合不进行电气强度或绝缘配合校核。"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量       | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义   |\n| ------- | ---- | ----------- |\n| 导体截面积 A | mm²  | 金属面积，不是包络面积 |","table":"table-1"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量     | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义 |\n| ----- | ---- | --------- |\n| 层厚与半径 | mm   | 进入内核时转为 m |","table":"table-1"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量          | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义    |\n| ---------- | ---- | ------------ |\n| 埋深、间距、线路长度 | m    | 埋深为三相中心的平均深度 |","table":"table-1"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量      | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义      |\n| ------ | ---- | -------------- |\n| 导体 R₂₀ | Ω/km | 除以 1000 后为 Ω/m |","table":"table-1"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量       | 接口单位  | 内核单位 / 含义 |\n| ------- | ----- | --------- |\n| 热阻率 ρth | K·m/W | 材料热导率的倒数  |","table":"table-1"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量             | 接口单位  | 内核单位 / 含义    |\n| ------------- | ----- | ------------ |\n| 每单位长度热阻 T、G、H | K·m/W | 乘以 W/m 得温升 K |","table":"table-1"},"1782":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量     | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义      |\n| ----- | ---- | -------------- |\n| 电压 U₀ | kV   | 相对地 RMS，不是线间电压 |","table":"table-1"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量    | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义   |\n| ---- | ---- | ----------- |\n| 电流 I | A    | 三相平衡 RMS 电流 |","table":"table-1"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量    | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义   |\n| ---- | ---- | ----------- |\n| 损耗 q | W/m  | 每根电缆每单位轴向长度 |","table":"table-1"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量   | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义 |\n| --- | ---- | --------- |\n| 温度  | °C   | 温差数值等同 K  |","table":"table-1"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"| 量    | 接口单位 | 内核单位 / 含义            |\n| ---- | ---- | -------------------- |\n| 线路损耗 | kW   | 三相损耗总和乘以线路长度并除以 1000 |","table":"table-1"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"导体填充系数 f 只用于包络几何：`r0 = sqrt(A / (π f))`，此式中半径单位为 mm。导体屏蔽、绝缘、绝缘屏蔽、金属屏蔽、外护套依次叠加得到 r1…r5。金属层为连续等效铜圆筒，并不重现实际铜丝间隙或接触热阻。"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"水平坐标为 (-s,h)、(0,h)、(s,h)。三角坐标为 (0,h-s/√3)、(-s/2,h+s/(2√3))、(s/2,h+s/(2√3))。界面与后端采用相同约定。"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#2-输入与单位","content":"本近似要求每相中心到地表深度不小于外半径的 10 倍，并拒绝中心间距小于外径的重叠模型。输入不合格时返回错误，不静默修正为默认值。"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#3-导体与介质损耗","content":"未指定厂家 R₂₀ 时，按理想导体估计："},"1791":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#3-导体与介质损耗","content":"这些数值是可审查的演示常数，不是所有合金、绞合形式和温区的认证材料模型。未计绞合增量。厂家 R₂₀ 非空时，以厂家输入为准；随后改变面积不会覆盖该电阻输入。"},"1792":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#3-导体与介质损耗","content":"kAC 为用户输入的交流附加系数，λ 为用户输入的屏蔽损耗比。**没有自动集肤/邻近效应、屏蔽环流、接地方式或交叉互联求解**。实际值须由独立方法确定。"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#3-导体与介质损耗","content":"C 的输出转换为 nF/km 时乘以 10^12。U₀ 在上述公式中使用 V。"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"五个径向层热阻（内核从 0 开始索引）："},"1795":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"半导电层、XLPE 和护套热阻率来自输入；金属等效层使用热导率 400 W/(m·K) 的演示假设。忽略导体内部径向温差，将导体视为等温节点。"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"均匀半空间土壤热阻矩阵 G："},"1797":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"屏蔽损耗集中在金属屏蔽外侧节点，介质损耗在绝缘热阻中的温升贡献近似为半个绝缘层热阻。用 1 表示三维全 1 向量："},"1798":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-49","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#4-热阻与三相耦合","content":"u 为导体相对环境温升。d 是近似分布介质发热的贡献，并非严格的体积发热有限元解。"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-50","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#5-电阻热反馈和载流量","content":"令 b = I²R20,AC α，`qambient = I² R20,AC [1 + α(θambient-20)]`，则："},"1800":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-51","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#5-电阻热反馈和载流量","content":"在 `b × max_eigenvalue(H) >= 1` 时，拒绝运行电流的解，提示已超出此线性热反馈模型的稳定范围。不得把该条件直接解释为真实电缆的精确热失控阈值：材料、边界和损伤机制未完整建模。"},"1801":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-52","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#5-电阻热反馈和载流量","content":"允许载流量由二分法寻找 `max(θA,θB,θC) = θlimit`，70 次迭代，搜索上界在奇异反馈阈值之下。若零电流的介质损耗已使温度达到上限，则该工况没有可用正载流量，返回错误。"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-53","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#5-电阻热反馈和载流量","content":"给定运行电流单独求温度。运行无稳定解时，允许载流量仍可独立有效；运行温度、裕量和损耗返回 null。高于温度限值有明确警告；超过 150 °C 的运行温度额外警告材料线性外推失去工程可靠性。"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-54","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#6-结果核算","content":"每次求解输出温度方程最大残差。径向层节点温度逐层扣除相应损耗乘热阻；最外节点应与矩阵表面温度一致。线路长度只改变总损耗，不改变无限长截面模型的载流量。"},"1804":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-55","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#7-图形的物理含义","content":"三维显示是参数化结构示意：径向尺寸随输入变化，轴向剖切、绞线根数、展开距离与长度不参与求解，不是 CAD 制造图或有限元网格。"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-56","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#7-图形的物理含义","content":"土壤场采用每根电缆线热源及镜像的外部解析叠加："},"1806":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-57","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#7-图形的物理含义","content":"电缆内部圆盘被屏蔽为 null，不绘制伪造内部场。地表 y=0 恒为环境温度。图中横纵轴物理尺度一致，网格为 81×49。运行有稳定解时使用运行损耗；否则使用极限载流状态，图明确标注所用电流。"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-58","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#7-图形的物理含义","content":"自热矩阵采用圆柱对平面 acosh 表达式，而外部图采用中心线源，因此靠近表面的云图值与矩阵表面温度存在近似差别；网格分辨率也有限。不得将该图宣称为有限元、多物理场或完整三维仿真。"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-59","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#8-追溯与数据完整性","content":"输入经 Pydantic 规范化后，将完整 JSON 按键排序、无多余空格、保留 UTF-8 编码，计算 SHA-256；输出模型版本和 UTC 时间。SHA-256 识别的是输入内容，并不是数字签名、计算认证或防篡改数据库。"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-60","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#8-追溯与数据完整性","content":"现有工作台以完整输入内容判断结果是否过期。新研究 API 从保存的工程和研究配置生成固定快照，记录输入、方法发行、环境与输出摘要；工程后续修改只把原运行标为历史。新计算书读取指定运行的封存结果，不重新计算，也不接受前端替换结果；旧演示 `/api/report` 接口保留原有重算行为。"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-61","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"IEC 插件 1.1.0 的交叉热源子集采用 IEC 60287-3-3:2007 §4.1–4.3；逐式说明、适用范围与附录 A 中间量验证见 交叉热源降额。允许电流的原口径保持，结果另外标明降额前能力、降额后能力、DF和固定热源出处；不把未求解的给定电流三维温度或二维场图作为交叉后的结果。"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-62","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"新建研究默认从选中插件清单复制参数默认值；工程师明确选择“沿用最近研究”才复制同工程同方法最近研究的保存参数（包括显式边界），来源随研究保存。此规则不重写既有研究与运行。旧有限元运行缺 `outer_boundary` 时，先读封存 bundle.result.outer_boundary.kind，仍缺才按历史截断边界 ambient_truncated 展示，不用当前插件默认值重标旧结果。"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-63","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"研究单项及列表响应新增 `latest_module_run_ids`（模块标识到已保存运行 UUID 的映射，空标识代表主任务），保留 `latest_run`。普通入口仅按其模块读取一份详情；显式选中运行优先读该运行，运行历史在打开抽屉后才读取。路由预取与组件详情共享 `saved-run` 缓存；没有修改历史列表或运行详情路径。"},"1813":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-64","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"方法对照的 `quantities[].title` 为可选显示名，读取保存结果的物理量标题；交叉降额前允许电流、降额系数和交叉温升沿用插件清单的标题与 SI 单位，不按扩展键猜中文名称。"},"1814":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-65","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"工作台保留的热网络是简化参考方法，实现位于插件 `plugins/cablesim.thermal-network`（原 `backend/engine.py`，公式与数值不变，由 `tests/test_engine_golden.py` 经插件执行复现）。按 IEC 60287 拆分计算并经 CIGRE TB 880 算例逐项核对的单芯方法见 IEC60287_SINGLE_CORE.md，已接入保存研究 API 和工作台的显式输入表单，可按直埋子集适用范围选择。黄金值用于重构回归，不是正确性证据。"},"1815":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-66","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"必须针对目标电缆和敷设方式，用有使用授权的正式标准文本、厂家结构材料数据、独立实现或参考软件以及可用实测结果，分别验证电阻、损耗、热阻、温度与最终载流量。本仓库尚未完成此级别的外部验证；自动测试通过不能据此升级为设计用额定值。"},"1816":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis-67","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/rating-basis#9-工程应用之前","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/METHOD.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1817":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"page","content":"产品标准尺寸核对","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check"},"1818":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"原文与边界"},"1819":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"第2部分铠装与内衬"},"1820":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"隔离套适用条件与内衬关系"},"1821":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#三个真实型号的手工核对","content":"三个真实型号的手工核对"},"1822":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-8715-kv-3240","content":"江南 YJV22 8.7/15 kV 3×240"},"1823":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-2635-kv-3240","content":"江南 YJV22 26/35 kV 3×240"},"1824":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#起帆-cuxlpecaspvc-64110-kv-1800","content":"起帆 CU/XLPE/CAS/PVC 64/110 kV 1×800"},"1825":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#独立公式对拍","content":"独立公式对拍"},"1826":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#页面与异常","content":"页面与异常"},"1827":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"`cablesim.standard-check / dimensions` 接收 `cablesim.domain/1` 的保存输入，输出 `x-cablesim.standard-check` 工件。宿主保存不可变输入、方法发行摘要、运行与工件摘要；所有限值、公式、修约和判定在插件中执行。不会使用 IEC 60287 的热计算替代产品标准核对。"},"1828":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"当前发行1.8.6固定标准依据库0.9.1，方法版本1.8.5。4,406条记录摘要和363个完整列表成员锁不变，不改判定方法，不迁移历史回执。"},"1829":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"方法1.8.5修复浏览器传回依据时的误拒：型号设计页经 `JSON.parse`/`JSON.stringify` 回传依据，整数值浮点数（如额定电压 `8700.0`、GB/T 3956 表 3 截面轴 `240.0`）会变成同值整数，旧方法据此判定“查询身份不一致”或“记录摘要不一致”，表现为预检通过、运行失败。查询与记录内容现在只把精确等值的整数浮点与同一整数视为相同，不采用误差容限，不接受布尔值或字符串替代数值："},"1830":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"方法自行计算的查询仍须与发行方查询摘要完全一致；"},"1831":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"原发方记录摘要仍须一致；4,406 条记录中有 925 条本身含整数值浮点，`basis-records.json` 的 `content_records`（`cablesim.basis-json-content/1`）另行固定这些记录在同一规则下的内容摘要，由 `basis_catalog.py --write` 机械生成；其余记录两种摘要相同；"},"1832":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"运行工件保存方法自己的查询，`query_sha256` 可直接复核。"},"1833":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","content":"回归见 `tests/test_standard_basis_browser_numbers.py`：以真实 JavaScript 传输核对 8.7/15 kV 与 26/35 kV 型号经宿主建研究、预检和运行，覆盖 5 类导体电阻、GB/T 12706.3 表 A.2 完整清单及 220 kV ST2 外护套记录，并拒绝改数值、换布尔值或字符串。"},"1834":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"已按实现条款核验用户提供的 GB/T 12706.1/.2/.3—2020、GB/T 11017.2—2024、GB/T 3956—2008 PDF。包内 `sources.json` 记录文件名、SHA-256 及正文 / PDF 页码偏移；不分发整份标准原文。"},"1835":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"已实现：XLPE 表内标称绝缘厚度；低压绝缘平均厚度与最薄点、中压最薄点与厚度偏差；中压内衬层和外护套的受支持假定直径链；铜带厚度与搭盖率；GB/T 12706.2—2020 圆丝 / 双带铠装的材料、表10/11尺寸、制造测量与绕包内衬附加垫层；110 kV 铜丝径与平均间隙、铅 / 皱纹铝 / 平铝护套与外护套标称表；第 2 类裸铜、镀层铜、铝导体 R₂₀ 表 2。中压隔离套的适用条件与内衬关系见下文；带隔离套或金属套的完整封签尺寸链尚未接齐，不以既有公式常量补成通过结论。"},"1836":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"以下要求始终保留为“未覆盖”，不以其他标准或版本替代："},"1837":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"GB/T 11017.1—2024 缺少原文：110 kV 绝缘、金属护套和外护套的最薄点要求。"},"1838":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"GB/T 11017.2—2014 缺少原文：12706 系列引用该版的铜丝平均间隙定义与算法。"},"1839":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"金属屏蔽 / 护套的短路容量与截面下限：需故障电流、持续时间与适用的短路方法，几何截面不代表满足短路要求。"},"1840":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"第 1 部分内衬层的省略 / 应用条件、三芯省略内衬层、公共屏蔽或线芯附加护层、异截面成缆、第1/3部分未核验的铠装分支、扁丝铠装和其他未核验构造；未覆盖的直径分支使依赖它的护套公式停止判定。"},"1841":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"非 XLPE 绝缘、第 1/5/6 类导体电阻、表外尺寸、供需协议变更及未核验的制造试验要求。"},"1842":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"数值缺项与规则未覆盖分开记录。层标称厚度、单带标称厚度、最薄点、最大 / 平均实测厚度互不替代。最薄点公式使用规定标称厚度；采用更厚的设计标称值时随之提高，低于已知标准标称要求的设计不能反过来降低测量下限。标称最低要求与测量要求分别判定。公式中间值同时记录设计标称、标准标称最低要求和采用值。R₂₀ 还需明确导体类别、镀层和数据性质；厂家声明上限不作为实测值。没有近似尺寸或默认电阻兜底。"},"1843":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#原文与边界","content":"附录 A 的直径只用于护层限值，不能用厂家近似成品外径替代。每步按附录 B.1 修约至 0.1 mm；最薄点按表 B.1 修约至 0.01 mm 后比较。12706.1 的绝缘平均值修约至 0.1 mm。"},"1844":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"规则从包内 `dimensions.json` 的 `armour.mv2` 读取：允许材料与磁性、构造、尺寸档、测量比例、双带数量及间隙上限均为数据，不用材料名称或顺序 if 链推测构造。材料 `standard_kind` 必须明确；泛指镀层铜不等于标准允许的镀锡铜铠装，尚无专用分类时保持未覆盖。"},"1845":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支        | 条款与边界                            |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 材料 / 交流单芯 | §13.2，正文11 / PDF19；单芯交流不得套用磁性钢铠装 |","table":"table-0"},"1846":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支          | 条款与边界                                      |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 圆丝 / 钢带标称尺寸 | §13.5 表10/11，正文12–13 / PDF20–21；按铠装前假定直径查档 |","table":"table-0"},"1847":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支          | 条款与边界                                                                                                      |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 圆丝直径 / 带厚测量 | §17.7，正文18–19 / PDF26–27；圆丝测量平均直径≥95%标称，带最薄值≥90%标称。`mean_wire_diameter` 和 `minimum_tape_thickness` 不以标称值代替 |","table":"table-0"},"1848":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支    | 条款与边界                                              |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 双钢带结构 | §13.7，正文13 / PDF21；两层、间隙不大于带宽一半。0.5是允许上限，不是实际制造默认值 |","table":"table-0"},"1849":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支       | 条款与边界                                                                                                           |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 绕包内衬附加垫层 | §13.7；0.2 mm带附加≥0.5 mm，其余带≥0.8 mm；总最薄值≥0.8×规定总标称−0.2 mm。`padding_thickness` 已包含在 `thickness` 中，不能重复加厚；挤包内衬不加此垫层 |","table":"table-0"},"1850":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支        | 条款与边界             |\n| --------- | ----------------- |\n| 4 mm粗钢丝内垫 | §13.6；铠装下垫层至少2 mm |","table":"table-0"},"1851":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"| 分支     | 条款与边界                                                                                     |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 铠装假定直径 | 附录A.2.9/A.2.10，正文42 / PDF50；圆丝增量2倍丝径，扎带>0.3 mm时计入2倍带厚；双带增量4倍单带厚。绕包附加垫层按表A.3增加1.0 / 1.6 mm |","table":"table-0"},"1852":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#第2部分铠装与内衬","content":"三芯填充已包含在成缆系数中，不再把几何填充径向厚度加进假定直径。独立对拍：3×300紧压铜、4.5 mm XLPE、铜屏蔽和挤包内衬的条件输入得到铠装前假定直径70.3 mm；表11钢带0.8 mm，铠装后73.5 mm，外护套规定标称3.6 mm。改成绕包附加垫层后按表A.3得到铠装前71.9 mm。实际 CAD 外径仍由真实结构尺寸独立推导。"},"1853":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"方法 `1.8.5` 经原有 Types 要求依据接口和 Executor 消费依据发行 `0.9.1` 的 GB/T 12706.2—2020 §13.3.3。原始记录、逐记录摘要和两路核验记录保持不变；新增消费不构成一次新的原页目视核验。"},"1854":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"| 已固定记录                                                         | 精确查询条件         | 消费边界                               |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `mv-isolation-applicability/r1/separation_sheath_application` | 不同金属、无纵向阻水、非铅套 | 要求明确的挤包隔离套；普通光滑内衬和单个材料确认不代替隔离套符合性。 |","table":"table-1"},"1855":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"| 已固定记录   | 精确查询条件                     | 消费边界                                                              |\n| ------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 同表 `r2` | `lead_sheath_present:true` | 铅套铠装可采用隔离套或符合13.3.4的绕包垫层；没有13.3.4的完整执行依据时保留未覆盖，不套用8.2内衬或13.7附加垫层。 |","table":"table-1"},"1856":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"| 已固定记录   | 精确查询条件       | 消费边界                                                |\n| ------- | ------------ | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 同表 `r3` | `{}`，并固定记录ID | 独立的“隔离套与内衬配置关系”行，仅确认替代或同时设置；不回答是否必须隔离，不是同金属分支的免除依据。 |","table":"table-1"},"1857":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"| 已固定记录                                                                     | 精确查询条件                            | 消费边界                                                     |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `mv-isolation-water-barrier/r1/separation_sheath_water_barrier_exception` | `longitudinal_water_barrier:true` | 有明确来源的相邻金属层周围、铠装内侧纵向阻水声明时，本条不要求隔离套；不证明阻水性能或其他材料、尺寸和试验合格。 |","table":"table-1"},"1858":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"r1/r2/r3在印刷第11页 / PDF第19页，纵向阻水例外在第12页 / PDF第20页。每次先从当前层顺序确定相邻金属：有公共金属层时使用铠装内侧最外一层，否则分别检查各芯最外金属层。公共金属屏蔽也在范围内。铅套选择仅用于实际相邻公共铅套或所有相邻各芯均为铅套；各芯铅套与其他金属混合时，未接入的逐界面判定保持未覆盖，不以一芯的垫层选择或统一阻水声明替代全部界面。`standard_kind` 必须明确，不从标签猜材料；同金属组中的不同合金或镀层类别不推测为已核验的同异性条件。隔离套必须实际位于该金属层与铠装之间，位于金属层内侧或铠装外侧判为不满足。"},"1859":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"替代内衬时，8.2内衬要求保留对r3的完整固定回执依赖；关系成立仍须独立满足隔离套符合性。标称厚度公式、材料14.2及火花试验尚未组成完整可执行链，继续明确未覆盖。最薄点未提供时保持缺项，标称厚度不代替实测；已有厚度或记录文字也不生成合格结论。"},"1860":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"制造声明沿用 `/cable_types/{escaped_id}/common_layers/armour/engineering/` 的来源记录：`longitudinal_water_barrier`、`separator_compound_confirmed` 为明确布尔值；`separator_material_reference`、`separator_spark_test_reference` 为材料牌号/符合性和试验记录文字，单位均为 `1`。它们不接受标准条款充当本电缆的制造来源。即使材料确认及记录都已填写，未接齐的14.2、火花试验和完整厚度判据仍不通过。`separation_structure`、`separation_dependencies` 和工程输入出处保留在运行工件中；主规则与配置关系各自保留原始回执。"},"1861":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#隔离套适用条件与内衬关系","content":"固定查询还校验请求的 `record_id` 与实际回执的 `record.id` 相同；同条款、同物理量的另一条真实封签记录也不能替换本次选择。查询本体与摘要按canonical JSON逐类型比对，`true`不能改成`1`。单条及整表回执都核对嵌套记录摘要和由签内字段重建的引文；单条的外壳记录身份、标准版次、条款、来源摘要与两种页码须逐项一致。原批次的request/artifact摘要继续原样保留，不把可重建字段校验宣称为重新执行或认证该批次。型号结构或条件变化后必须重新查询。真实流程回归见 `tests/test_type_separation_rules.py`，条件性设计与教学测量明确标识，不冒充厂家制造或试验数据。"},"1862":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#三个真实型号的手工核对","content":"三份输入在 `tests/fixtures/standard_check_cases.json`，公开数值与人工算值由 `tests/test_standard_check.py` 对拍。它们是公开资料核对草稿，未补造完整制造结构，也没有试验合格结论。第 2 类裸铜作为显式核对条件，需厂家确认；没有把 GB/T 3956 的上限填成实际电阻。资料草稿的等面积导体与线芯位置只用于已知参数的比例包络，并非厂家结构外径或制造图。"},"1863":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-8715-kv-3240","content":"来源：江南电缆产品表。页面声明的标准版次为 GB/T 12706—2008；这里对比 2020 版的已核验要求，不据此认定厂家通过新版本认证。近似成品外径 73.3 mm 不用于假定直径公式。"},"1864":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-8715-kv-3240","content":"| 要求             | 手工标准值与条款                              | 厂家实际 / 声明值 | 余量   | 判定      |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------- | ---- | ------- |\n| 各芯 XLPE 绝缘标称厚度 | 4.5 mm；12706.2 §6.2 表 7，正文 7 / PDF 15 | 4.5 mm     | 0 mm | 公开标称值满足 |","table":"table-2"},"1865":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-8715-kv-3240","content":"| 要求      | 手工标准值与条款                                         | 厂家实际 / 声明值 | 余量  | 判定   |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------- | --- | ---- |\n| 各芯绝缘最薄点 | 0.9×4.5−0.1＝3.95 mm；§17.5.2 式 (4)，正文 17 / PDF 25 | 未提供        | —   | 待补实测 |","table":"table-2"},"1866":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#江南-yjv22-8715-kv-3240","content":"| 要求     | 手工标准值与条款                              | 厂家实际 / 声明值 | 余量  | 判定   |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------- | --- | ---- |\n| 绝缘厚度偏差 | (t_max−t_min)/t_max≤15%；§17.5.2 式 (5) | 未提供两端实测值   | —   | 待补数