话中保存已确认请求标识，刷新后继续查询 / 重试同一请求，不创建重复运行。确定的失败重新预检；不覆盖已保存输入和既有快照。"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-82","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#页面与异常","content":"“要求与标准”提供要求清单、执行标准与待批准导入页签。条目由已验证的标准核对工件提出；人工选择完整定义的要求，填写审批人并明确确认后才写入批准记录。来源缺失、限值未定义或判定能力未覆盖的条目保留，但不能批准。范围确认不代表要求批准。"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-83","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#页面与异常","content":"宿主 `backend/kernel/requirements.py` 只存要求定义、对象 ID、来源版本、条款、方法发行绑定和不可变审批回执，不计算限值或判定。审批版本独立于型号输入修订；批准不会改型号或旧运行。请求标识防止断网重试产生重复记录，型号与审批版本分别执行并发校验。新目录与原批准定义不同时显示冲突；仅修改测量值或调整线芯数组顺序不会替换同一对象的要求批准。"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-84","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#页面与异常","content":"再次执行核对时，当前目录里已批准的要求集及审批回执摘要写入研究输入来源，随运行快照保存。初步核对可以用于准备要求目录，页面明确显示该次运行是否绑定人工批准要求。型号发布和完整产品认证仍需单独人工流程。三芯 CAD 可用不意味着电气或标准插件自动覆盖同一构造，各方法分别校验适用范围。"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check-85","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/standard-check#页面与异常","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/STANDARD_CHECK.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"page","content":"型号电气参数与短路容量","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"原文与数据口径"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"电气参数手工核对"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"短路容量手工核对"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"出厂数据与拓扑"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#验证与范围","content":"验证与范围"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","content":"插件 `cablesim.type-electrical`，两个能力分别保存为宿主研究和不可变运行：`electrical` 与 `short-circuit`。`cablesim.standard-check` 0.1.1 读取独立出厂数据记录；设计参数不会被实测值覆盖。算法只在插件内，页面只展示计算工件。"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"IEC 60287-1-1:2023：交流电阻 §5.1.1–5.1.5（正文16–18 / CMV合订PDF64–66）；电容、介质损耗 §5.2（19 / 67）；温度系数表1（35 / 83）；ks、kp表2（36 / 84）；三芯长度修正附录A（38 / 86）。"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"IEC 60287-1-3:2023：导体几何感抗从 §4.2 式(9)及表1的等距平衡回路导出（正文第 11 页 / PDF 第 13 页；表 1 正文第 12 页 / PDF 第 14 页）。这只是导体几何项，不包含护套环流、大地返回或完整序阻抗。"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"IEC 60949:1988：第2、3章（9 / 摘录PDF3），第5章（11、13 / 4、5），第6章（13、15 / 5、6），材料表I、II（17 / 7），导体非绝热表III（19 / 8）。铜 `K=226 A√s/mm²`、`β=234.5 K`；铝148/228；铅41/230。XLPE导体的表III铜X/Y为0.41/0.12，铝为0.57/0.16。"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"AMD1:2008第4章补充：并联屏蔽、护套、铠装的电流分配与初始温度分别确定，不能累加单个组件最大容量。"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"60949来源是公开可读的原始英文页图摘录，按原貌封装；不是完整双语出版物。官方预览、英文摘录和修订文本三份均登记在标准库的《标准题录与数据用途.md》；SHA256见插件 `sources.json`。全文仅保留受控资料库及`.data`，不提交Git。"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#原文与数据口径","content":"运行参数用SI：温度K、时间s、中心距m、相电压V。界面显示°C、mm、kV。每个方法参数都带条款、报告或明确的计算条件；空来源保持缺项。运行相电压不从型号U₀推断。R20的数据性质与每米成品电缆/直线线芯的长度基准分别明确，避免三芯绞入系数重复计入。"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"三个公开产品资料仍没有实际R20、完整屏蔽尺寸、配方介电参数和成缆节距。核验页面保留缺项，不用产品标准电阻上限伪造厂家实测值。下列标准上限温度换算只作独立参考手算，不写入三个真实型号的实际输入。"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 型号与原始厂家资料                | R20公开实测 | 第二类裸铜条件参考上限 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 90°C条件参考直流电阻 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 交流电阻、电容、损耗 | 完整电感、Z₁/Z₀ |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | -------------------- | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| 江南 YJV22 8.7/15 kV 3×240 | 未提供     | 0.0754               | 0.09614254            | 缺完整输入；不出数值 | 未覆盖        |","table":"table-0"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 型号与原始厂家资料               | R20公开实测 | 第二类裸铜条件参考上限 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 90°C条件参考直流电阻 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 交流电阻、电容、损耗 | 完整电感、Z₁/Z₀ |\n| ----------------------- | ------- | -------------------- | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| 江南 YJV22 26/35 kV 3×240 | 未提供     | 0.0754               | 0.09614254            | 缺完整输入；不出数值 | 未覆盖        |","table":"table-0"},"1920":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 型号与原始厂家资料                          | R20公开实测 | 第二类裸铜条件参考上限 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 90°C条件参考直流电阻 / Ω·km⁻¹ | 交流电阻、电容、损耗 | 完整电感、Z₁/Z₀ |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------- | --------------------- | ---------- | ---------- |\n| 起帆 CU/XLPE/CAS/PVC 64/110 kV 1×800 | 未提供     | 0.0221               | 0.02817971            | 缺完整输入；不出数值 | 未覆盖        |","table":"table-0"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"参考换算：`R′=R20×[1+0.00393×(90−20)]`。R20来自已核验GB/T3956—2008表2条件值，α来自IEC60287-1-1:2023表1。此表不宣称实际导体的温度电阻已验证。"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"**TB880中间量对拍：**采用`.data/tb880/fixtures/tb880-case-0-1.json`，按原文62–75页给定的90°C导体状态计算；只读取inputSi，不读expected作为输入。导体直径30.3mm、R20=0.0283Ω/km、α=0.00393K⁻¹、f=50Hz、ks=kp=1、轴间距75.5mm。"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 中间量        | TB880原文验证值    | 本插件 / 独立核对   |\n| ---------- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| R′ / Ω·m⁻¹ | 3.608533×10⁻⁵ | 相对差不超过1×10⁻⁶ |","table":"table-1"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 中间量 | TB880原文验证值    | 本插件 / 独立核对   |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| yₛ  | 0.06012412684 | 相对差不超过1×10⁻⁶ |","table":"table-1"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 中间量 | TB880原文验证值    | 本插件 / 独立核对   |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n| yₚ  | 0.03510006481 | 相对差不超过1×10⁻⁶ |","table":"table-1"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"| 中间量        | TB880原文验证值       | 本插件 / 独立核对   |\n| ---------- | ---------------- | ------------ |\n| Rc / Ω·m⁻¹ | 3.952152638×10⁻⁵ | 相对差不超过1×10⁻⁶ |","table":"table-1"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#电气参数手工核对","content":"TB880使用旧版电容常数1/18；2023公式为`2πε0`，这里算得`2.1136449017×10⁻¹⁰ F/m`，不能调算法拟合旧版`2.11076622×10⁻¹⁰`。TB880的护套感抗也不等于导体或完整电缆的序阻抗。"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"结果页先展示结论与保存的计算条件。输入、出厂数据或方法变更后标为历史；三芯结构、实测记录和输出完全相同时合并为“芯 1–3（相同）”，不同芯分别显示。电流显示三位有效数字、修正因数三位小数，完整精度保留在右侧依据栏与运行工件。"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"短路工件包含 `cablesim.short-circuit-curve/1`：0.1–5 s 对数采样、当前计算时间及最多20个用户关注时间点。每个曲线点由插件的同一个绝热/非绝热分支计算；页面不按时间缩放已有电流。缺少输入的组件保留空采样，不插值补造结果；图域外的当前计算时间单独说明。0.25 s、4 s 曲线点同时与独立45位 Decimal 手算对拍。"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"以下三例取共同的**手算条件**：铜导体90°C初始、250°C最终、1s；不是厂家短路试验，也不证明厂家批准该最终温度。`I_AD=226 S√ln[(250+234.5)/(90+234.5)]`；XLPE非绝热`ε=√[1+0.41√(1/S)+0.12/S]`；`I=εI_AD`，S以mm²计。独立45位Decimal算术与插件双精度对拍。"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"| 型号           | 公开标称导体截面 / mm² | 绝热 I_AD / kA  | 非绝热 ε        | 非绝热 I / kA    | 金属组件           |\n| ------------ | -------------- | ------------- | ------------ | ------------- | -------------- |\n| 江南10kV 3×240 | 每芯240          | 每芯34.34004160 | 1.0133930068 | 每芯34.79995801 | 缺截面、构造及初末温度；待补 |","table":"table-2"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"| 型号           | 公开标称导体截面 / mm² | 绝热 I_AD / kA  | 非绝热 ε        | 非绝热 I / kA    | 金属组件           |\n| ------------ | -------------- | ------------- | ------------ | ------------- | -------------- |\n| 江南35kV 3×240 | 每芯240          | 每芯34.34004160 | 1.0133930068 | 每芯34.79995801 | 缺截面、构造及初末温度；待补 |","table":"table-2"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"| 型号            | 公开标称导体截面 / mm² | 绝热 I_AD / kA | 非绝热 ε        | 非绝热 I / kA   | 金属组件             |\n| ------------- | -------------- | ------------ | ------------ | ------------ | ---------------- |\n| 起帆110kV 1×800 | 800            | 114.46680533 | 1.0072962270 | 115.30198113 | 缺铝套厚度/截面及初末温度；待补 |","table":"table-2"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#短路容量手工核对","content":"导体容量不按芯数相加。金属组件§6.1修正需要各侧介质的热阻率、体积热容和热接触因数；隔离丝§5.3.1按**单丝面积**算ε，容量再乘丝数，只在明确完全嵌入且间隙至少一个丝径时开放。其他铜丝接触分支、纵包搭盖不明确的铜带，以及多个并联金属组件的总容量保留未覆盖。"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"领域文档 `measurements[]` 存放稳定ID、型号/线芯/层角色、量、SI值与单位、实测或厂家声明性质、报告/样品编号。相同对象同一量只留一个当前记录；旧记录保留在工程修订和运行快照。最薄点和最大厚度只有同一报告/样品出处才计算均匀性。设计R20与记录R20分开展示；标准上限仍由标准插件确定。屏蔽截面有数据也不自动生成不存在的故障电流要求或合格判定。"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"复用接地拓扑契约的实际回路身份；方法条件明确声明金属连接、回流路径及出处。1.2.1 方法按 IEC 60287-1-3:2023 §4.2 式 (9)、§4.3 的阻抗矩阵计算长直、非磁性、圆实心或紧压圆形的三相回路，保留自感、互感与复数阻抗（正文第 11、12 页；本地 PDF 第 13、14 页）。三芯使用保存坐标，单芯须填写排列和中心距。品字及平排的正序量经平衡相量投影，不把三个部分自感相加。"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"零序只开放明确两端连接、三条同心非磁性金属回流、无大地分流的分支；必填每相金属交流电阻、平均半径及非磁性确认。单端、交叉互联、大地回流及钢铠装完整阻抗须另行线路研究；缺系统条件标“需工程输入”，不得把局部几何感抗当完整线路阻抗。"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"IEC 60949:1988 + AMD1:2008 的短路材料常数、绝热、非绝热、螺旋带面积与并联分配依据经 Executor 实际查询 `cablesim.standards-basis`，保存逐条快照及摘要。用户明确选择绝热或非绝热容量口径；非绝热必须有相邻介质热阻率、体积热容和接触条件。并联分支按 AMD1 §4 的逆电阻比例分配已声明故障电流，逐组件重新计算初末温度对应的容量并比较余量，不把组件容量相加。遗漏任一回流部件、重复部件、缺来源或无效单位拒绝计算。钢带此处分支只作短路热容量，不声称得到钢铠装线路阻抗。"},"1939":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#出厂数据与拓扑","content":"消费清单只在依据发行变化时运行 `python plugins/cablesim.type-electrical/src/cablesim_type_electrical/basis_catalog.py --write` 机械生成（LF）；不加 `--write` 校验一致。封签只写本插件。实际计算仍查询依据插件，不以清单快照代替查询回执。"},"1940":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#验证与范围","content":"`tests/test_type_electrical.py`覆盖TB880中间量、电容/充电电流/介质损耗与导体几何电感的独立手算、三个真实型号的缺项与短路手算、时间曲线、长度基准、适用范围拒算、来源/单位、出厂数据判定、隔离执行、快照与重复请求。`frontend/src/features/type/tests/verify-analysis.mjs` 与 `frontend/scripts/verify-type-resilience.mjs`覆盖新的合并结果、完整精度、关注时间点及键盘交互，并验证型号载流量表。浏览器流程调用实际API；超时、崩溃与环境缺失的页面检查采用注入响应，实际进程故障和超时由宿主测试核验。"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-electrical#验证与范围","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/TYPE_ELECTRICAL.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1942":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","type":"page","content":"型号载流量表","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据","技术说明与算例依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"型号模块 `rating-table` 把独立型号的典型工况保存为一个研究。每行可编辑、增删；当前型号事实、各行完整领域输入、方法参数、工况来源和插件版本进入同一不可变运行。使用 `cablesim.iec60287/steady-rating`；宿主与页面不复制计算公式，不以产品标准限值补造实际 R20。"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"`backend/kernel/rating_conditions.py` 仅转换工况模板。直埋品字、水平留间隔、每根电缆一管及空气模板均显式保存中心埋深、土壤热阻率、环境温度、中心距、管径和接地条件；模板值是设计假设，不是现场测量。型号的实测 R20 可投影到本次计算输入，设计记录保持原值。系数、管内经验常数及来源须明确；求解器设置是数值收敛条件。"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"研究驱动 `batch` 接收已保存的完整工况列表及可选 `selected_case_ids`（null为全部）。运行命令只传研究身份、输入修订、插件锁摘要、范围确认和幂等请求标识。默认全选，可只运行勾选行；预检仍检查每行范围，只执行勾选且通过检查的行。未勾选的可用行标为“未运行”，拒算行保留具体原因。即使全部所选行拒算，也保存拒算记录，不能生成近似允许电流。编辑并保存后，旧运行继续保持历史，重复请求不重复执行；全局保存也保存已编辑的工况配置。"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"当前所选稳态能力支持地下单芯同心圆、明确光滑管状金属护套，以及其声明范围内的直埋/排管热路。空气、多芯、铜丝屏蔽、波纹护套等不符合此能力的工况逐行显示“超出范围”或“待补数据”及原始原因；其他插件已提供的能力不代表本模块自动切换到该方法。江南 YJV22 8.7/15 kV 3×240 与起帆 CU/XLPE/CAS/PVC 64/110 kV 1×800 的公开资料按既有来源验证；构造不在范围或缺少厂家数据时保留缺项。"},"1947":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"依据由所选插件工件记录：IEC 60287-1-1:2023 4.2.1、5.1.2及适用电损耗分支；IEC 60287-2-1:2023 4.2.4、4.2.6及适用热阻分支。`tb880_reference` 保留旧版验证口径，页面和规格书明确标为验证复现，不能当作 IEC 2023 工程结论。"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"规格书内容页可纳入一个当前载流量表运行，并与一个当前几何运行合并；没有几何运行时可生成含载流量章节的草稿，外径与用料明确未纳入。章节只读取指定快照，包含各行实际条件、允许电流、拒算原因、完整精度与版本来源；输入或研究变化后禁止用历史运行生成当前草稿。草稿不代表型号审核或发布。"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"`tests/test_type_rating.py` 验证实际 IEC 执行、冻结工作点的独立热平衡手算、两款真实型号的缺项/拒算、单位范围、历史与幂等运行。受控 `.data/tb880/fixtures/tb880-case-0-1.json` 只把 `inputSi` 作为输入；参考值 `821.7763334392 A` 来自 CIGRE TB 880:2022 case 0-1，62–75页，完整源摘要见受控摘录。浏览器合成验收工况算得约 `821.776330 A`，电流绝对差小于 `0.001 A`；水平与排管为修改条件演示，不宣称与该品字形参考工况一致。"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"正式前端的 `frontend/src/features/type/tests/verify-rating.mjs`、`verify-analysis.mjs` 和 `verify-specification.mjs` 覆盖保存、参数编辑、键盘、页面状态、完整精度与规格书章节。`frontend/scripts/verify-type-resilience.mjs` 在隔离数据库中验证重复点击、网络中断/重载后同一请求重试及错误保留；执行故障仅注入传输响应，不启动求解器。实际进程故障由宿主执行器测试覆盖。运行方式见 `frontend/README.md` 与型号模块 README，产物只写入 `.data/`。"},"1951":{"id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/notes/type-rating-table","content":"本页由仓库文件 docs/plugins/TYPE_RATING_TABLE.md 生成，修改请编辑该文件。"},"1952":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"page","content":"标准核对","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check","content":"按已核验的 GB 产品标准核对电缆结构尺寸与导体电阻，以及标准依据库：原理、公式来源、判定、适用范围、超出范围时的处理、输入要求、验证算例和已知限制。"},"1954":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#原理","content":"原理"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"公式来源"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"判定"},"1957":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#标准依据库","content":"标准依据库"},"1958":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#适用范围","content":"适用范围"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"超出范围时"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#输入要求","content":"输入要求"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"验证算例"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#已知限制","content":"已知限制"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#插件清单","content":"插件清单"},"1964":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check","content":"标准核对由两个插件配合完成："},"1965":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check","content":"`cablesim.standards-basis`（标准依据库）：离线、只读地查询已逐格核验的标准数值，返回原值、单位、适用条件、页码和来源摘要；"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check","content":"`cablesim.standard-check`（产品标准尺寸核对）：用依据库的数值逐项核对型号的结构尺寸和导体 R₂₀，记录条款、余量、待补数据和未覆盖的范围。"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#原理","content":"对每一项结构尺寸，按型号的额定电压、导体截面、芯数和材料，在执行标准的对应表格中查出规定值，再与型号的标称值、最小值或实测值比较。每一条记录写明所用条款、规定值、实际值、余量和判定。限值、公式、修约和判定都在插件中执行，不用 IEC 60287 的热计算替代产品标准核对。"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容        | 条款                                                                                 | 规则         |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- |\n| XLPE 绝缘标称厚度 | GB/T 12706.2—2020 §6.2 表 7；GB/T 12706.3—2020 §6.2 表 6；GB/T 11017.2—2024 §6.2.2 表 2 | 按额定电压与截面查表 |","table":"table-0"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容  | 条款                                 | 规则                      |\n| ----- | ---------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 绝缘最薄点 | GB/T 12706.2/.3—2020 §17.5.2 式 (4) | 不小于 0.9 × 标称厚度 − 0.1 mm |","table":"table-0"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容   | 条款            | 规则                         |\n| ------ | ------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 绝缘厚度偏差 | §17.5.2 式 (5) | (最大厚度 − 最小厚度) / 最大厚度 ≤ 15% |","table":"table-0"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容       | 条款                                                  | 规则                                                |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| 铜带屏蔽厚度与搭盖率 | GB/T 12706.2—2020 §10.2.3；GB/T 12706.3—2020 §10.2.2 | 三芯单带标称不小于 0.10 mm，最薄点不小于单带标称的 90%；搭盖率标称 15%、最小 5% |","table":"table-0"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容  | 条款                                                        | 规则      |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------- | ------- |\n| 内衬层厚度 | GB/T 12706.2—2020 §8.2.3 表 9；GB/T 12706.3—2020 §8.2.3 表 7 | 按假定直径查表 |","table":"table-0"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容        | 条款                    | 规则                                                           |\n| ----------- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 外护套标称厚度与最薄点 | §14.3 式 (3)；附录 A、附录 B | 标称厚度为 0.035 × 假定直径 + 1.0，修约到 0.1 mm；最薄点不小于 0.8 × 标称 − 0.2 mm |","table":"table-0"},"1974":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容 | 条款                       | 规则                                             |\n| ---- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 假定直径 | 附录 A（A.2.4、A.2.9、A.2.10） | 每步按附录 B.1 修约到 0.1 mm；最薄点按表 B.1 修约到 0.01 mm 后比较 |","table":"table-0"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容       | 条款                                                      | 规则                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 铠装材料、尺寸与测量 | GB/T 12706.2—2020 §13.2、§13.5 表 10/11、§13.6、§13.7、§17.7 | 圆丝测量平均直径不小于标称的 95%，钢带最薄值不小于标称的 90%；双钢带间隙不大于带宽一半 |","table":"table-0"},"1976":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容 | 条款                        | 规则                  |\n| ---- | ------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| 隔离套  | GB/T 12706.2—2020 §13.3.3 | 按相邻金属层与纵向阻水声明判定是否需要 |","table":"table-0"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容                | 条款                                      | 规则    |\n| ------------------- | --------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 110 kV 金属护套与外护套标称厚度 | GB/T 11017.2—2024 §6.6.2 表 3、§6.7.2 表 4 | 按截面查表 |","table":"table-0"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"| 核对内容        | 条款                               | 规则                    |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 第 2 类导体 R₂₀ | GB/T 3956—2008 §5.2.2、§5.3.2 表 2 | 不大于表列上限；厂家声明的上限不作为实测值 |","table":"table-0"},"1979":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#公式来源","content":"依据库保存原件的页码和 SHA256，不分发标准全文。"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"| 判定  | 含义              |\n| --- | --------------- |\n| 满足  | 有完整输入和标准依据，判定满足 |","table":"table-1"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"| 判定  | 含义               |\n| --- | ---------------- |\n| 不满足 | 有完整输入和标准依据，判定不满足 |","table":"table-1"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"| 判定   | 含义                                                |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| 待补数据 | 判定所需的数值缺失；需要出厂实测的项目（如绝缘最薄点）在取得实测值之前也是待补数据，不用标称值代替 |","table":"table-1"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"| 判定  | 含义                                                   |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 未覆盖 | 依据库尚未收录该条款或版本，依据栏显示“本库暂未收录”；**不能视为满足**，由工程师按标准原文人工核对 |","table":"table-1"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#判定","content":"不适用于本型号结构的条款不参与判定。层标称厚度、单带标称厚度、最薄点和最大、平均实测厚度互不替代；采用更厚的设计标称值时，最薄点要求随之提高。标准符合与否只说明尺寸，是否批准发布由人工另行决定。"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#标准依据库","content":"依据库的每个数值都经过两路独立核验（原页转录与独立提取），保存原件的页码与 SHA256。查询必须唯一命中；空格、缺项和版本变化明确区分。依据库作为插件整体发行，方法会记录所用发行的摘要；依据库更新后，已有工程保持原来的绑定，需要工程师重新确认才会更换。"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#标准依据库","content":"在软件的“资源 → 标准与规则”中可以按条款或数值检索依据库，查看每个值的原页出处并复制引用，见资源库。"},"1987":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#适用范围","content":"已核验的 XLPE 绝缘、表内额定电压，单芯与三芯结构；第 2 类裸铜、镀层铜和铝导体 R₂₀ 的已核验条目。"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#适用范围","content":"GB/T 12706.1/.2/.3—2020、GB/T 11017.2—2024、GB/T 3956—2008 中已实现的条款。"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#适用范围","content":"标准结构提案：由明确的输入提出圆形 XLPE 结构，提案须人工确认后才成为型号设计。"},"1990":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"核对不会因为条款未收录而失败，也不会用相近条款、其他版本或推测值代替："},"1991":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"依据库没有收录的条款或版本记为“未覆盖”，例如 GB/T 11017.1—2024（110 kV 绝缘、金属护套和外护套的最薄点）、GB/T 11017.2—2014（铜丝平均间隙算法）。"},"1992":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"非 XLPE 绝缘、第 1、5、6 类导体电阻、表外尺寸、供需协议变更和未核验的制造试验要求记为“未覆盖”。"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"缺少故障电流和持续时间时，金属屏蔽或护套截面不作合格判定。"},"1994":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"假定直径链中有未覆盖的分支（如附加包带、未知构造）时，依赖它的护套公式停止判定。"},"1995":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"缺少判定所需的数值时记为“待补数据”，在型号设计中定位到对应的结构层或字段。"},"1996":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-43","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#超出范围时","content":"运行本身失败时（例如依据版本需要重新核对、输入字段缺失），型号设计显示该次运行的实际错误和缺失字段的位置，见型号设计 · 标准核对。"},"1997":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-44","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#输入要求","content":"型号的执行标准声明（标准及版本）、额定电压、芯数、导体截面与类别、各层材料与尺寸；材料须有明确的标准类别，不从名称推测。需要实测的项目填写出厂实测记录及其来源。"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-45","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"三个真实型号的公开数据经手工核对，人工算值与插件结果对拍。它们是公开资料的核对草稿，不是三个整体合格的产品："},"1999":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-46","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"| 型号                       | 已判定的项目                             | 未完成判定的项目                                                 |\n| ------------------------ | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 江南 YJV22 8.7/15 kV 3×240 | 绝缘标称厚度 4.5 mm，满足（GB/T 12706.2 表 7） | 绝缘最薄点要求 3.95 mm、厚度偏差、铜带、内衬与外护套、R₂₀ 上限 0.0754 Ω/km：缺少厂家数据 |","table":"table-2"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-47","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"| 型号                      | 已判定的项目                              | 未完成判定的项目                 |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 江南 YJV22 26/35 kV 3×240 | 绝缘标称厚度 10.5 mm，满足（GB/T 12706.3 表 6） | 绝缘最薄点要求 9.35 mm 等：缺少厂家数据 |","table":"table-2"},"2001":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-48","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"| 型号                 | 已判定的项目                                              | 未完成判定的项目                                   |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 起帆 64/110 kV 1×800 | 绝缘标称厚度 16.0 mm、外护套标称厚度 4.5 mm，满足（GB/T 11017.2—2024） | 最薄点：GB/T 11017.1—2024 未收录；皱纹铝套厚度与短路容量：缺少数据 |","table":"table-2"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-49","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#验证算例","content":"另有一组独立公式对拍（给定相同的三芯结构作为条件输入）：8.7/15 kV、240 mm² 时外护套前假定直径 66.0 mm，外护套标称厚度 3.3 mm，最薄点 2.44 mm；26/35 kV 时假定直径 94.7 mm，标称厚度 4.3 mm，最薄点 3.24 mm。3×300 钢带铠装时铠装前假定直径 70.3 mm、铠装后 73.5 mm。逐项数值见产品标准尺寸核对。"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-50","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#已知限制","content":"第 1 部分的内衬层、护套、最薄点及成缆分支尚未全部覆盖；带隔离套或金属套的完整尺寸链尚未接齐。"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-51","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#已知限制","content":"设计输入、厂家上限与实测值分别标记；本核对不批准要求、型号或产品认证。"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-52","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#已知限制","content":"依据库只覆盖文档列出的完整表及条款，不外推、不跨版本补值；标准全文不随软件分发。"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-53","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.standard-check\" />"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/methods/standard-check-54","page_id":"/docs/methods/standard-check","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/standard-check#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.standards-basis\" />"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"page","content":"热网络交叉校核","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","方法与依据"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-0","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","content":"可审计的简化稳态热网络参考方法：原理、公式来源、适用范围、超出范围时的处理、输入要求、验证情况和已知限制。"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-1","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#原理","content":"原理"},"2011":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-2","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"公式来源"},"2012":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-3","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#适用范围","content":"适用范围"},"2013":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-4","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"超出范围时"},"2014":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-5","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#输入要求","content":"输入要求"},"2015":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-6","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#验证情况","content":"验证情况"},"2016":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-7","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#已知限制","content":"已知限制"},"2017":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-8","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#插件清单","content":"插件清单"},"2018":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-9","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","content":"插件 `cablesim.thermal-network`（参考方法 MV-THERMAL）是一个**可审计的简化稳态热网络**，用于在同一份输入上与 IEC 60287 等方法交叉校核。它不是完整的 IEC 60287 实现，不能替代正式计算。"},"2019":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-10","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#原理","content":"电缆各同心层的径向热阻："},"2020":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-11","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#原理","content":"均匀半空间土壤中三根电缆之间的热阻矩阵（镜像法，地表恒温）："},"2021":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-12","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#原理","content":"$h_i$ 为电缆中心埋深，$r_5$ 为电缆外半径，$D_{ij}$ 为两缆中心距，$D'_{ij}$ 为电缆 $i$ 到电缆 $j$ 镜像的距离。导体相对环境的温升向量："},"2022":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-13","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#原理","content":"$\\mathbf{q}_c$ 为各相导体损耗，$\\lambda$ 为屏蔽损耗比，$\\mathbf{d}$ 为介质损耗的温升贡献。导体电阻随温度线性变化，三相温度和电阻逐相求解，用二分法求最热一相刚好达到温限时的电流，即参考载流量。"},"2023":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-14","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"公式是热传导和电路的基本形式，写法与 IEC 60287-2-1 的同心层热阻和镜像法一致，但不是逐条的标准实现。完整推导、单位约定和结果核算见载流量口径与热网络参考。"},"2024":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-15","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"| 计算项   | 公式                                         | 说明                          |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 同心层热阻 | $T_k = \\rho_{th,k}\\ln(r_{k+1}/r_k)/(2\\pi)$ | 金属等效层按热导率 400 W/(m·K) 的假设计算 |","table":"table-0"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-16","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"| 计算项     | 公式                    | 说明         |\n| ------- | --------------------- | ---------- |\n| 土壤自热与互热 | 上面的 $G_{ii}$、$G_{ij}$ | 均匀半空间，地表恒温 |","table":"table-0"},"2026":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-17","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"| 计算项  | 公式                                                       | 说明                                                |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| 交流电阻 | $R_{AC}(\\theta) = R_{20}(1+k_{AC})[1+\\alpha(\\theta-20)]$ | $k_{AC}$ 为输入的交流附加系数；温度系数铜 0.00393、铝 0.00403（1/°C） |","table":"table-0"},"2027":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-18","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"| 计算项     | 公式                                                                                 | 说明           |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| 电容与介质损耗 | $C = 2\\pi\\varepsilon_0\\varepsilon_r/\\ln(r_2/r_1)$，$W_d = 2\\pi f C U_0^2\\tan\\delta$ | $U_0$ 为相对地电压 |","table":"table-0"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-19","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#公式来源","content":"| 计算项 | 公式                                                     | 说明                     |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| 载流量 | 二分法求 $\\max(\\theta_A,\\theta_B,\\theta_C)=\\theta_{limit}$ | 迭代 70 次，搜索上界低于热反馈的奇异阈值 |","table":"table-0"},"2029":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-20","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#适用范围","content":"单回路、三根相同的无铠装单芯电缆；导体屏蔽、绝缘、绝缘屏蔽、金属屏蔽、外护套等同心层；水平或等边三角排列。"},"2030":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-21","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#适用范围","content":"均匀土壤，地表恒温，轴向无限长；三相平衡电流，每相一根电缆。"},"2031":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-22","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#适用范围","content":"交流附加系数和屏蔽损耗比是**输入假设**，不自动计算集肤、邻近效应或护套环流。"},"2032":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-23","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"不符合上述条件时插件拒绝计算，不改用默认值，也不静默修正输入。常见提示："},"2033":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-24","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                      | 情况           |\n| ----------------------- | ------------ |\n| “简化参考仅支持单回路、单截面、单个稳态负荷” | 多回路、多截面或多个工况 |","table":"table-1"},"2034":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-25","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                                      | 情况          |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------- |\n| “简化热网络不支持逐电缆负荷覆盖；请使用带明确损耗输入的 IEC 互热方法。” | 给各电缆单独指定了电流 |","table":"table-1"},"2035":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-26","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                               | 情况            |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| “简化热网络仅支持均匀土壤；回填区或土壤分层计算尚未接入。……” | 敷设截面有回填区或土壤分层 |","table":"table-1"},"2036":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-27","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                    | 情况   |\n| --------------------- | ---- |\n| “简化参考仅支持均匀土壤直埋稳态，无排管” | 排管敷设 |","table":"table-1"},"2037":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-28","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                                | 情况            |\n| --------------------------------- | ------------- |\n| “简化参考仅支持单芯电缆”“简化参考仅支持平衡三相且每相一根电缆” | 三芯电缆、并联或不平衡负荷 |","table":"table-1"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-29","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                        | 情况        |\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\n| “简化参考要求原六层同心结构，不支持铠装或额外层” | 有铠装或其他附加层 |","table":"table-1"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-30","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                     | 情况         |\n| ---------------------- | ---------- |\n| “领域研究需要明确 R20，不采用演示电阻” | 型号缺少导体 R₂₀ |","table":"table-1"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-31","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                    | 情况              |\n| --------------------- | --------------- |\n| “此简化方法要求两层半导电材料热阻率一致” | 导体屏蔽与绝缘屏蔽的热阻率不同 |","table":"table-1"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-32","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"| 提示                           | 情况             |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------- |\n| “坐标不是受支持的平排或等边品字形，不能按模板覆盖坐标” | 电缆位置不是平排或等边品字形 |","table":"table-1"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-33","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#超出范围时","content":"另外：埋深小于电缆外半径的 10 倍、或电缆位置重叠时拒绝计算；给定运行电流超出线性热反馈的稳定范围时拒绝该电流的解（这不是真实电缆热失控阈值的精确判断）；零电流时介质损耗已使温度达到温限，则没有可用的正载流量。运行温度超过 150 °C 时另行警告材料线性外推已失去工程可靠性。"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-34","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#输入要求","content":"导体截面与 R₂₀、各层厚度与热阻率、埋深与排列、土壤热阻率、地表温度、导体温限，以及显式给出的交流附加系数（0–1）和屏蔽损耗系数（0–2）。各参数的单位和范围见下方插件清单。"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-35","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#验证情况","content":"清单中的验证等级为“未经独立验证”，没有声明验证用例。"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-36","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#验证情况","content":"回归测试只保证重构前后数值不变，不是正确性证据。"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-37","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#验证情况","content":"每次求解输出温度方程的最大残差，并核对径向逐层温度与矩阵求得的表面温度一致。"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-38","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#验证情况","content":"用于工程之前，须针对目标电缆和敷设方式，用正式标准文本、厂家结构材料数据、独立实现或参考软件以及实测结果，分别验证电阻、损耗、热阻、温度与载流量。经 CIGRE TB 880 算例逐项核对的方法是 IEC 60287 稳态载流量。"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-39","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#已知限制","content":"不支持排管、空气敷设、回填分区、干燥带、多回路、铠装、外部热源、接头与端部、谐波、暂态、周期与应急负荷，也不做绝缘配合校核。"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-40","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#已知限制","content":"金属屏蔽按连续等效铜圆筒处理，不反映实际铜丝间隙或接触热阻。"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-41","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#已知限制","content":"土壤温度图按电缆中心线热源叠加，靠近电缆表面的数值与矩阵求得的表面温度存在近似差别；该图不是有限元或三维仿真。"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network-42","page_id":"/docs/methods/thermal-network","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/methods/thermal-network#插件清单","content":"<PluginMethods id=\"cablesim.thermal-network\" />"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"page","content":"电缆厂：从结构表到正式规格书","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","快速上手"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-0","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"导入厂家结构表，逐项核对来源与标准尺寸，按统一工况批量算出载流量，再生成规格书。"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-1","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"1. 打开结构表导入页"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-2","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"2. 上传结构表并选择工作表"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-3","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"3. 确认列映射"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-4","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"4. 填写系列声明"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-5","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"5. 核对入库预览"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-6","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#6-确认入库","content":"6. 确认入库"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-7","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#7-批量标准核对","content":"7. 批量标准核对"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-8","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"8. 批量计算载流量"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-9","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#9-查看单个规格的载流量表","content":"9. 查看单个规格的载流量表"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-10","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"10. 生成规格书"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-11","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"接下来"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-12","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"<VideoPlayer kind=\"factory\" />"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-13","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"本篇用随软件提供的人民电缆公开结构表（YJV22-8.7/15 kV 三芯钢带铠装），按真实操作走完电缆厂技术部最常用的一条线：**导入厂家结构表 → 核对 → 载流量表 → 正式规格书**，约 15 分钟。截图来自随安装包提供的示例库，数值都是软件实际算出来的。"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-14","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory","content":"开始前，按下载与安装启动 CableSimPro。"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-15","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"在浏览器地址栏打开 `http://127.0.0.1:8100/resources/cables/structure-import`（地址和端口换成你的服务地址）。这一页是“电缆型号库 · 结构表导入与系列”，上方有“导入结构表、系列与规格、公开样本对照、材料与环境、数据交换”几个标签，导入分五步：选择文件、选择工作表、列映射、系列声明、预览入库。"},"2069":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-16","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#1-打开结构表导入页","content":"<Callout>当前版本侧栏还没有这一页的入口，需要直接输入地址。</Callout>"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-17","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"在“公开样本”里点 **下载人民电缆示例结构表**。导入自己的表时跳过这一步。"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-18","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"点 **选择结构表文件**，选中要导入的文件。支持 `.xlsx`、`.xls`、`.csv`，单个文件不超过 10 MiB，每行一个规格。"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-19","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"文件里有多张表时，在 **工作表** 下拉框里选要导入的那张，本例选“表3 YJV22”。下方列出每一列的列名和示例值，用来确认选对了表。"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-20","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#2-上传结构表并选择工作表","content":"点 **确认工作表，设置列映射**。"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-21","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"软件按列名自动对应目标字段和单位，本例 8 列已经对应。逐列检查右侧的“目标字段与单位”，原表单位不同就在下拉框里改选；“数据起始行”是数据开始的行号。常用的映射可以起名保存，下次在“复用已保存映射”里直接选用。"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-22","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#3-确认列映射","content":"确认后点 **填写系列声明**。"},"2076":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-23","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"系列声明记录这批数据的身份：系列名称、制造商、型号、额定电压、芯数、数据身份和各层材料。页面顶部自动带出原表出处（手册名称、表号和页码）。本例把系列名称改为“人民电器 YJV22-8.7/15 kV 三芯（快速上手）”，其余保持默认。"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-24","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#4-填写系列声明","content":"点 **逐行校验并预览**。"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-25","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"预览逐行标出每个规格是“可入库”“缺项”还是“错误”：缺项的规格可以先保存为草稿，但缺少必需数据就不能计算；有错误的行必须更正或明确排除，否则不能入库。本例 11 行全部可入库。原表没有电阻列的规格，导体电阻取 GB/T 3956—2008 表 2 的标准上限，并注明这不是厂家实测值。"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-26","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#5-核对入库预览","content":"点规格名，可以逐项查看这一行每个数值的来源：原表位置、换算方法版本和可信分档。原表没有列出、按同电压等级公开资料补充的数值（如导体屏蔽厚度）会写明出处，不会冒充厂家数据。"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-27","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#6-确认入库","content":"在预览页底部核对“执行标准版本与来源”，勾选 **确认来源与系列声明**，点 **确认入库 11 个规格**。规格以“草稿 · 待人工核对”的状态进入电缆型号库，都是第 1 版；计算和人工审核在后面分别进行。"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-28","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#7-批量标准核对","content":"点 **打开系列，核对与计算** 进入系列页，勾选“选择全部规格”，点 **批量核对**，在对话框里勾选“确认所选规格与版本”后执行。每个规格都保存一次真实的产品标准尺寸核对运行，结果列出符合项、缺项和依据库尚未收录的项；标准是否符合与人工是否批准分开判断。"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-29","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"仍在系列页，点 **批量计算**，填写统一的计算工况，并在“工况来源”“方法参数来源”里写明每个取值的出处。本例取值如下："},"2083":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-30","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值     |\n| ---- | -------- |\n| 工况名称 | 公开样本直埋条件 |","table":"table-0"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-31","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值             |\n| ---- | ---------------- |\n| 中心埋深 | 0.7 m（原表未列，明确声明） |","table":"table-0"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-32","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目    | 本例取值      |\n| ----- | --------- |\n| 土壤热阻率 | 1.0 K·m/W |","table":"table-0"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-33","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值  |\n| ---- | ----- |\n| 环境温度 | 25 °C |","table":"table-0"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-34","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值  |\n| ---- | ----- |\n| 交流频率 | 50 Hz |","table":"table-0"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-35","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目    | 本例取值 |\n| ----- | ---- |\n| 金属套接地 | 两端接地 |","table":"table-0"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-36","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目     | 本例取值 |\n| ------ | ---- |\n| 护套涡流损耗 | 明确忽略 |","table":"table-0"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-37","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目     | 本例取值 |\n| ------ | ---- |\n| 土壤热阻公式 | 精确式  |","table":"table-0"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-38","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目                  | 本例取值  |\n| ------------------- | ----- |\n| 集肤 / 邻近效应系数 kₛ / kₚ | 1 / 1 |","table":"table-0"},"2092":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-39","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"| 项目   | 本例取值                                    |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 求解控制 | 护套初始温度 70 °C，电流收敛容差 1×10⁻⁸ A，最多 300 次迭代 |","table":"table-0"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-40","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#8-批量计算载流量","content":"勾选确认后执行。本例 10 个规格算出了直埋载流量；**3×50 被拒算**：它的填充与内衬厚度和芯外径之比超出 IEC 60287 图 6 的适用范围，软件写明原因，不硬算。"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-41","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#9-查看单个规格的载流量表","content":"在系列页 3×240 这一行点 **打开型号设计**，左侧选 **载流量表**。刚才的工况已作为一条“已计算”的工况保存；点 **添加工况** 可以加入不同的埋深、热阻率或敷设方式，再点 **计算所选工况**，形成完整的型号载流量表。"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-42","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"工具栏点 **规格书**，再点 **生成规格书**。生成时按需补算结构、电气参数、载流量、短路容量和标准核对五部分结果，已完成的计算会保留。"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-43","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"公开样本只有结构尺寸，没有材料密度、出厂实测值等资料，所以本例提示“结构推导：结构外径或用料缺少完整输入”，并给出阻止发布的项数："},"2097":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-44","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"“审核与发布”页把阻止发布的项分成四类：需要工程师补输入、需要出厂实测值、标准依据未覆盖、人工确认关口。逐项补齐后重新生成，再依次 **采纳为版本草稿 → 提交评审 → 批准**；发布后，“生成规格书”按钮变为 **导出 PDF**。"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-45","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"资料完整的型号可以直接生成。示例库里的“YJV22-8.7/15 3×300”（规格书演示）已补齐结构和材料，点 **生成规格书** 后浏览器直接下载 PDF。下图是该文件中载流量章节的一页；未批准发布前，页眉标明编制草稿。"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-46","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#10-生成规格书","content":"<Callout type=\"warn\">不要为了让规格书生成而填入估计值。缺项应来自厂家实测、图纸或有出处的标准，并在来源里写清楚。</Callout>"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-47","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"结构表导入、系列批量操作与改版：型号库与结构表导入"},"2101":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-48","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"型号设计各部分与规格书审核发布：型号设计"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/factory-49","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/factory","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/factory#接下来","content":"规格书、载流量表、计算书和研究报告：正式交付文件"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"page","content":"研究院：从新建工程到计算书","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","快速上手"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-0","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"新建工程，做 110 kV 电缆直埋载流量研究，改土壤热阻率后对比两次结果，生成并下载计算书。"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-1","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"1. 新建研究，同时新建工程"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-2","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#2-核对直埋敷设和工况","content":"2. 核对直埋敷设和工况"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-3","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"3. 预检并运行"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-4","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"4. 改条件再算一次"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-5","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#5-对比两次运行","content":"5. 对比两次运行"},"2110":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-6","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"6. 生成计算书"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-7","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"接下来"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-8","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"<VideoPlayer kind=\"research\" />"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-9","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"本篇按真实操作走完研究院最常用的一条线：**新建工程 → 直埋载流量研究 → 改条件对比 → 计算书**，约 10 分钟。截图来自随安装包提供的示例库，数值都是软件实际算出来的。"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-10","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research","content":"开始前，按下载与安装启动 CableSimPro，用浏览器打开首页。示例使用“YJQ02-64/110 kV · 1×800（典型结构演示）”电缆，这是一根结构完整、用于演示的 110 kV 铅护套电缆。"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-11","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"点首页右上角的 **新建研究**。"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-12","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"在对话框里依次选择："},"2117":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-13","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**所属工程**：保持“新建工程”，系统会为这次研究新建一个工程；"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-14","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**研究任务**：额定载流量；"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-15","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**研究名称**：直埋载流量；"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-16","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**引用型号版本**：YJQ02-64/110 kV · 1×800（典型结构演示） · 1.0.1；"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-17","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"**计算方法**：IEC 60287 载流量 · 地下稳态。"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-18","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"点 **建立研究**。"},"2123":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-19","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#1-新建研究同时新建工程","content":"型号版本在研究里是固定引用：之后型号库里出现新版本，这个研究仍按选定的版本计算，除非你主动更换。"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-20","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#2-核对直埋敷设和工况","content":"研究页中间是敷设截面：直埋单回、品字形排列，中心埋深 0.752 m。右侧“输入”页列出工况：回路电流 350 A、地表温度 25.0 °C、介质（土壤）热阻率 1.00 K·m/W、导体温限 90.0 °C。输入旁的来源标记说明数值是工程师填写还是由计算得出；改动后要保存才会参与计算。"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-21","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"点工具栏上的 **预检并运行**。运行前预检会检查输入是否完整、工况是否在方法适用范围内，并说明这次在本机还是超算上求解。"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-22","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"如果某一项超出方法范围或缺少必需参数，预检会逐条写明原因，**确认并运行** 按钮不可用。软件不会自己估一个值替你算下去。"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-23","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#3-预检并运行","content":"确认无误后点 **确认并运行**，几秒后结果出现在研究页顶部。本例在 90.0 °C 温限下的允许电流为 944.8 A；按 350 A 运行时最热导体 33.5 °C，距温限还有 56.5 K。"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-24","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"在右侧“输入”页把 **介质热阻率** 改为 1.5 K·m/W，点工具栏的 **保存修改**。"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-25","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"再次 **预检并运行**，确认后运行。"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-26","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#4-改条件再算一次","content":"土壤热阻率变大后散热变差，本例允许电流降到 801.1 A。第一次的结果仍然保存着，研究里标为历史结果，不会被覆盖。"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-27","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#5-对比两次运行","content":"点结果区右上角的 **运行记录**，勾选刚才的两次运行，点 **对比所选运行**。对比表分组列出两次运行的差别，展开“输入差异（SI）”可以看到这次改动的是土壤热阻率；“限制对象”说明两次都是同一根电缆先达到温限。"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-28","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"点工具栏的 **生成计算书**。计算书只引用你选定的、已经保存的运行，不会重新计算；“来源”页列出它引用的运行、宿主对结果一致性的校验和所用方法版本，便于审核时逐项追溯。"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-29","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#6-生成计算书","content":"在“预览”页点 **下载 PDF**，得到客户版计算书。下图是本例下载文件的首页："},"2134":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-30","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"研究里的工况、敷设模板、参数扫描和结果口径，见载流量研究。"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-31","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"IEC 60287 的原理、适用范围和验证依据，见IEC 60287 稳态载流量。"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/quickstart/research-32","page_id":"/docs/quickstart/research","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quickstart/research#接下来","content":"需要有限元温度场或与 IEC 对照时，见仿真研究。"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","参考与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-0","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq","content":"安装启动、原生依赖、插件封签、超算、模型、标准核对与交付文件中常见的问题、原因和处理方法。"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-1","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#安装与启动","content":"安装与启动"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-2","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#端口被占用","content":"端口被占用"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-3","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#windows-提示路径过长","content":"Windows 提示路径过长"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-4","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#提示同一数据目录已有实例在运行","content":"提示同一数据目录已有实例在运行"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-5","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#启动过程中页面或接口返回正在启动","content":"启动过程中页面或接口返回“正在启动”"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-6","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#杀毒软件拦截随包的-nodejs","content":"杀毒软件拦截随包的 Node.js"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-7","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#原生依赖与插件","content":"原生依赖与插件"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-8","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#三维视图或规格书提示缺少-cadquery","content":"三维视图或规格书提示缺少 CadQuery"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-9","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"插件封签或摘要不一致（接口返回 409）"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-10","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#计算与仿真","content":"计算与仿真"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-11","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#超算未配置或不可用时哪些功能仍可用","content":"超算未配置或不可用时，哪些功能仍可用"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-12","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#预检提示超出方法适用范围","content":"预检提示超出方法适用范围"},"2151":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-13","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#结果标为历史结果","content":"结果标为历史结果"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-14","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"标准核对"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#agent-与模型","content":"Agent 与模型"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-16","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#没有配置模型","content":"没有配置模型"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-17","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#agent-页显示agent-对话服务未连接","content":"Agent 页显示“Agent 对话服务未连接”"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-18","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#模型连接失败或超时","content":"模型连接失败或超时"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-19","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#交付文件","content":"交付文件"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-20","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#下载了-pdf是否代表已经审核或发布","content":"下载了 PDF，是否代表已经审核或发布"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-21","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#签栏为什么是空的","content":"签栏为什么是空的"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-22","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/faq#规格书封面写着历史结果","content":"规格书封面写着“历史结果”"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-23","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#端口被占用","content":"| 端口   | 用途         | 处理                                                                                                                                     |\n| ---- | ---------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 8100 | 平台的界面和全部接口 | 先确认是否已经启动过本程序。确需更换时，修改 `release.toml` 的 `[server] port`；从源码运行时执行 `python scripts/run_demo.py --port 8101`，改用 `http://127.0.0.1:8101/`。 |","table":"table-0"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-24","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#端口被占用","content":"| 端口   | 用途                | 处理                                                                                |\n| ---- | ----------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 8111 | Agent 对话服务（只监听本机） | 修改 `[agent] port`（须不同于 `[server] port`），或设置 `[agent] enabled = false` 暂不启动 Agent。 |","table":"table-0"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-25","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#端口被占用","content":"端口被占用时程序在改动数据之前就停止启动，不会自动改用其他端口。"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-26","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#windows-提示路径过长","content":"安装程序按实际文件逐个检查路径长度，超出 260 字符限制时拒绝安装。把 `storage.data_dir` 改为更短的目录（例如 `D:/CableSimPro-data`）后重新安装，不需要修改系统策略。"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-27","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#提示同一数据目录已有实例在运行","content":"一个数据目录同时只能运行一个实例。先关闭已经运行的实例（在其启动窗口按 Ctrl+C），或为第二个实例配置另一个数据目录。"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-28","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#启动过程中页面或接口返回正在启动","content":"启动完成前，工程接口一律返回 `503 RELEASE_STARTING`，避免在仍可能回退的时间窗口里写入工程数据。等待启动窗口提示服务就绪后刷新页面。"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-29","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#杀毒软件拦截随包的-nodejs","content":"安装或启动时提示 Agent 对话服务无法运行，通常是杀毒软件拦截了 `runtime/node/` 中的 `node.exe`。在杀毒软件中信任程序目录后重新启动；暂时不用 Agent 时，在 `release.toml` 中设置 `[agent] enabled = false`。见 Agent 对话服务。"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-30","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#三维视图或规格书提示缺少-cadquery","content":"三维实体、STEP 导出和规格书中的结构计算需要原生 CAD 依赖。"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-31","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#三维视图或规格书提示缺少-cadquery","content":"**离线安装包**已自带这些依赖。仍出现该提示时，说明安装不完整，重新解压安装包并安装。"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-32","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#三维视图或规格书提示缺少-cadquery","content":"**从源码运行**时，在启动器创建的环境中安装原生依赖后重新启动："},"2171":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-33","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"每个插件发行都有封签，记录清单、源码、依赖和展示资源的摘要。运行前平台逐项核对，不一致时拒绝执行并返回 409，常见错误码如下："},"2172":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-34","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"| 错误码                       | 含义                |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `PACKAGE_DIGEST_MISMATCH` | 插件文件或运行依赖与封签记录不一致 |","table":"table-1"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-35","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"| 错误码                          | 含义                |\n| ---------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `HOST_DEPENDENCIES_MISMATCH` | 插件依赖的宿主源码与封签记录不一致 |","table":"table-1"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-36","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"| 错误码                            | 含义             |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------- |\n| `PLUGIN_ASSET_DIGEST_MISMATCH` | 插件展示资源与封签摘要不一致 |","table":"table-1"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-37","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"| 错误码               | 含义         |\n| ----------------- | ---------- |\n| `RELEASE_CHANGED` | 核验期间文件发生变化 |","table":"table-1"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-38","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"| 错误码                     | 含义             |\n| ----------------------- | -------------- |\n| `MODEL_INTEGRITY_ERROR` | 最新发布型号的内容摘要不一致 |","table":"table-1"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-39","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#插件封签或摘要不一致接口返回-409","content":"处理方法：保留完整报错，交给维护人员核对程序和插件版本，必要时重新安装同一发行包。**修复之前不要通过修改工程参数绕过**：封签不一致意味着无法证明计算使用的是经过验证的代码。"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-40","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#超算未配置或不可用时哪些功能仍可用","content":"| 不可用                                     | 仍然可用                                                         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 有限元温度场、暂态、电热耦合、批量仿真等声明为只在超算运行的方法，拿不到新结果 | IEC 60287 等解析计算、参数扫描、输入编辑、标准核对、正式交付导出、备份恢复；已保存且校验通过的仿真结果可以查看 |","table":"table-2"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-41","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#超算未配置或不可用时哪些功能仍可用","content":"只在超算运行的方法遇到超算未配置时，运行前预检会提示配置，不会改到本机计算。配置方法见仿真计算环境。"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-42","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#预检提示超出方法适用范围","content":"每个方法只在其声明的适用范围内计算。预检会逐条列出超出范围的原因（例如截面、排列或敷设方式不在方法覆盖范围内），这时不能运行。调整输入使之落在范围内，或改用覆盖该工况的方法。各方法的范围见方法清单。"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-43","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#结果标为历史结果","content":"保存结果之后，输入、引用的型号版本或方法发行发生了变化。历史结果保留原样，可以查看和比较；需要当前结果时重新运行。升级插件后的具体情形见升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效。"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-44","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"标准核对把型号的结构尺寸与导体电阻逐项与产品标准比较，每一项的判定分为以下几种："},"2183":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-45","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义              | 处理  |\n| --- | --------------- | --- |\n| 满足  | 有完整输入和标准依据，判定满足 | 无   |","table":"table-3"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-46","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义               | 处理                   |\n| --- | ---------------- | -------------------- |\n| 不满足 | 有完整输入和标准依据，判定不满足 | 点“定位结构层”修改结构，保存后重新核对 |","table":"table-3"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-47","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"| 判定   | 含义                                                     | 处理                                       |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 待补数据 | 判定所需的数值缺失，例如材料类别、屏蔽或铠装参数；或标准要求按出厂实测值判定（如绝缘最薄点），设计值不能代替 | 在型号设计中补齐有来源的输入后重新核对；需要实测值的项目在取得出厂检验记录后录入 |","table":"table-3"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-48","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"| 判定  | 含义                            | 处理                               |\n| --- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 未覆盖 | 标准依据库尚未收录该条款或版本，依据栏显示“本库暂未收录” | 由工程师按标准原文人工核对；软件不给出判定，**不能视为满足** |","table":"table-3"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-49","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"不适用于本型号结构的条款不参与判定，收在“要求与标准”的“不适用条款”中。在“规格书 → 审核与发布”中，这些问题按“需要工程师补输入”“需要出厂实测值”“标准依据未覆盖”“需要人工批准”分组列出。"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-50","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#标准核对","content":"标准核对运行失败时，界面显示该次运行的实际错误和缺失字段的位置，按提示补齐输入即可。核对结论与人工批准分开记录，核对通过不代表型号已审核或发布。"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-51","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#没有配置模型","content":"Agent 页提示“还没有配置 AI 模型”，发送消息会被拒绝，不调用任何服务、不产生结果。在“设置 → AI 模型”中填写服务地址、模型名和密钥并测试连接。型号、计算、仿真、交付等其余功能不依赖模型。见接入模型。"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-52","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#agent-页显示agent-对话服务未连接","content":"对话服务没有启动成功或已经退出。查看启动窗口中的原因（端口占用、杀毒软件拦截等），处理后重新启动程序。其余功能不受影响。"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-53","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#模型连接失败或超时","content":"模型请求由平台进程发出。确认服务器能访问模型服务地址，防火墙或代理放行平台进程的出站连接；网络较慢或模型较大时，在“设置 → AI 模型”中调高单次请求超时。"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-54","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#下载了-pdf是否代表已经审核或发布","content":"不代表。正式交付文件只呈现已保存的运行和型号，下载或导出不会提交审核，也不会批准或发布型号。审核与发布在型号设计的“审核与发布”中由人完成并单独记录。见正式交付文件。"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-55","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#签栏为什么是空的","content":"设计、校核、审核、批准四个签栏只填写真实匹配的签核记录。目前只有已批准、且与本次规格书内容一致的型号批准记录可以填入“批准”栏；其他签栏没有独立记录时保持空白，由人工签署。修订作者、操作人或 Agent 提案都不充当签名。"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/reference/faq-56","page_id":"/docs/reference/faq","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/faq#规格书封面写着历史结果","content":"规格书引用的运行在生成后输入或方法发行已变化。在型号设计中重新运行对应通道，再重新生成规格书。"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"page","content":"术语表","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","参考与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-0","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary","content":"CableSimPro 中工程、型号、研究、运行、快照、发行、封签、提案等术语的含义。"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-1","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"工程与对象"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-2","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"计算"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-3","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"来源与可信度"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-4","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"插件与发行"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-5","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"Agent"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-6","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"交付"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-7","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                                    |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工程  | 一项工作的容器，包含线路与敷设布置、研究、运行记录和交付文件。工程的每次保存形成一个修订，可以撤销和回溯。 |","table":"table-0"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-8","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                             |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 型号设计 | 在工程中编辑的一个电缆型号：结构、执行标准、标准依据、电气参数、短路容量、载流量表与规格书。 |","table":"table-0"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-9","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语     | 含义                                                                  |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 电缆型号版本 | 资源库中的固定版本型号，例如“YJV22-8.7/15 kV 3×240 · 1.0.1”。研究引用某个版本，版本发布后内容不再改变。 |","table":"table-0"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-10","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                                        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 系列  | 同一厂家、同一型号族的一组规格，通常由一张厂家结构表导入，例如“人民电器 YJV22-8.7/15 kV 三芯”。 |","table":"table-0"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-11","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 规格  | 系列中的一个具体截面或芯数组合，例如 3×240。每个规格有自己的版本和状态。 |","table":"table-0"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-12","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                                         |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 资源  | 计算会引用的基础资料：材料、部件、结构、敷设模板、计算方案和规则。资源有版本和状态（草稿、已审核、已发布、已停用）。 |","table":"table-0"},"2209":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-13","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#工程与对象","content":"| 术语      | 含义                                             |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 部件与研究模板 | 从已保存型号的部件或成功运行的研究定义冻结得到的参考资料，可以在人工确认后采用到另一个工程。 |","table":"table-0"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-14","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                            |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| 研究  | 一项计算任务的定义：分析类型（如额定载流量）、引用的型号版本、敷设与工况、计算方法及参数。 |","table":"table-1"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-15","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                    |\n| --- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 运行  | 研究的一次执行。每次运行保存输入快照、方法版本和结果，不会被后续修改覆盖。 |","table":"table-1"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-16","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                    |\n| --- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 快照  | 运行开始时冻结的完整输入，连同其来源；以后修改工程不会改变已有运行的快照。 |","table":"table-1"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-17","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                               |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 预检  | 运行前的检查：输入是否完整、是否在方法的适用范围内、在本机还是超算上求解。预检不通过时不能运行。 |","table":"table-1"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-18","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                               |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 试算  | 用当前输入（包括未保存的修改）快速计算一次，结果标为“未保存”，不生成运行记录，也不能用于交付。 |","table":"table-1"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-19","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                        |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 参数扫描 | 把一个输入按给定范围逐点真实计算，得到结果随该参数变化的曲线；失败的点保留为缺口。 |","table":"table-1"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-20","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                   |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 方法对比 | 比较本研究中已保存的一个基准运行和一至四个对照运行的输入差异与结果差异。 |","table":"table-1"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-21","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                               |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- |\n| 问询选型 | 给定目标电流，对一组候选型号逐一计算并按判定排序，给出推荐型号。 |","table":"table-1"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-22","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                 |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 收敛研究 | 有限元结果的网格与计算域逐级加密，连续两级变化都小于门槛时才算收敛。 |","table":"table-1"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-23","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 当前结果 / 历史结果 | 当前结果对应现在的输入、型号版本和已安装的方法；三者之一变化后，原结果成为历史结果，保留原样，可查看和比较。 |","table":"table-1"},"2220":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-24","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语      | 含义                                                      |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 方法 / 能力 | 插件提供的一项计算功能，例如“IEC 60287 稳态载流量”。每项能力有方法版本、适用范围、限制和验证等级。 |","table":"table-1"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-25","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                              |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 验证等级 | 方法的验证程度，例如参考算例核对、交叉校核、未经独立验证。未经独立验证的能力只作参考研究使用。 |","table":"table-1"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-26","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                |\n| ---- | --------------------------------- |\n| 求解位置 | 方法在本机运行还是提交到超算（Slurm 集群）运行，由插件声明。 |","table":"table-1"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-27","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#计算","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 核时  | 超算作业消耗的计算量（核数 × 小时），设置中可限定单批和累计上限。 |","table":"table-1"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-28","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语     | 含义                                             |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| 来源（出处） | 每个数值的依据：厂家资料、标准依据、文献资料、工程师填写或推导，并注明表号、页码等定位信息。 |","table":"table-2"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-29","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                         |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 可信分档 | 对数值可信程度的标记，例如原表实测、标准限值、工程补充、参考。不同分档不会混在一起。 |","table":"table-2"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-30","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语    | 含义                                        |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 标准依据库 | 随插件发行的离线标准数据：尺寸、电阻、试验数值及原页出处。只覆盖已逐格核验的条款。 |","table":"table-2"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-31","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语     | 含义                                    |\n| ------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 本库暂未收录 | 标准依据库尚未包含某条款或版本。相应核对项显示为“未覆盖”，需要人工核对。 |","table":"table-2"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-32","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                              |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 缺项  | 计算或核对所需、但尚未提供的输入。软件列出缺项，不用推测值补齐。标准核对中显示为“待补数据”。 |","table":"table-2"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-33","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#来源与可信度","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 未覆盖 | 方法或依据库不包含的条款、工况或分支。软件不给出判定，不能视为满足。 |","table":"table-2"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-34","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 插件  | 提供计算方法的独立模块。平台本身不包含算法，所有计算方法都来自插件。 |","table":"table-3"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-35","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                                 |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发行  | 插件或安装包的一个版本，例如插件发行 1.8.6。发行中可以包含多项能力，每项能力有自己的方法版本。 |","table":"table-3"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-36","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                     |\n| --- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 封签  | 发行时记录的清单、源码、依赖和资源的摘要。运行前逐项核对，不一致时拒绝执行。 |","table":"table-3"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-37","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                    |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发行摘要 | 封签内容的摘要值，保存在每次运行中，用于判断结果是否仍对应当前安装的发行。 |","table":"table-3"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-38","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#插件与发行","content":"| 术语   | 含义                                                                 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 构建编号 | 离线安装包的唯一标识（build_id），由包内全部不可变文件计算得出；`/api/release-info` 可查询当前构建编号。 |","table":"table-3"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-39","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语    | 含义                               |\n| ----- | -------------------------------- |\n| Agent | 工作台内的对话式助手，读取工程数据、调用计算插件并提出修改方案。 |","table":"table-4"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-40","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                       |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 技能  | Agent 处理一类任务的工作说明，例如载流量研究、结构表导入、规格书与计算书。 |","table":"table-4"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-41","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                        |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 提案  | Agent 提出的一次写操作（建立、修改、运行或导出），以待审卡片显示，内容固定。 |","table":"table-4"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-42","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语      | 含义                                    |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 接受 / 拒绝 | 人对提案的决定。接受后平台按与工作台相同的路径执行；拒绝则不写入任何数据。 |","table":"table-4"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-43","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语    | 含义                                                  |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| 上下文压缩 | 长对话时 Agent 自动概括较早的内容，保留目标、进度、待审提案和关键量，完整记录仍保存在原对话中。 |","table":"table-4"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-44","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#agent","content":"| 术语       | 含义                                       |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 对话服务（边车） | 运行 Agent 对话的本机进程，随平台启动和停止，只监听本机，不接触模型密钥。 |","table":"table-4"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-45","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语     | 含义                                                 |\n| ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 正式交付文件 | 由已保存的运行和型号生成的规格书、计算书、载流量表和研究报告（PDF / Excel），不重新计算。 |","table":"table-5"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-46","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语    | 含义                                     |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 正文与追溯 | 正文呈现结论和工程前提；追溯章节列出每个数值的原始值、单位换算、修约与来源。 |","table":"table-5"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-47","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                  |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 签栏  | 设计、校核、审核、批准四个签字栏，只填写真实匹配的签核记录，缺签留空。 |","table":"table-5"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-48","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语          | 含义                                                                            |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 客户版 / 内部审核版 | 规格书和计算书的两种版本。内部审核版另含完整输入与诊断，缺项随文列出；客户版须补齐缺项，或由人声明发布范围。Agent 对话中分别称为客户稿和内部审阅稿。 |","table":"table-5"},"2245":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-49","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语  | 含义                                              |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 修约  | 按 GB/T 8170-2008 把数值修约到规定的显示精度，只作用于显示，不改变保存的结果。 |","table":"table-5"},"2246":{"id":"/docs/reference/glossary-50","page_id":"/docs/reference/glossary","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/reference/glossary#交付","content":"| 术语    | 含义                            |\n| ----- | ----------------------------- |\n| 审核与发布 | 型号规格书的人工审核、批准和发布流程，与文件下载分开记录。 |","table":"table-5"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/releases","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"page","content":"发布说明","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","参考与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/releases-0","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases","content":"当前版本包含的功能，以及最近一轮更新的内容。"},"2249":{"id":"/docs/releases-1","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#最近一轮更新","content":"最近一轮更新"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/releases-2","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"离线安装包自带 Agent 对话（#68）"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/releases-3","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#agent-对话接入工作台63","content":"Agent 对话接入工作台（#63）"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/releases-4","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"工作台四条主线（#67）"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/releases-5","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"温度收敛容差按温差显示（#65）"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/releases-6","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"正式交付文件的显示规则（#66）"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/releases-7","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#收尾修正70","content":"收尾修正（#70）"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/releases-8","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#本版本包含","content":"本版本包含"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/releases-9","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#安装与运行","content":"安装与运行"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/releases-10","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"电缆型号"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/releases-11","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#载流量与仿真","content":"载流量与仿真"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/releases-12","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#交付","content":"交付"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/releases-13","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#agent","content":"Agent"},"2262":{"id":"/docs/releases-14","page_id":"/docs/releases","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases#文档","content":"文档"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/releases-15","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases","content":"当前为开发中的版本，宿主版本号 0.1.0 系列，工程输入格式第 1 版（`cablesim.domain/1`）。在软件“设置 → 关于”中可以看到宿主版本、输入格式，发行包的 `/api/release-info` 还会返回构建编号和源码提交。各计算插件的版本见方法清单。"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/releases-16","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"安装包带有固定版本的官方 Node.js 24.22.3 和 Agent 对话服务，安装和运行都不需要联网，也不需要系统中预装 Node.js 或 npm。"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/releases-17","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"`release.toml` 新增 `[agent]` 一节：`enabled`（默认 `true`）、`port`（默认 `8111`）。"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/releases-18","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"对话服务只监听本机，拿不到任何模型密钥；没有启动成功时，工作台其余功能照常可用。"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/releases-19","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"模型只需配置一处，优先顺序为“设置 → AI 模型” > `release.toml [model]` / `CABLESIM_LLM_*` > `CABLE_STUDIO_MODEL_*`。"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/releases-20","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"回退到不含 Agent 的旧版本前，须先从 `release.toml` 删除 `[agent]` 一节。"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/releases-21","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#离线安装包自带-agent-对话68","content":"详见 Agent 对话服务。"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/releases-22","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent-对话接入工作台63","content":"工作台内的 Agent 对话：读取工程、研究、型号与运行结果；每一次建立、修改、运行和导出都是固定内容的提案，须由人在对话中接受后执行。"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/releases-23","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent-对话接入工作台63","content":"对话中建立研究、重算与对比、编制载流量表、核对型号并生成计算书和规格书；计算书与规格书经正式交付服务输出，含四个签栏和追溯页。"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/releases-24","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent-对话接入工作台63","content":"对话中导入厂家结构表：上传原件、保存预览、草稿入库、标准核对四步，逐步人工接受。"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/releases-25","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent-对话接入工作台63","content":"长对话自动压缩；上下文窗口与最大输出在“设置 → AI 模型”中设置。"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/releases-26","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"载流量研究、型号设计、资源库、仿真四条主线可以完整地用鼠标和键盘操作。"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/releases-27","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"研究页直接导出正式交付文件（PDF / Excel）：固定保存来源，人工填写文件编号与版次，保留四个签栏。"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/releases-28","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"查看已保存的选型运行时，所选候选与其运行、工况一起固定，结果、布置图、模型和返回操作都对应同一候选；保存的结构只读，右侧当前草稿与撤销保持独立。"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/releases-29","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"“电缆型号版本”页新增“导入厂家结构表”（XLS / XLSX / CSV，五步向导）和“提取厂家 PDF”两个入口。"},"2278":{"id":"/docs/releases-30","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"型号设计中标准核对运行失败时，显示该次运行的实际错误和缺失字段的位置。"},"2279":{"id":"/docs/releases-31","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#工作台四条主线67","content":"资源编辑器支持“文献资料”来源；宿主新增密度、电阻率、体积热容和无量纲四类物理量。"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/releases-32","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"迭代计算的温度收敛容差是温差，现在以 K 显示和输入（此前误按绝对温度显示为带 −273.15 偏移的 °C）。初始温度、环境温度等绝对温度仍以 °C 显示。计算本身不受影响。涉及的插件发行："},"2281":{"id":"/docs/releases-33","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"| 插件                             | 新发行   |\n| ------------------------------ | ----- |\n| 电缆有限元仿真（`cablesim.simulation`） | 1.7.2 |","table":"table-0"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/releases-34","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"| 插件                                 | 新发行   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----- |\n| IEC 60287 载流量（`cablesim.iec60287`） | 1.2.1 |","table":"table-0"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/releases-35","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"| 插件                                | 新发行   |\n| --------------------------------- | ----- |\n| 混合载流量研究（`cablesim.hybrid-rating`） | 1.1.1 |","table":"table-0"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/releases-36","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#温度收敛容差按温差显示65","content":"| 插件                                    | 新发行   |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- |\n| COMSOL 参考对照（`cablesim.comsol-bridge`） | 1.0.4 |","table":"table-0"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/releases-37","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"显示政策升级为 `cablesim.engineering-display/2`："},"2286":{"id":"/docs/releases-38","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"热阻率、热阻等含温差的复合单位按 IEC 60287 写 K：K·m/W、W/(m·K)、J/(kg·K)、J/(m³·K)；绝对温度（°C）和温度系数（1/°C）不变。"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/releases-39","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"正文不用 E 记数法：电容写 μF/km，电感写 mH/km，电阻率写 Ω·mm²/m，其余数值写普通小数。"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/releases-40","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"规格书正文只列结构尺寸和每公里用料；建模长度、模型体积和材料密度移到追溯章节。"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/releases-41","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#正式交付文件的显示规则66","content":"详见正式交付文件。"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/releases-42","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#收尾修正70","content":"标准依据库尚未收录的条款统一显示“本库暂未收录”。标准核对插件发行 1.8.7，方法版本 1.8.5 不变，判定不变。"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/releases-43","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#收尾修正70","content":"插件发行只改参数的显示单位、换算比例或偏移（SI 单位不变）时，属于展示变化，不再使已保存的结果变为历史结果；#65 改正温度容差显示后，已保存的有限元与电热耦合运行仍为当前结果。见升级后已保存的结果是否仍然有效。"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/releases-44","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#收尾修正70","content":"修约进位到更高一位数量级时，按新的数量级保留四位有效数字，例如 9.99995 Ω/km 显示为 10.00；安装包附带的校验程序按同一规则核对。"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/releases-45","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#收尾修正70","content":"资源编辑器可以录入长度、面积、温度、温差、线电阻、热阻率、热导率、电流、频率、密度、电阻率、体积热容和无量纲参数。"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/releases-46","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#安装与运行","content":"Windows 10 / 11 x64 与 Linux x86_64 离线安装包：自带 Python 3.12 运行时、Node.js 运行时和全部依赖，安装与计算全程离线，不需要管理员权限。"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/releases-47","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#安装与运行","content":"升级前自动快照工程库，健康检查失败自动恢复；支持回退到上一版本。"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/releases-48","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#安装与运行","content":"工程库备份与恢复（界面、命令行与接口）。"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/releases-49","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"厂家结构表导入：XLS / XLSX / CSV，工作表选择、列映射保存与复用、系列声明、逐行预览与逐项来源，人工确认后入库。填写系列声明时即检查同名系列，入库报错显示在对应按钮旁。"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/releases-50","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"厂家 PDF 资料提取：逐页识别参数，保留页码与原文位置，候选值经人工逐项核对。"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/releases-51","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"型号系列：批量标准核对、批量载流量计算、批量审核和独立改版；批量操作的结果显示在工具栏下方。"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/releases-52","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"公开样本对照：各规格共用的说明在表格上方只写一次。"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/releases-53","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"部件与研究模板：把已保存型号的部件或成功运行的研究定义冻结为参考草稿，人工确认后采用到另一个工程；冻结证据按工程单位显示。"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/releases-54","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#电缆型号","content":"型号设计：结构、执行标准、标准尺寸核对、电气参数、短路容量、载流量表、规格书的生成、评审与发布。"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/releases-55","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#载流量与仿真","content":"IEC 60287 稳态载流量：多回路直埋、排管与矩形回填，单芯与独立屏蔽三芯，护套与铠装损耗，交叉热源降额。"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/releases-56","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#载流量与仿真","content":"GB 50217 附录 D 载流量校正；简化热网络交叉校核。"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/releases-57","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#载流量与仿真","content":"有限元温度场、暂态、护套损耗与电热耦合（Slurm 超算），与 IEC 的对照及收敛证据。"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/releases-58","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#载流量与仿真","content":"运行记录、两次运行对比、参数扫描、问询选型。"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/releases-59","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#交付","content":"计算书、规格书、载流量表和研究报告的正式交付文件：固定来源预览，PDF / Excel 导出，四个签栏与追溯章节，支持按工程或系列批量导出。"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/releases-60","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#交付","content":"研究页和型号设计页直接导出，也可以经正式交付接口集成。"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/releases-61","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent","content":"工作台内的 Agent 对话，接入 OpenAI 兼容接口的模型，包括内网私有化部署的模型。"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/releases-62","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#agent","content":"离线安装包自带 Agent 对话服务。"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/releases-63","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#文档","content":"本文档站点随代码仓库构建，可离线部署，见部署本文档站点。"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/releases-64","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#文档","content":"新增常见问题与术语表。"},"2313":{"id":"/docs/releases-65","page_id":"/docs/releases","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases#文档","content":"已知限制见已知限制。"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"page","content":"已知限制","breadcrumbs":["CableSimPro 文档","参考与发布"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-0","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations","content":"当前版本在部署、界面、方法和交付上的已知限制。"},"2316":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-1","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"部署与安全"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-2","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations#界面","content":"界面"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-3","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations#数据","content":"数据"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-4","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"计算方法"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-5","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/releases/limitations#agent","content":"Agent"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-6","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"**没有账号与权限管理**。访问到服务的人都可以读写全部工程，只能在单机或受信任的内网中使用，不要暴露到公网。见内网部署。"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-7","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"安装包只支持 Windows 10 / 11 x64 和 glibc 兼容的 Linux x86_64，不支持 ARM，也不保证所有 Linux 发行版。"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-8","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"一个数据目录同时只能运行一个实例。"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-9","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"Agent 对话服务异常退出后不会自动重启；工作台其余功能继续可用，重新启动程序即可恢复。"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-10","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"Linux 版随包的 Node.js 需要系统提供 libstdc++，并满足安装前核对的最低 glibc 版本。"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-11","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#部署与安全","content":"Agent 对话记录（`数据目录/agent/`）不在工程库备份范围内，需要保留时单独备份。"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-12","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#界面","content":"“电缆型号库 · 结构表导入与系列”页面在侧栏中没有单独入口，从“资源 → 电缆型号版本”页的“导入厂家结构表”进入。"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-13","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#界面","content":"标准核对的判定写作“待补数据”，方案对比中同一类情况写作“缺项”，两处含义相同。"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-14","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#数据","content":"公开厂家目录只有结构尺寸，缺少材料密度、出厂实测值等资料；这类型号可以导入、核对和计算载流量，但补齐资料并通过评审前不能发布规格书。"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-15","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#数据","content":"示例库中标有“演示”的型号和工程用于核对文档与计算流程，不代表厂家产品承诺。"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-16","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#数据","content":"结构表导入生成的型号，其结构层用途等字段尚无逐项出处，目前不能创建为参考部件；研究模板目前只支持 IEC 60287 稳态载流量的单工况研究。"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-17","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"每种方法的完整限制写在插件清单中，并显示在对应的方法页："},"2333":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-18","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"| 方法        | 主要限制                                            |\n| --------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| IEC 60287 | 地下稳态、恒温地表；不支持分层土壤、多介质分区和土壤干燥；部分单芯多回路排列需要外部损耗系数。 |","table":"table-0"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-19","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"| 方法          | 主要限制                                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| GB 50217 校正 | 仅 10 kV 及以下、单根基准；不支持排管、桥架、多层、回填和外部热源；D.0.6 / D.0.7 未实现。 |","table":"table-0"},"2335":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-20","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"| 方法  | 主要限制                                |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 热网络 | 仅单回路三根相同无铠装单芯电缆；附加损耗系数为输入假设；只作交叉校核。 |","table":"table-0"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-21","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"| 方法  | 主要限制                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 有限元 | 需要 Slurm 超算集群；二维截面模型，不含三维端部、绞合和土壤水分迁移。 |","table":"table-0"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/releases/limitations-22","page_id":"/docs/releases/limitations","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/releases/limitations#计算方法","content":"| 方法   | 主要限制                                      |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 标准核对 | 仅已核验的 XLPE 结构与第 2 类导体 R₂₀；未收录的标准与条款标为未覆盖。 |","table":"table-0"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/rele